<p. 1a> oṃ namaḥ śrīmāhāvairocanaḥ vajrasatvāyaḥ || śrīsatguruvye namaḥ || 
oṃ namo ratna(?)trayāya || oṃ namaḥ śrīsarvvabuddhabodhisatvebhyo || 
oṃ namo bhagavate āryyaśrīmāhāpratyaṃgirāyaiḥ || 

śrīmadyamadviṣamaśeṣa guṇaprastuti saṃvarttakāra navanīlakānti || 
vaktratradyokuliśa khaḍgadhara sakarttiñcakrābjakharppara tṛnmanasānnamāmi ||

evaṃ mayā śrutamekasmin samaye bhagavān || deveṣu trāyastriśeṣu sarvvadevaḥ 
nandanavane viharatismaḥ ||

<p. 1b> maṇisuvarṇa śivaraśāṣāratā vanaspati ||
gulmauṣadhi kamalotpara || karṇikālavakuvalayatilakāśokamāndāra kuvalaya 
campaka nāgapuṣpādibhirnnānāvidhairupaśobhita || kalpavṛkṣa samalaṃkṛte || 
nānālaṃkāravibhuṣite || nānāmṛgādipacchigaṇa nikūjiteḥ || tūryye 
kuṇḍaterṇabherī prabhitini praṇadite || śakra brahmādidevānāmindreṇa 
devāpsarābhī nānāvidhābhivikrīḍiteḥ || sarvvabuddhadharmmasaṃgha

<p. 2a> boddhisatvādhiṣṭhiteḥ ||
sarvvaśakra brahmādideva vidyādharadevāpsarābhīḥ ||
sadā bhagavato mahāmune boddhisatvaḥ vidyātayi tu vārān ||
parṣatkoṭinī yuta satasahasrairaṣṭābhīḥ || tadyathā || 
apratibhānanāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya ||
vipulaśrīnāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya ||
samantaśrīnāma bodhisatvāye mahāsatvāya ||
anantaśrīnāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya ||
sumantaśrīnāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya ||
kamalaśrīnāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya ||
mahāmatiśrīnāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya ||
divākaraśrīnāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya ||
vividhaśrīnāma bodhisatvāya ma

<p. 2b> hāsatvāya ||
aśyeṣaśrīnāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya ||
mañjuśrīnāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya ||
vajahastaśrīnāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya ||
cakrahastaśrīnāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya ||
samantaśrīnāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya ||

evaṃ pramukhairavaivarttikā bodhisatvamahāsatvasaṃghairanantā paryyantai ||
satkṛto gurukṛto'rcitoḥ supravarjjitoḥ mahata ||
parṣaṅganamadhye mahāpratyaṃgirā || padmāmane niṣarṇa || 
sarvvatathāgata racanā bhāvanā samāpannaḥ || 
uṣṇīṣa vyavalokitanāmasamāddhi samāpadyati sma ||
samanantaramevāpāya trayasaṃtatī vimokṣataṃ nāma mahābodhisatva ||
raśmispharaṇa

<p. 3a> naikamālāsorṇākosāniścārayat || sarvvapravacanānāmādivākyaṃ 
karttranuvādaṃ || bhagavatā hi parivānāvasthāyo muktamasākṣātakṛtaṃ ||
tena trisāhasra mahāsāhaśra lokadhāturavabhāṣitaṃ ||
tenāvabhāsena sarvvasatvāścite kleśābaṃdhanā mocayitvā ||
pṛṭhak pṛṭhak ḥ saṃprāptānānandanavatava || samantādavabhāsayitvā || 
nānāpūjā meghaiḥ pūjayitvā || 

deva nāga yakṣa gandharvvā sura garūḍa kinnara mahoraga 
kuṃbhāṇḍāpasarādi manuṣyāmanuṣya śataśahasra pradakṣinī kṛtye śirasā 
vanditvā || bhagavantaḥ sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa sītāntapatrā nānāparājitā 
mahāpratyaṃgirā purastādvimalamāsane rūpariniṣarṇayaivamāhūḥ ||

<p. 3b> aho buddha aho budhaḥ buddhasya dharmmaśobhanaṃ || tatkṛtya hetoḥ || 
asmākaṃ mahāpratyagirā bodhicaryyā pratisthāpanañca ||

atha ṣalubhagavān paṃñcamātṛbhīḥ bhikṣuśatai ||
mahatā bodhisatvagaṇena sārddhaṃ || tasminasamaya sambatkalaiśca ||
devaputrā bhagavantaṃ paryyūpāśayanti smaḥ ||
tatra khalu bhagavān buddhasatva urnākośādi mānimantrapadāni niścaranti sma ||

oṃ namo buddhāya || oṃ namo dharmmāya || oṃ namaḥ saṃghāya || oṃ namo 
bhagavatyai aparimita guṇapratibhāna vyūhātita kalpāyaḥ tathā gatāyārhate 
saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya || oṃ namo bhagavate gunaratnavyuha

<p. 4a> śrīkalpāya tathāgatāyā'rhate saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya || 
oṃ namo bhagavate sahasreśvarameghagarjjita pratibhānavyuha śrīnāma 
tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya || 
oṃ namo bhagavate sūryyottamavyuhaprabhāsa śrītejorājāya tathāgatāyā'rhate 
saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya || oṃ namo bhagavate asaṃkhyakalpakoṭisamudrānīta 
buddhāya tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya || 
oṃ namo bhagavate śubhakanakavyūha śrītejo nirbhāsāya tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya || oṃ namo bhagavate sarvvadharmmatā vikurvita śrīrājāya 
tathā gatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya || 

ityeṣāṃ devānāṃ buddhānāṃ bhagavantapramukhaṃ stutiṃ kṛtvā || 
namaskṛtvāmāvarttayet || oṃ namo buddhāya ||

<p. 4b> oṃ namo dharmmāya || oṃ namaḥ saṃghāya || 
oṃ namaḥ śrīsarvvabuddha bodhisatvebhyoḥ || 

śrīmantī śrīsamavande sarvaḥ sarvasaṃpatsuṣodayaṃ ||
bhavadūrgatirnānāḥ cintāratnamivāhūtaṃ || 

atraiva sādhanasaṃparkaḥ pūrvācāryyarihodita || 
kiṃtu vistarabhirūcāṇāḥ saṃkṣiptamupadṛsyate || 

iha khalu sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa sītāntapatrā nāmāparājitā mahāpratyaṃgirā || 
mahāvidyārājñi trisamayarāje mantramaṇḍale vā || viddhivallabdhādhikāro 
mantritadukṣasamaya samvarasya mahātmanaḥ || namaḥ saptānāṃ 
saṃmyaksaṃbuddhakoṭināṃ || oṃ namo maitreya pramukhānāṃ bodhisatvānāṃ 
mahāsatvānāṃ || śaśrāvakasaṃghānāṃ || namo loke'rhatāṇāṃ ||

<p. 5a> namo śrātāpannānāṃ || namo sakṛḍāgāmināṃ || namo 
lokyasaṃmyaggatānāṃ || namo saṃmyakpratipannānāṃ || namo deva ṛṣīnāṃ || 
namo sāpānugrahaṃ samarthānāṃ || namo siddhavidyādharānāṃ || namo 
devabrahmane | namo indrāya || namo bhagavate rudrāya || namo umāpatisahitāya || 
namo bhagavate nārāyanāya || pañcamahāmudrā namaskṛtāya || namo bhagavate 
mahākālāya || tripūranagaravidrāvanakarāya || adhimuktika kasmin 
mahāśmaśānanivāsitāya || namo bhagavate mātṛgaṇa namaskṛtāya || namo 
sarvvadevavanditāya || namo bhagavate sarvvadevapūjitāya || 

namo bhagavate tathāgatakulasya || namo bhagavate maṇikulasye || namo bhagavatye 
rāgakulasya ||

<p. 5b> namo bhagavatye dveṣakulasya || namo bhagavatye mohakulasya || 

