māhāpratyaṃgirā || pratyakṣadevatā sarvvamāra vidhvaṃsitā || vajradhara 
vajrapāṇi dvayaṃ || mahāpratyaṃgirā devatā'nubhāśrutyā || 

bhagavānāha || sādhū sādhū vajradhara vajrapāṇi || pratyaṃgirā 
devasyā'nubhāvohaṃ kathāyanti sma || ādau tāvaddūraṃ gamābhūvane ||

