tasyāḥ parisphatāni caḥ dṛśyante prabhayākira || 

avircirviṣayā yāvat ḥ bhavāgra suddhameva ca || 
buddhakṣatrā sthitāḥ sarvveḥ ye satvānāṃ khaḍgatitā || 

dharmmabhāṣaṃnti ye kecit ḥ janmanībandhanāśanaṃ || 
śṛnvaṃtyepi ca ye kecidbuddhajñānavidāmbanā || 

ye kecidbhikṣu bhikṣuṇyūḥ pāśako pāśikā gaṇaḥ ||

<p. 22a> bodhisatvā mahāsatvāḥ yogāścāśca yogima || 
prāptā phalāśca ye kecit daprāptaliphanojanā ||

dhāturatnamayāstupāḥ chatra dhvaja patākina || 
athā śuddhodhisatvāsyaḥ maitrayasya mahātmanaḥ || 

nintāmaṅgala sampannāḥ jagatraya vimohinī || 
nimirttamidamācāryyaḥ kṛtyaṃ tathāgatena tu || 

na ca kiṃ kāranaṃ rūpaṃḥṅkahetuśca bhaviṣyati || 
ko visarjjayituṃ svarthaḥ samarthostyatra buddhimān || 

satvahaṃ paripṛccheyaṃḥ tata samarthaṃ mṛtikṛtaṃ || 
dhīmatān dhīdhano'yaṃ śrīḥ mañjuśrīḥ śrīmatāṃparaḥ || 

vahubuddhasahaśrāṇāṃḥ dṛṣṭā pūrvva hyapāśitaḥ || 
kumārabhūtajainajñāḥ bahupuṇyāni lopita || 
pūrveṣāmapi buddhānāṃḥ jñānavānsa bhaviṣyati ||

<p. 22b> mānaśītī samacintaḥ sarvvajña śrīmatāmbara || 
tatpṛcche yaṃ hi lokānāṃḥ mabhilāṣapraśidhaye || 

athāsanāt samutthāyoḥttarā saṃgasamudvahan || 
maitraiya parṣadātmadhyaḥ prapacchamañju ghoṣakaṃ || 

mañjuśrī śrīmabhāśreṣṭaḥ ko hyetu pratyayaśvakaḥ || 
tatsarvvamvandatāṃ vīraḥ vada me jñānasāgara || 

evamuktetha maitrai yaḥ pratyaṃgirā pratyudā haret || 
pratyaṃgirā bhūta pūrvāhiḥ mayā dṛṣṭamabhustathā || 

buddhānā boddhisatvānāṃḥ śrāvakānāṃñca parṣadān || 
diksaṃprakāsito rasmi naḥ tathāgatenamocite || 

anusmarāmatite dhvaṃḥnya saṃkhyayeśca kalpakaiḥ || 
yadāśītena kālenaḥ samayanātha samūttamaṃ || 

sugato lokavidbuddhoḥ vidyācarana sayutaḥ ||

<p. 23a> bhagavānudapādehaṃḥścandrasūryyapradipakaḥ || 

loke tathāgato nāmaḥ purūṣadamyasārathī || 
devānāñca manuṣyānāṃḥ sāstānā dharmmadesaka || 

ādau madhya ca kalyānaṃ paryyavaśānte kalyānaṃ ||
svarthaṃ suvyañjanaṃḥ kevalaṃ pariśuddha || 

paryyavadāta brahmacaryyaḥ saṃprakāsayati sma || 

yadyukta śrāvakānāṃḥ caturāryya satye saṃyutaṃ || 
evaṃ pramukhairavaivarttikāḥ bodhisatvasaṃghairanantāpayyantraiḥ || 
uṣṇīṣa vyavalokitaṃḥ nāma samādhi samāpadyate sma || 

iha khalu trisamayarāje mahāmantramaṇḍala || 
bodhivallavo vidhivallavodhikāro mantri || tadukṣasamayasamvarastha || pūrvvasya 
vācikiṣu pardyatāraṃnyādiṣu || guhāgṛhārāmaraya

<p. 23b> nādiṣu cāpi || viviku vijaneṣu manorameṣu vasana || ādau tāvadimā 
sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā || nāmāparājitā || 
mahāvajraśṛṃkharāyā māhāpratyaṃgirāyā anubhāvyena || sarvvadeva 
sarvvamānavasya bhūto bhavati || mahāpratyaṃgirā mūlavidyā mantra || 
vajrāgato nāma samādhi samāpadyate sma || tatraḥ sarvvatathā gata 
buddhapratimāyā agnito maṇḍala || puṣpābhi kīrṇa kṛtvā praṇamya 
bodhivimutpādya || sarvvabuddho bodhisatvebhya ātmānaṃ niryyātyā || 
tatpranaṃmyālaṃmbanajāmatyasena sahasraṃ jāpayiṣyati || tataḥ 
sarvvamantrāṇāṃ lakṣajāpaḥ kṛtā kṛtā bhavanti || sarvvarakṣādi mantrā 
cāsya siddhā bhavanti || tatreyaṃ vidhā || namaḥ sarvvabuddhānāṃ

<p. 24a> bodhisatvānāṃḥ || amalāmalahākā antāḥ sasutāḥ sarvvajināḥ || 
asimaniṣṭhā varadā mama hetu || attṛdānaṃ varamagyre sama sarvvadā anantā || 
tatra me vajrapadā || arare asamamanantānanta dharmmate || khana (2) mahāvirācareḥ 
sama (2) amahavahāvaleḥ kaṇa (2) mahāgnike || ha ha ha havajrāṃkayeḥ dhara (2) hūṁ 
hūṁ maṇḍalagavamarāgnavikramai || kuru (2) turu (2) hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ (2) svāhā ||
oṃ hūṁ bhrūṁ hrūṁ hrīṁ kṣroṁ sarvvathā sarvva hiḥ jvala (2) agna agnagnīṇī hūṁ hūṁ 
phaṭ (2) svāhā || 

tataḥ sarvvakarmmāvaraṇakṣayārtha || sarvvatathāgatahṛdayaṃ satākṣaraṃ 
tanaivavidhinā aṣṭasahasraṃ japet || sarvvamāravidhvaṃsaṇī || 
sarvvadharmmaduḥkhanīnaṃtaryyādikaṃ || karmmāvaranaṃ prahīyate iñca tataḥ 
||

<p. 24b> namaste yadvikānāṃ sarvvatathāgatānāṃ || sarvvatrā pratihatā vyāpti 
dharmmatā valināṃ || aṃ asamasamantanto vāpti śāmaṇiḥ hara (2) smara (2) 
navigatarāga buddhadharmmasaṃghate || sara (2) samavarāḥ hasa (2) traya (2) gagaṇa 
sadālakṣaṇaḥ jvala (2) nasāgare svāhā || 

tataḥ svaparātyudayasādhanī game vaṃ || pūrvvasye oṃ vidhimanutiṣṭhata || 
tatrādau prācare cotthāya sarvvabuddha bodhisatvānasvāmito yatra evaṃ 
praṇaṃmyata || atha vajradhara vajrapāṇi evamaṣṭādaśalokadhātuṣṭananteṣu 
yāvanta || sasutājinīkāyena manasā vācā tān sarvvān praṇaṃmyahaṃ || tato 
vicirttamutpādayet || utpādayāmi saṃbodhicitta bodhāya dehinā || bhadracaryyā 
cariṣyāmiḥ sarvva 

<p. 25a> satvohitādavanā || 

tata sarvvavighnanāśārthaṃ .ācalahṛdayamamoghacandravajramūdrāṃ 
vaddhātriruccārayet || nihi kiṃcidapūrvamantravācyaṃ na ca saṃgranthana 
kaumālīmamāsti || atra eva me parārthacintā svāmano bhāvayituṃ kṛtama evaṃ 
|| mama tāvadanena yāti vṛddhiṃ kuśalaṃ bhāvayituṃ praśādavega || atha 
matsamadhātuṃreva paśyadayaropya sādhakoyaṃ || kṣaṇasaṃpradīyaṃ 
sudullabhā pratilabddhā puruṣārtha sādhani || yadi nātra viciṃtyete hitaṃ || 
punarapyaṣamāgamaḥ kuta || rātrau yathā meghaddānāndhakāre vidyutkaṇaṃ 
darśayati prakāsaṃ || budhānubhāvena tathā kadāciḥlloke sā(?)puṇyaṣumatiḥ 
kṣaṇa syāt || tasmācchubhaṃ durbalameva nityaṃḥ balaṃ tu pāpaṃsya 
mahatsughoraṃ || tajjīyete'nyana

<p. 25b> subhena kenaḥ saṃbodhi (* * *)(?) dināmanasyāt || kalpānana kalpān 
praviciṃttayahaḥ dṛṣṭaṃmmūṇindrai hita metadeva || yataḥ sukhena vasuṣaṃ 
prabuddhaḥ mutsyā (* * *)(?) pratitānjanaughān || 
bhavaduḥkhasatānirantrakāmaiḥrapi satvavyasanāni harantu kāmai || 
bahusaukhyasatāni bhoktu kāmai naḥ (* * *)(?) hi sadevabodhicittaṃ || 
bhavaccārakabandhanovarākaḥ sugatānāsuta ucyate kṣaṇenā || 
sarvvasana cāmaralokavandanīyāḥ bha * * *(?) dita eva bodhicittaṃ || 
asucipratimāṃ mimā gṛhnītvāḥ jinaratnapratimāṃ kalotpanarghāṃ || 
rajasātamativabaṃdhanīyaṃḥ suhṛ (* * *)(?) ta bodhicittasaṃjñaṃ || 
suparikṣitamaprameyadhībhiḥ bahumūlyaṃ jagadekasārthabāhau || 
gatipattanavipravāsaṃ

<p. 26a> śīlāḥ sudṛḍhaṃ gṛhnata bodhicittaratnama || 
kadalī vaphalaṃ vihāya yātikṣayaḥ manyatkuśalaṃ hi sarvvamevaṃ ||
satataṃ phalati kṣayena yātiḥ prasavatyeva tu bodhicittavṛkṣa || 
kṛtvāpi pāpāṇi sudhārūṇāniḥ yadā śreyo duttarati kṣaneṇaḥ || 
śurāśu yeneva mahābhayāniḥ nāśrīyate tatkathamajñasatvaiḥ || 
yugāntakālānaravamahātiḥ pādyāyannirddahati kṣaṇenā || 
yasyānusaṃmomatitāmuvācaḥ maitreya nāthaḥ sudhanāya dhīmān || 

tabodhicittaṃ dvividhaṃ jñātavyaṃ samāsata || 
bodhipratinidhicittaṃ caḥ bodhisthānameva caḥ || 

gantu kāmasyaḥ gantuśca yathā bhedaprati tato || 
tadvabhedvo'nayo jñeyā yathāsaṃkhena paṇḍitaiḥ || 

bodhipraṇidhicittasya saṃsārepi phalamahat ||

<p. 26b> natvavicchinna puṇyasatvaḥ yathā prasthāna cetasa || 

yataḥ prabhitye paryyantaḥ satvadhātu pramokṣaṇe || 
samādadātitacittaṃḥ anivarttana cetasāṃ || 

tataḥ prabhṛti suptasyaḥ pramarttasyapyanekasaḥ || 
avicchinnāḥ puṇyadhārāḥ pravarttatena samāgatāḥ || 

idaṃ subāhūpṛcchāyāḥ sopapattika muktavān || 
hinādhimuktisatvārthaḥ svayameva tathāgataṃ || 

śilasurāni satvānāṃḥ nāsayāmiti cintayat || 
aprameyaṃ naṃpyanenaḥ gṛhyate mahitāsayā || 

kimutā pramitaśuraḥ mekaikasya jihirṣata || 
apraseyaṃ gunaṃ satvaḥ mekaikaṃñca cikirṣakaḥ || 

kasya mātuḥ pitu vāpiḥ pitraputramanoratha || 
thanotpanna pūrvvaḥ svapnopaḥ parāthesa saṃbhava kuta ||

<p. 27a> satvaratnadiśyeṣāyaḥ mapūrvo jāyate kuta || 
yatparārthyo sayā'nyeṣāṃḥ nasvārthepyupajāyate || 

jagadānandabījasyaḥ jagaduḥkhoṣadhasya caḥ || 
cittaratnasya yatpuṇyaṃḥ tatkathaṃ hi pramitetā || 

mahitāsaṃsanamātrenaḥ buddhapūjā visiṣyete || 
kiṃ punaḥ sarvvasatvānāṃḥ sarvvasyākhyārthamadyamāt || 

duḥkhamevā vidhāvantiḥ duḥkhariśmaraṇāśayā || 
sukhecchayaiva saṃmohāḥtsvasukhaghnaṃti śatruvat ||

yesteṣmaṃ sukhalaṃkānāḥ ditānāme manekaśa ||
tṛptiṃ sarvvasukheḥ kuryyāt ḥ sarvvaḥ pīḍācchinnacittaṃ ||

nāśayatyepi saṃmohaṃḥ sādhūstena samakutaḥ || 
kuto vāpi dinamitraṃḥ puṇyaṃ vātādi saṃkutaḥ || 

kṛtyeyaṃḥ pratikurccittaḥ sopi tāvanpraśasyate ||

<p. 27b> avyāpāritasādhustuḥ bodhisatvaḥ kimucyatāṃ || 

katipayajanasmatradāyakaḥ kuśalakṛdityebhi pujyete janaiḥ || 
kṣaṇamasanakamātre dānata || saparibhave divasārddhayāpanāt || kiṃ 
muṇiravadhisattasatvasaṃkhayā || niravadhikolamanuprayacchataḥ || 
gagaṇaparikṣayākṣaya || sakalamanorathasaṃprapuraṇaṃ || iti sutrapatojinasya putre 
|| kaluṣaṃ svohṛdayakaroti yeśca || kalukhodayasaṃkhyayā sakalpā || 
narakeṣvāvasatīti nātha āha || atha yasya manaḥ praśādameti || pracye tasya 
tatodhikaṃ phalaṃ || mahatā hi balenapyapakaṃ jitvā || jinaputreṣu śubhaṃ 
tvayatnata || teṣāṃ sarīrāṇī namaskaromī || yatroditaṃ tadvaracitta ratnaṃ ||

<p. 28a> yatrāpakāropi sukhānubaṃdhī || sukhāṃ karāstānuśaraṇaṃ prayāmi || 
tatreyaṃ vajramudrā dakṣiṇahaste suddhamprasastaṃ kṛtvā || vṛdhyāṅguṣṭena 
tarjjanyatramākrame taśyaṣāvajrarakṣaṇāḥ || 

mantra ||
oṃ hūṁ bhrūṁ hraṁ hrīṁ kṣroṁ namo samantabuddhānāṃ mahākroḍha amoghacandra 
mahāropanasphātayaṃ hūṁ bhrama (2) hūṁ trata hī māṁ rakṣā kurvvantu svasti 
svāhā || 

tena khalu punaḥ samayenāṣṭādaśalokadhātu sthitāḥ || 
sarvvadevāsuramāragaṇānāṃ pramarddanī || 

bhagavānāha || tadyathā || svasti vāca svastivāṃñcaghniyāt || 
śriṣṭāṃgulimatyantaramuṣṭiṃ kṛtvā me suvyaume tarjjanyau cāṅguṣṭhāśra 
iṣadaṃ saṃsarakṣaṇāt || 

mantra ||
oṃ hūṁ bhrūṁ hraṁ hrīṁ kṣroṁ hara (2) mahānimirtta

<p. 28b> hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || tato mukhā saucādikaṃ kṛtvā 
mukhāśanopaviṣṭaḥ || paṭapuṣṭakapatimādināmanyatasyognato daśadikaṃsthata 
buddha bodhisatvāna varaṃvya || musumāvakīrṇaṃ maṇḍalakaṃ kṛtvā pūjitā 
mānitā vanditā namaskṛtā || tathāgatā gāthayā sarvvāṃgata || pranamya 
bodhicittamutpādyarevaṃ sarvvabuddha bodhisatvamātmāna niryyāntayet || 
ahaṃmevaṃ nāmā sarvvabuddha bodhisatvānāmātmāna niryyātayāmi 
sarvvathā sarvvakāraṃ pratigṛhnantu māṃ sarvvabuddha bodhisatvā || 
adhitiṣṭhatu māṃ mahākārunīkānārthā || siddhivaradāryyakānāñca bhavati || 
tata sarvvapāpāṇi deśayajjānantitaḥ || 

tacittaratnagrahaṇāya saṃmya || kpūjākaromeṣa tathāgatānāṃ || 
sadharmmaratnasya

<p. 29a> ca nirmmalasya || buddhātmajānāṃ ca guṇodadhīnāṃ || 

yāvanti puṣpāṇi phalāṇi caiva || bhaiṣarjye jātāni ca yāni santi || ratnāni 
yāvanti ca santi loke || jalāni ca svacchamanoramāni || mahīdharā 
ratnamayāstathāne || vanapradeśāśca vivekaramyāḥ || latāsu 
puṣpābharaṇojvalāśca || drumāśca ye satphalanaśraśākhā || devādilokeṣu ca 
gandhadhūpā || kalpadruvo ratnamayāśca vṛkṣā || sarānsi 
cāmbhorūhabhūṣaṇāni || haṃsasvanātyantamanoharāṇi || akṛṣṭajātāni ca 
śasyajātā || nyanyāni vā puje viśyeṣanāṇi || ākāśadhātu praśarāvadhīni || 
sarvvānyapi mānyaparigrahāni || ādāya buddhā muni puṅgavatyo || 
niryyāntayāmi kha saputrakebhyo ||

<p. 29b> gṛhnantu tanme varadakṣiṇīyā || mahākṛpā mā manakasya mānā || 
apunyavānasmi mahādaridra || pujārthamanyat mama nāsti kiñcit || ato 
mamārthāya parārtha cintā || gṛhnantu nāthā idamātmaśaktyā || dadāmi 
cātmānamahaṃjinetye || sarvvena sarvvaṃ ca tadātmajetyo || parigrahaṃ me kuru 
tāgrasatvā || yuṣmāsu dāsatvamupaimi bhaktyā || pārigraheṇāsmi bhavatkṛtena || 
nirbhībhave satvahitaṃ karomī || pūrvvañca pāpaṃ samati kramāni || anyacca 
pāpaṃ prakaromi bhūya || ratnorjjalastambha manorameṣu || 
muktāmayohāsivitānakeṣu || svacchorjjaḥlasphāṭika kuṭṭimeṣu || snāna karo me 
gṛheṣu teṣu || manojña gaṃdhodaka puṣpapūrṇaiḥ || kumbhai mahāratna

<p. 30a> mayairanekaiḥ || sasnānaṃ karomeṣu tathāgatānāṃ || tadātmajanāñca 
sagītavādya || pradhūpitai dhūpamalai ca tulyai || vastrai ca 
teṣāṃtamanunmṛṣāṇi || tataḥ suraktāni sudhūpitāni || dadāmi tebhyo 
varacivarāni || divimṛdullakṣnavicitrasobhau || vastraiva lakāra varaiśca taistaiḥ || 
samantabhadrājitamañju ghoṣa || lokyaśvarādi napi maṇḍayāmi || 
sarvvatrisāhasraviśāriguṃdhai || gaṃdhottamaistānulepayāmi || suttapta sunmṛṣṭa 
sudhauta hema || prabhojjalāt sarvvamunidrakāyān || māndāra vendī 
varamallikādyaiḥ || sarvveḥ sugandhaikkusumai manojñai || 
abhyarcayāgyavyatamānmuṇindrā || sumbhiśca sasthānamanāroramābhi || 
sphitaphalaṃ gandhamanohareśca || tāndhūyameghairupa

<p. 30b> dhūpayāmi || bhojyaiḥ sakhādyai vividhaiśca peyai || 
stebhyonivyadyevanivyadyayāmi || ratnapradīpāśca nivedayāmi || suvarṇapadmaiṣu 
niviṣ'pakīna || gandhapaliptakhucarkūṭa(?) meṣu || kirāmi puṣpaprakarā 
manojñāna || pralambamuktāmaṇihārasobhā || 
nānāsamvarādigmukhamaṇḍalāmbhāna || vimānameghāntutigītīramyā || 
maitrīmayabhyo vinivedayāmi || suvarṇadadaiḥkamanīyarūpai || saṃsaktamuktāni 
samucchritāni || pradhārayāmyaṣa mahāmuninā || ratnatapatrāṇyatiśve 
bhanāniḥ || 

ataḥparaṃ pratiṣṭhāntāṃḥ pūjā meghāmanoramāḥ || turyye saṃgīti 
meghāścaḥ sarvvasatva praharṣadhā || sarvvabuddhadharmmaratneṣuḥ caityeṣu 
pratimāsu caḥ ||

<p. 31a> puṣparatnādi varṣāśca pravarttantā nirantaraṃ || 
mañjughoṣaprabhūtayaḥ pūjayanti yathājināna || tathā tathāgatāntāthānaḥ 
saputrānpūjayāmyahaṃ || svarāgasāgare stotraiḥ stomi cāhaṃ guṇodadhīn || 
stuti saṃgiti meghāśvaḥ sambhavattve ghanaṃnyathā || 
sarvvakṣatrānusaṃkhyaiścaḥ praṇāmaiḥ praṇamāmyahaṃ || 
sarvvatrāṇāgatāṃ buddhon sahadharmmaganottamān || sarvvacaityāni 
vandehaṃḥ bodhisatvāśrayānapi || namaskaromyūpādhyāyāḥ 
mabhivaṃdyānyatistathā || 

buddhaṃ gacchāmi saranaṃḥ yāvadā boddhimaṇḍita || 
dharmmaṃ gacchāmi saraṇaṃḥ bodhisatvo gaṇaṃ tathā || 

vijñāpayāmi saṃbuddhāḥn sarvvadikṣu vyavasthitān || 
mahākāruṇīkāścāpiḥ bodhisatvān kṛtāñjaliḥ || 

anādi gati saṃsāreḥ janmanetrīvaco punaḥ ||

<p. 31b> janmanā paśunā pāpaṃ kṛtaṃ kāritameva vā || 

yathānumoditaṃ kiṃciḥtdātmaghātāya mohataḥ || 
tadateyaṃ deśayāmi paścāttāpena tāyitaḥ || 

ratnatraya apakāro yoḥ mātāpṛttṛṣuvīmayā || 
guruṣva vā jayākāroḥtkāya vāgbuddhibhiḥ kṛta || 

aneka doṣaduḥṣṭenaḥ mayā pāpena nāyakā || 
yatkṛtaṃ dāruṇaṃ pāpaṃḥ tat sarvvadeśayāmahaṃḥ || 

kathañcanisarāmyatmāḥtparimrāyata satvarame || 
māmamākṣīna pāpasyaḥ maraṇaṃ śighrameṣyati || 

kṛtā kṛtā parikṣayaṃḥ mṛtyurviśrambhaghātakaḥ || 
svasthā svasthairaviśvāsyaḥ ākasmika mahāsanīḥ ||

priyāpriyanirmmitenaḥ pāpaṃ kṛtaṃ manekadhā || 
sarvvamunsṛjyaṃ gaṃtavyaṃḥ mayānajñātamīdṛsaṃ ||

<p. 32a> aprīyāna bhaviṣyantiḥ prīyāmenena bhaviṣyati || 
aha bhaviṣyayiṣyāmiḥ sarvvaṃñcana bhaviṣyatiḥ || 

tattatsmaraṇatāyāntiḥ yadvavastvanattatavat || 
evametagatatsarvvaḥ gatāna punarikṣate || 

ihevatiṣatastāvaḥdgatānaike priyāgati || 
nimittta tu yatpāpaḥ tatsthitaṃ ghoramagragata || 

evaṃ māgantukosmitiḥ mayāna pratyarcyaṅgatam || 
mohānuraya vidvaiṣaiḥ kṛta pāpamanekadhā || 

rātriṃ divāmiśrāmamāḥ yuṣo varddhayate vyayaḥ || 
āyasya cāgamo nāstiḥ namaridhyāmi kiṃ tvahaṃ || 

iha savyāgatenāpiḥ bandhūmadhyepi tiṣṭatāṃ || 
maya caikena sātavyāḥ marmmacchedādivyedanāḥ || 

yamadūtī gṛhītasyaḥ kuṭobandhūḥ kuṭaḥ sukṛt ||

<p. 32b> puṇyamekastādātrāṇaṃḥ mayā tacca namevitaṃ || 

anitye jīvitā saṅgīdidaṃ bhayamajānatā || 
pramantrena mayānāthyaḥ bahudukhamupājitaṃ || 

aṅgacchedārthamapyadyaḥ nīyamānī viśuṣyati || 
pipāsite dīnadṛṣṭiḥ raṇyadeve kṣaṇye jagat || 

kiṃ punabhairavākāraiḥryyamadūtairadhiṣṭhitaḥ || 
mahātrāsajalagnasteḥ pūrīṣotsarggaveṣṭitaḥ || 

kātarai dṛṣṭipātaiścaḥ trāṇānveṣī caturddiśaṃ || 
kome mahābhayādatmāḥtsādhūtrāṇaṃ bhaviṣyati || 

trānaśūnyādiśo dṛṣṭāḥ punaḥ saṃmohamāgataḥ || 
tadāhaṃ kiṃ kariṣyāmiḥ tasmin sthāne mahābhaya || 

atha vajradhara vajrapāṇi sarvvadevanāgā || surādiṣu || yakṣagaṇeṣu || 
rākṣaśagaṇeṣu || bhūtagaṇeṣu ||

<p. 33a> pretagaṇeṣu || pīśāca gaṇeṣu || kumbhāṇḍagaṇeṣu || pūtanagaṇeṣu || 
kaṭapūṭanagaṇeṣu || utmāndagaṇeṣu || chāyāgaṇeṣu || apasmāragaṇeṣu || 
ostārakagaṇeṣu || jāmikāgaṇeṣu || saṃkunigaṇeṣu || mātṛnandikāgaṇeṣu || 
lambikāgaṇeṣu || śamikāgaṇeṣu || ālambagaṇeṣu || ḍākaḍākinīgaṇeṣu || 
kaṭaḍākinīgaṇeṣu || kaṭakaḍākinīgaṇeṣu || revatigaṇeṣu || vajrakaumārigaṇeṣu 
|| raktayamārīgaṇeṣu || śyāmayamārīgaṇeṣu || pītayamārīgaṇeṣu || 
śvetayamārīgaṇeṣu || kṛṣṇajamārīgaṇeṣu || agnikarmmagaṇeṣu || 
vināyakagaṇeṣu || kumāragaṇeṣu || virūdṛkagaṇeṣu || virupākṣagaṇyaṣu || 
vaiśravanagaṇeṣu || dhṛtarāṣṭragaṇeṣu ||

<p. 33b> vainatejagaṇeṣu || yamaḍākagaṇeṣu || jayakaragaṇeṣu || madhukaragaṇeṣu | 
bhṛṅgīkarītigaṇeṣu || nandikeśvaragaṇeṣu || rātrīdevatāgaṇeṣu || 
divākaragaṇeṣu || lokapālagaṇeṣu || nagnaśravanagaṇeṣu || ahatgaṇeṣu || 

pramuditā dharmmameghā || arciṣmati || ābhāśvarā || sadurjjayā || dulaṅgamā || 
prabhākari || abhimukhi || sādhūmati || vimalā || etata daśasthitābhuvaṇe || 
aṣṭādaśalokadhātusthitā || devādi sarvvagrahāstathā || mekamatenaikaśvarena 
gāthā pathitvā || 

adyaiva saraṇaṃ jāmiḥ jaganāthān mahābalān || 
jagadrākṣārthamudyuktāḥnsarvvātrā saphalājitānān || 

teścāpyadhigataṃ dharmmaḥ saṃsārabhayanāśana ||

<p. 34a> śaraṇaṃyāmi bhāveṇaḥ bodhisatvagaṇa tathā || 
samantabhadrāyātmānaṃḥ dadāmi bhayaviṭkaraḥ || 

punaśca mañju ghokhāyaḥ dadānyātmānamātmanā || 
pañcavalokitaṃ nāthaḥ kṛpā vyākulavāliṇa || 

viraumārttarevaṃ bhītaḥ samārakṣatu pāpīnaṃ || 
āryyāmākāsagadbhañcaḥ kṣītī garbhañca bhāṣataḥ || 

sarvvātmahākṛpāṃścābhiḥ pitrāṇānveṣī viraumahaṃ || 
yaṃ dṛṣṭau vacasaṃtrastāḥ parāyante caturdiśaḥ || 

yamadūto dayo duṣṭāḥstaṃ namasyāmi vajriṇaṃ || 
atīte yuṣmadvacanaṃḥ sāprataṃ bhayadarśanāt ||

śaraṇaṃyāmi vobhītoḥ bhayanāsayatadbhutā ||
itoravyādhi sitopiḥ vaidyavākyaṃ na laṃghayaṃt || 

kimucyādhi sutai graṣṭaḥ catuvyādhi niruttaraiḥ ||
ekanāpi yateḥ sarvvoḥ jambudvīpa gatā narāḥ ||

<p. 34b> yeṣāṃ nasyanti bhaikhajyeḥ sarvvadikṣu na labhyate ||
tatra sarvvajña vaidyasyaḥ sarvvaśatpāpahārinā ||

vākyamūlaṃghayāmītiḥ thiddhyāmatyanta mohitaṃ || 
tiṣṭāmetye pramarttohaṃḥ prapāteṣvitareṣvapi || 

kimujojanasāhaśraḥ prapāte dīrghakālike ||
adyai ca maraṇaṃ yātiḥ na yuktāmye sukhāsikā ||

avasyamyati sāvyalāḥ bhaviṣyāmyahaṃ yadāt || 
abhayaṃ kena me dṛrttaḥ niḥsariṣyāmi vā kathaṃ ||

avaśyaṃ na bhavikhyāmiḥ kasmātme susthitaṃ mana ||
pūrvvānubhutanaṣṭatyaḥ kimeśāra ivāsthitaṃ ||

yeṣu me bhirniveṣṭe taḥ guruṇāṃ laṃghitamvaca ||
jāmbalokamimaṃtyaktyāḥ bandhanericitāstathā ||

ekākiṃ hvaviyāsyāmiḥ kime sarvvaḥ priyāpriyaiḥ ||

<p. 35a> iyaṃmeva tu cintāḥ yuktārātri divasadā || 
aśubhāni yata duḥkhaḥnnismarayaṃ tataḥ kathaṃḥ ||

mayā vāre naṛe munaṇaḥ yatkiṃcitatpāpamācitaṃ ||
prakṛtyā yacca sāvadyāṃḥ prajñāptyāvadyameva ca ||

tata sarvvadeśayāmeṣaḥ nāthānāmagrataḥ sthitaḥ || 
kṛtāñjali duḥkhabhimaḥ praṇipatya punarpuna ||

atyayaṃmatyayatvainaḥ pratigṛhnantu nāyaka ||
na abhadramidaṃ nāthāḥ na karttavya punarmmayā ||

tataḥ sarvvapāpana || rāgadvekhamohajāna || sarvvakārikānaśeṣāna desayāmi || 
yathā buddhā bhagavanto jānantīti || 

tataḥ puṃṇyāmanumodya sarvvabuddha bodhisatvānvīpuṇyajñānasaṃbhārā || 
laukīka lokottarāstai kālikāstānaśrayā'numode || yathā buddhā bhagavanto

<p. 35b> na jānantīti || 

tataḥ paryyakāvasthitarimāṃ samayamudrāṃ vadhniyāt || praṇamāñjaliḥ 
śilasisthata || samayamudrā || 

mantra ||
oṃ hūṁ bhrūṁ hraṁ hrīṁ kṣrīṁ namaḥ susiddhe sādhanī aśrekaruṇāvaladetayi (2) 
ativaladetayi (2) ativale namostu varasiddhidāyaketyeḥ mahākṛpātyeḥ svāhā || 
anayā sarvvamudrāmantrāṇāṃ samayaḥ śaṃdarśito bhavaṃti ||
tata pūrvvavajradvajramudrāṃ vaddhā acalahṛdaya manusmarat || 

mantra ||
oṃ hūṁ bhrūṁ hraṁ hrīṁ kṣrīṁ namaḥ susiddhe sādhanī aśre karuṇāvaladetayi (2) 
ativale namostu varasiddhidāyaketyeḥ mahākṛpātyaḥ svāhā ||
anayā sarvvamudrāmantrāṇāṃ samayaḥ śaṃdarśito bhavati || tata

<p. 36a> pūrvvavajradvajramudrāṃ vaddhā acalahṛdayamanusmarat || 

mantra ||
oṃ hūṁ bhrūṁ hraṁ hrīṁ kṣrīṁ namaḥ samantavajrānīmacalakāna caṇḍasādhaya 
hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ || tato vajroṣṇīṣamudrā sirasi nyasyat || tata saptavidhānuttara pūjā 
apāyaduḥkhaviśrāma sarvvasatvai kṛta śubha || 

anumodyanapunyanaḥ sukhāṃ tiṣṭhantu duḥkhitā || 
saṃsāraduḥkhavimokṣaḥ manumodaśarīriṇāṃ ||

bodhisatvatva me buddhaḥ manumodyavatāpinī || 
cittotpādaśamudrāśva sarvvasatva sukhāvahān || 

sarvvasatvahitā dhyānaḥ nanumodya ca śāśinī ||
anumodanā || sarvvāsudikṣu saṃbuddhān ḥ prārthayāmi kṛtāñjali ||

dharmmapradīpaṃ kurvvantuḥ mohāduḥkho prayātinā ||

adhyakhanā ||

<p. 36b> nirvvātu kāmāścakrināḥ nyācayāmi kṛtāñjali || 
kalpānanantā tiṣṭhantuḥ mādandhaśca midaṃñjagat ||

yācanā || 
evaṃ sarvvanidaṃ kṛtvāḥ janmayā sāditaṃ śubhaṃ ||
tenasyāṃ sarvvasatvānāḥ sarvvaduḥkhapraśānti kṛt ||

glānānāmasmina bhaiṣajyaṃḥ bhavyabhaidyayameva ca ||
tadupasthāpaka caivaḥ yavadrogapana bhave || 

kṣutpipāśā vyathāhanyāḥmannapānā pravarṣatai || 
dūrbhikṣāntara kalpeṣuḥ bhaveyaṃ pānabhojanaṃ ||

daridrānāṃ ca satvānāṃḥ nirdhiḥsyāmahamakṣayaḥ ||
nānopakaraṇākāraiḥ rūpa tiṣṭheyamagragata ||

ātmabhāvistathā bhogāḥtsarvvatrādhvagataṃ śubhaṃ ||
nirapakṣastyujāmeṣaḥ sarvvasatvārtha siddhayet ||

sarvvatyāgaśca nirvvāṇā pārthivāna camemana ||

<p. 37a> tyaktavyaṃ cyanmayā sarvvaḥ balaṃ satveṣa dīyatāṃ ||

yathā sukhikṛtaścātmāḥ mayāyaṃ sarvadehiṇā ||
ghraṃtu nindantu cānitye mākirantu ca yā śubhi ||

krīdantu mama kāyenaḥ sahantu virasaṃntra ca ||
darttastetyo mayākāyaḥ cintayākimamānayā ||

kārayantu ca karmmāniḥ teṣāṃ yāṃti suṣāvahaṃ ||
amarthaḥ kasyacit mābhutyāmāraṃ vyakadācana ||

yeṣāṃ krādhā prasaṃnāvāḥ māmālaṃvyamabhirbhavet ||
sa eva teṣāṃ hetuḥ syānitye sarvvārthasidhaya ||

atyākhyāsyanti mānāthaḥ ye cānyapyapakālina ||
unprāsakī tathānyavāḥ sarvvasyū bodhibhāgina ||

anāthānāmahaṃnāthaḥ sārthavāhaśca yāyināṃ ||
yeretsunī ca naubhutaḥ sakramayena meva ca || 

dīpārthināmahaṃ dīpaḥ śaryyāśaryāthināmahaṃ ||

<p. 37b> dāsārthināmahaṃ dāsoḥ bhavyayaṃ sarvvadehinā ||
cintāmaṇi bhadra ghaṭaḥ siddhavidyā mahoṣadhi ||

bhaveyaṃ kalpavṛkṣaścaḥ kāmadhyenuśca dehināṃ ||
pṛthivyādini bhūtāniḥ nisyaṣākāśavāśināṃ ||

satvānāṃmaprameyānāṃḥ yathābhogānyanekadhā ||
evanmākāśaniṣṭasyaḥ sarvvadhātoramekadhā ||

bhaveyamupajīvyohaṃḥ yāvatsarvvananivṛtā ||
yathā gṛhītaṃ sugatauḥ bodhicittaṃ purātanaiḥ ||

ta bodhisatvo śikṣāyāḥ mānupurvyoryathā sthitā ||
tadvadutpādayāmeṣaḥ bodhicitta jagaddhite ||

tadvadeva ca tāḥ śikṣāḥ śikṣiṣyāmi yathākramaṃ ||
evaṃ gṛhītvāmatimāḥnbodhicitta praśādata ||

punapṛṣṭasvaprakṣyārthaḥ cirttamevaṃ praharṣayet ||

<p. 38a> adya me saphalaṃ janmaḥ visuddho mānuṣo bhave ||
adye buddhakule jātoḥ buddha putrasmi sāṃprataṃ ||

tathādhunā mayā kāryyaḥ svakulocitta kāriṇā ||
nirmmalamasya kulasyātyaḥ kalaṃko na bhavedyathā ||

andhaḥ saṃkāra kuṭebhyoḥ yathā ratna mavāpnuyāt ||
tathā kathaṃcittaṣyataḥdvodhicittaṃ mamoditaṃ ||

janmamṛtyuvināśāyaḥ jātametadraśāyanaṃ ||
jagadāridyasamanaṃḥ nividhāmidamakṣayaṃ ||

jagadvyāddhipraśamanaṃḥ bhaikhajyaṃ midamuttamaṃ ||
bhavāndhatra mana(*)srāntaḥ jagadviśrāmapādaya || 

durgatyattara tasya tuḥ sāmānyaḥ sarvvayoyinī ||
jagatkleśāṣmasamanaḥ uditācittacandramāḥ ||

jagadajñānatimiraḥ protsāraṇa mahāravīḥ ||

<p. 38b> saddharmmakṣīramathanāḥ navanītaṃ samusthitaṃ ||

sukhabhoga vubhukṣi tasya vā janasārtha bhavādhvacārina ||
sukhamantramidaṃ jyuṣa sthitaṃ sakalātyāṃ gata satvatarppaṇa ||

jagadadyati mantritaṃ mayā sugatvena sukhena cānta ||
pūrajaḥ khalu sarvvatāyi vāmabhinandantu surādaya ||

iti vajradharavajrapāṇi dvaya pratyaṅgirā boddhicittaparigraho kathā iti ||

evaṃ gṛhītvā sudṛḍhaṃḥ bodhicittaṃ jinātmajaḥ || 
śikṣāṇāti krame yatnaṃḥ kuryyānityamataṃdritaḥ ||

sahasāyan samārabdhaṃḥ samyagyavavicāritaṃ ||
tatra kuryyānnavatyevaḥ prajñāyānti pipujyete ||

vicāritaṃ tu yadbhudhaiḥ mahāprājñaiśca tatsuta ||
mayāpi ca yathāśaktiḥ tatra kiṃ pavyate tvayā ||

<p. 39a> yadi caivaṃ pratijñā yaḥ sādhaye yanna karmmanā || 
etāt sarvvāvisaṃvādyaḥ kāgati me bhaviṣyati || 

manasācittartu yenaḥ yona devātpunanara || 
saplatro bhavati tyuktaḥ salpamātrepi vastuti || 

kimutrānuttaraṃ sauṣyāḥ muccairadyuṣya bhāvataḥ || 
jagat sarvvāvisaṃvādyaḥ patigarīmatiyasi || 

yasmādāpaya mānāsauḥ sarvvasatvārthahāri kṛtāḥ || 
yopyanyeḥ kṣaṇamapyasyaḥ puṇyavighnaṃ kariṣyati || 

tasya durgati paryyantaṃḥ nāsti satvārtha ghātinaḥ || 
ekasvāpi hi satvānāḥ hato duḥkha puna bhavet || 

aśeṣākāsaparyyantaṃḥ vāsini kimudehīnā || 
evaṃ āvartti varatoḥ bodhicitta balena ca || 

dorāya mānaḥ saṃsāreḥ bhūmiprāpto cirāraye || 
tasmādyathā pratijñānaṃḥ sādhanīyaṃ mayā darāt ||

<p. 39b> nodyacakrīyate jalaḥntraye nāsti taraṃgataḥ || 
apramyayā gato buddhāḥ sarvvasatvagavyaṣakāḥ || 

naiṣāmahaṃ svadoṣāṇāḥ cikitsātmā paraṃgataḥ || 
adyāpi ce tathaivasyaṃḥ yathocāhaṃ punaḥ punaḥ || 

durgati vyādhimaraṇaḥnchedabhedādya vāpnuyāt || 
kadā tathāgatotpādaṃḥ śabdāmānuṣyameva ca || 

kuśalātyāsayogetvāḥmeva tasya'ti dullabhaṃ ||
ālogatīvaśaṃ śvedaḥ sabhaktinnirupadravaṃ || 

āyuḥ kṣaṇavisaṃvādiḥ kāyoyācitta ko pamaḥ || 
nahī dṛśai sarvvaritaiḥ mānuṣyaṃ labhate nara || 

alabhyamāne mānuṣyaḥ pāpameva kuṭaḥ śubhaṃ || 

yadā kuśalayogyopiḥ kuśalaṃ na karomyahaṃ || 
apāyaduḥkhaissamūḍhaṃḥ kiṃ kariṣyāmyahaṃ tadā ||

<p. 40a> avataśca kuśalaṃ pāpaṃḥ pāpaṃ cāpyupacānyat || 
hataḥ sugandhi śabdopi kalpakoṭi saṭerapi || 

atra evāha bhagavān ḥ ṣyamati duti dūllabhaṃ || 
mahārṇava yugachindraḥ kuśopama guṇopama || 

ekakṣaṇakṛtātpādaḥ davī caukalpame syate || 
anādikārāpacitāḥtpāpātkā punaḥ sugatau kathā || 

na ca tatmātramaivāsauḥ vyadayitvā vimucyate || 
yasmātadevayannaivaḥ pāpamanyanprasuyate || 

nātaparapañca nāstiḥ na ca māho na castyata || 
yadīdṛśaṃ kṣaṇaṃ prāpyaḥ nātyastaṃ kuśala mayā || 

yadi caiva vivṛṣāmānācaḥ tāstamanihatye mayāti nidrā || 

prakṛtimaraṇadullitā carāhāna śaśirasiprasabhaṃ nihantumugrā || 
agatitasarasaktighāṭaḥ duḥkhānavimukhatāmupayītya sādhayitvā ||

<p. 40b> kimusatataṃ sarvvaduḥkha hetuḥnprakitiripunupahantu mudyatasya || 
bhavati mama vipādadainyamadyavyaśanasatairapi kena hetunā vai || 

ākāraṇyanyai bali pukṣatāṇiḥ gātreṣu laṃkāradudvahanti ||
mahārthasiddhyai tu samudyatasyaḥ duḥkhāni kasmāt mama bādhakāmi ||

svajivikāmātranivarddhacittāḥ kaivartta caṇḍālakṛṣī varādyāḥ ||
śītātapādivyaśanaṃ sahanteḥ jagaddhitārthanna kathaṃ sahe'haṃ ||

daśadigdhāmāparyyantaḥ jagatkleśa vimokṣaṇo ||
pratijñāya yadātmāpiḥ na kleśebhyo vimocitaḥ || 

ānyapramāṇamahlā vrūḥ vannunmatta kadāstadā ||
anivatti bhaviṣyāmiḥ tasmāt kleśavadhya sadā ||

<p. 41a> anugṛhī bhaviṣyāmiḥ varddhavaiśca vigrahaṃ ||
anyatratavidhā kleśaḥ ghātacittānubandhina ||

galatsontrāṇi me kāmaṃḥ śīlaḥ patantu nāma me ||
natvevāvanatiyāmiḥ sarvvathā kleśavailiṇāṃ ||

nirvvāsitasyāpi tu nāmaśatrī || daśāntare sthānapagrahasyāḥ tvātaṃ ||
yata punaḥ saṃtṛtaśaktireti || na kleśa satvo gatiridṛśātu || kvāsau cāyānyanasto 
nirasta || thitvā yasminmadvadhārthaṃ yateta ||
todyogomakevalaṃ mandabuddhe || kaleśrāḥ prajñā dṛṣṭi sādhyāvalākāḥ ||
na kleśāviṣunendriyagaṇenāpyantarāle sthitāḥ ||
nātronetrakuhasthitā || punarime mathanti kṛtsnaṃ jagata || māyaiva yamato 
vimuñca hṛdaya || trāśaṃbhaja svādyamaṃ ||

<p. 41b> prajñārthakimakāṇḍā evanakeṣvātmāna boddhasyase ||
evaṃ viniśviṣyāmi punaḥ || sīdāmi mohita || 

śropiṣyāmiriraṃ bhūyoḥ yamadūtaiḥ prabodhitaḥ || 
ciraṃdhakṣatimekāyaṃḥ nārakāgniḥ suduḥsahaḥ ||

paścātā pānalaścittaṃḥ ciradhakṣatyasikṣitaṃ || 
kathacidapi saprāptoḥ hitabhūmi sudullabhā ||

jānannapi ca nīyehaṃḥ tānya ca narakān punaḥ ||
atraṃ nume ca tanānāstiḥ mantrairiva vimohitaḥ || 

na jāne kena muktāmiḥ kotrāntamanma tiṣṭati ||
hastapādādi rahitaḥstṛṣṇādveṣādi śastravaḥ ||

na caṇḍarā na ca te prājñāḥ kathaṃ dāśī kṛtosmitiḥ ||
macitāvasthitā evaḥ ghnantimāmeva susthitāṃ ||

tatrāpyahaṃ na kuṣyāmiḥ dhigastyane sahiṣṇatāṃ ||

<p. 42a> sarvvadevāmanuṣyāścaḥ yadisyu marma śatravaḥ ||

tapināpicikaṃ vahnīḥ samudānayitu kṣamā ||
manorapi yadāsagīḥ na bhasmāpi paratyato ||

kṣaṇātkṣiṇaṃ yantimākṣatraḥ balinaḥ kleśatravaḥ ||
nahi sarvvānyaśatruṇāḥ dīrghamāyuḥ rapīdṛśaṃ ||

anādyaṃnta mahādīrghajanmakleśa balikṛṇā ||
savve hitāya kalpāntaḥ ānukulenasyavitāḥ ||

syaḍyamānāstvamāklaśaḥ sutarāṃ duḥkhakārakāḥ ||

iti śatatīdirghavairiṣu vyaśanādyapraśavaika hetuṣu ||
hṛdayaniva satsunibhayaṃ mamasaṃsāratiḥ kathaṃ bhavet ||

bhavacārakapārakā ime narakādiṣvapi vadhvaghātakāḥ ||
mativeśmanilobhapañjale yadi tiṣṭhati kṛtaḥ suṣaṃ mama ||

<p. 42b> tasmānnatāvadahamatradhurāṃkṣamiyāvannasatrava ime nihitāḥ 
samakṣaṃ ||
svalpepi tāvadayakārini baddharātya karomi yaṃtnayaḥ ||

kuśikṣāpratiyarttihantoḥ || 

vaidyāpadeśāḥ carataḥ kutosti || 
bhaiṣarjya sādhyasya nirāmayatvaṃ || kṣikṣānnukṣi tu kāmena cittaṃ ||
lakṣaṃdāyavapakaroprapannat || 

naśikṣārakṣituṃ saktyāḥ calacittamarakṣitā ||
adāṃtāmattamātaṃgāḥ na kurvanti hatāṃ vyathāṃ ||

karoti yāmavivyādauḥ muktacittamataṃgataḥ ||
vaddhaśca ccittamātaṅgaḥ smṛtirajjāṃ samantata ||

bhayamastaṃ gatā sarvvaḥ nahi kalpā samāgataṃ ||
vyāghrasiṃhāgajāmakṣāḥ sūryyāḥ sarvva ca satravaḥ ||

sarvanarakapālāścaḥ ḍākinyā rākṣasāstathā ||

<p. 43a> sarvvavaddhābhavaṃtyateḥ cittasyaikasya bandhanāt ||
cittasaukasya dasanātaḥ sarvvadāntā bhavanti ca ||

yasmā bhayāni sarvvāniḥ duḥkhānyapramitāni ca ||
cittādeva bhavantītiḥ kathitaṃ tatvavādināṃ ||

śastrāni kena cittāniḥ damyonyamabhayānakaḥ ||
adaridraṃ jagatkṛtvāḥ dānapāramitājadi ||

jagadaridramayāpi soḥ kaṃthaṃ pūrvatāyināken ||
phalena saha sarvvasvaḥ tyāgacittajjane (2) akhila ||

dānapāramitā proktāḥ tasmāt sācittameva tu ||
tasyādayaḥ kvaniyantaḥ rayeyaṃ yatonatān ||

saddho virati cittetuḥ śīlapāramitāmatā || 
kiyato mārayiṣyāmiḥ dūrjjanāt gagaṇopamān ||
mārite krodhacitte tuḥ māritāḥ sarvvasatravaḥ ||

<p. 43b> bhūmicchādayituṃ sarvvāḥ kuṭaścarmma bhaviṣyati ||
upānaccarmmamātrenaḥ cchannā bhavati medinī ||

vākyabhāvā mayātādvaḥcchakyā vārayituṃ na hi ||
svacittaṃ vārayiṣyāmiḥ kimamānyainti vāratai ||

sahāyivāṃcchācīrātyāṃḥ mandavṛttenna tatphalaṃ ||
yatpatoreka kasyāpiḥ cittasya brahmatādikaṃ ||

japāstapānsi sarvvāniḥ dīrghakālakṛtānyapi ||
anyacittena maṃyenaḥ vṛthyaivatyāha sarvvavit ||

duḥkhahantuṃ suṣaṃprāptuṃḥ te bhramanti mudhāmbara ||
paiścetaṃ ddharma sarvvatvaṃḥ cittaguhyaṃ na bhāvitaṃḥ ||

tasmāt svaṣvitaṃ cittaḥ mayā kāya surakṣitaṃ ||
cittarakṣāvratakukkāḥ bahubhiki mama vrataiḥ ||

yathā ca paramamadhyasthoḥ rakṣanti vanamādarāt ||

<p. 44a> evaṃ durjjanadhanamadhyasthāḥ rakṣacittaṃ praṇaṃ sadā ||

vranaduḥkhalavāhitoḥ rakṣāmi vraṇamādarāt ||
saṃghāta parvvatā ghātāḥ hītacitta vranana kiṃ ||

anena vihārenaḥ viharaṇa durjjanaṣyāpi ||
pramadājanamadhyatiḥ yati hīno na khaṇḍate ||

lābhānasyaṃntu mekāmaṃḥ satkāraḥ kāyajīvitaṃ ||
nasyatonya ca kuśalaṃḥ mātu citta kadācana ||

cittarakṣantu kāmānāṃḥ mayaikha krīyatai'ñjaliḥ ||
smṛtiñca saprajanyañcaḥ sarvvaratnena rakṣayat ||

vyādhākulānavanakṣama || sarvvakarmmasā tathātyāṃ vyākulacittaṃ na 
rakṣamāṃ sarvvakarmmasu || 

bhagavānāha || tataḥ paryyakāvasthitarimā || samayamudrāṃ vahnicitta 
rādadveśamoha || ete citta vajradharādi ||

<p. 44b> sarvvadeveṣu cittabandhaniyamāha || sarvvadevagaṇeṣu ṇāmāñjali silaśi 
sthita ||

samayamudrāmantra || oṃ namaḥ susiddhe sādhanī agre karuṇavaradaḥ tayi (2) ativale 
namostu varasiddhidāyakebhyo mahākṛtyaḥ svāhā || anayo 
sarvvamudrāmantrānā samayaḥ śaṃdarśito bhavati || tataḥ 
pūrvvavadvajramudrāvaddhā acalahṛdayamanusmarata ||

mantra || oṃ namo samantavajrānāṃ macalakān caṇḍasādhaya hūṁ phaṭ ||
tato vajroṣṇīṣamudrāṃ śilaśī nyasyataḥ dakṣiṇamuṣṭau aguṣṭakaṃ sitaka 
kuryyāt || mantra || oṃ namaḥ sarvvabuddha bodhisatvānāṃ triśikhāgni namostute 
samantāguṇasamantā guruṇāvarāgra dharmmā

<p. 45a> vidhunādi kleśa duḥkhajālanujagata dadānti cāṇḍe tatredaṃ trisamaya 
kuru svāhā || 

anayāmantri mahāyānaṃ niparihīyate nivighnasiddha siṃśca bhavati || punaścā 
mahārakṣā pañcamusthāneṣu nyasyat || mahān bhavati || 
uttānamañjali kṛtvā kanyasārāmike karamadhya kanyasā vahiḥ suvi ihā 
mayāmahe hūṁ phaṭ || tato mahākavacamudrayā ajita vajrayā kavacaṃ kuryyāt || 
kanyaśāṃguṣṭhau śaṃkarā kālena anyā || śaṃśarakṣamūlā madhyaphalā 
ajivajāya || 

mantra || oṃ namo samantavajrānāṃ || oṃ hūṁ hūṁ vajramayara kavacaho vajra (2) hūṁ 
hūṁ phaṭ || 

oṃ sarvvatathāgatebhyaḥ hūṁ hūṁ svāhā || oṃ namaḥ samantavajrānā 

<p. 45b> sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatro || hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ 
hūṁ hūṁ asmin kuṭāṃgāre rakṣa (2) māṃ śānti śvasti svāhā ||

tato devasālāyibhīḥ sutarāmadhyaṣyo bhavati || evamātmarakṣāṃ kṛtvā 
sthānarakṣāṃ kuryyāt || tatraivajrāsanamudrayā āsanaṃ vajradhitiṣṭhet || 
vajraparyyaṅka madhya uttāna vāmakasyoparidakṣiṇakaraṃ nivyasayatmago 
vajrāsanamudrā || mantra || oṃ samantavajrānīḥ nama oṃ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ || tato 
vajramaśrayamudrāyā svasthāyā svasthānaṃ vajrasamayamadhi tiṣṭhet || 
praṇāmāñjali ratāmikāyugaraṃ viparitapṛṣṭhabhagnamiti || anāmikā tarjjanyo 
rūparuparicakre tāvevadeyāti || evadayaciparita pṛṣṭagargga

<p. 46a> madhyamā suci tathā kariniṣṭhikāguṣṭau pañcalamudrā || mantra || 

oṃ namaḥ samantavajrāṇāṃ || oṃ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ vajrāgrabhūvaṇe muḥ hūṃ phaṭ 
|| tato vajrajvālā vahistanmudrāyā nyasyat ||
abhayakarasyoparicāraṃ saṃkṛtaṃ jāṃgulikaṃ dakṣiṇyana bhrāmayata ||
vajrajvālā || mantraḥ || 

oṃ namaḥ samantavajrānāṃḥ oṃ hūṁ hūṁ vajrajvāle hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ || 

tata śīmābandhanīyāt || dakṣiṇakare mudghātarjjanīmucchritāṃ kṛtvā 
dakṣiṇyana bhrāmayat || aśīmānāsasīmābandhanīḥ asyāmantraḥ || oṃ namaḥ 
samantravajrāṇāṃḥ oṃ hūṁ hūṁ mahāsīmābandha (2) vajre vajriṇī hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ 
||

tataḥ sayaḥ kṛta rakṣā parikaḥ svasthāna sthita sayava

<p. 46b> buddha bodhisatvetye || stathāgata saṃbhavamudrayā arghamprakilpayet ||
tatasya samanvāharanti siddhā varadāyakāṇa bhavantīḥ ||
muktikarasasthānāṃ kaniṣṭhikā svāntathāgatā śabhramudrāmantraḥ ||
oṃ namaḥ (* *)(?) nta vajrāṇāṃḥ oṃ namaḥ sarvvabuddha bodhisatvāṇā ā 
amalavikrāntatejiṇī araje svāhā ||

tato vāhyagandhādupacārasaṃbhave acalavajramudrā pariśodhya gandhādīna 
pratisvamantrai aṣṭavādarānabhimantrapūjāṃ kuryyāt || 

tatre gandhamantra ||
namaḥsteyadhikāṇā sarvvatathātānāṃ asamagandhotta me bhavati stharahi 
gagaṇakaṃ mahodaya sarvvārthasādhaya svāhā || 
tatra puṣpamantra || namastaiyadhikāṇāṃ sarvva

<p. 47a> tathāgatāṇāṃḥ mahāpuṣpā puṣpavati svāhā ||

tatadīpamantra || 
namaḥstaiyadhikānāṃ sarvvatathāgatāṇāṃḥ ayante jvalante dīpajyoti sikhe 
svāhā || 

naivyadyamantra ||
namaḥsteyadhikānāṃ sarvvatathāgatāṇāṃḥ ararapavali devaliṃ dadāhīṃ 
mahābali svāhā ||

tato daśadigalokadhātusthitacitrapūjāṃ gānyavaniryyotayat ||
puṣpānājalivaddhyāya amasā apyanigrahā || daśadigalokadhātupūjāṃga 
viśyaṣāsphallajā || ratnaparvata kalpavṛkṣādayo || jalasamudrāratnādaya || 
kanakapaṅkajādayaśca ye cānya || sarvvalokadhātuṣu divyamānuṣyakāḥ || 
sarvvarūpaḥ śabdaḥ gandhaḥ rasaḥ sparsaḥ rasādayastāḥ sarvvabuddhaboddhi

<p. 47b> satvebhya || niryyāntayāmityudāharet ḥ ||

manomayāstu pūjāmedyānevaṃ pravarttayet ||
pūrṇamudrāsaṃkucitāgra pranamāñjali lakṣaṇāṃ vaddhāḥ evaṃ vadyadet || 
sarvvabuddhabodhisatvādhisthānavarena || mama pranidhipuṇyavaranavidyāmantra ||
balena ca sarvvabuddhabodhisatvaparṣamaṇḍale varodārā || samantabhadra 
bodhosatvācaryyābhinahnatā mahāpūjāmedyā || prasaraktāmiti cintayītvā ||

imāṃ pūjādhiṣṭākaṃ māhātrīvidyārājñīmaṣṭau vārāccārayet ||
namaḥ sarvvabuddhabodhisatvānāṃ sarvvathā usthullahimagagaṇakaṃ samantataḥ 
svāhā || 

tataḥ sarvabuddhabodhisatvānāṃ vicitraguṇāvarṇasaṅgītī || meghasamudrā 
dharmmasaṃgītī

<p. 48a> meghāsamudrāśca || sarvvalokadhātu viśvādhakā || sarvvatra pravarttamiti 
cintayitvā || 

imāṃ tutisaṃgā bhāvasamā || sarvvabuddhabodhisatvatimeghā vinihāra || 
karttividyārājñīmaṣṭauvācānucārayat ||

imāṃ sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrānāmāparājitā ||
mahāpratyaṃgirā mahāvidyārājñā ||

namaḥ sarvvabuddhabodhisatvāṇāṃ sarvvatrasaṃkuśramitābhijñārāsiṇī 
namostute svāhā || 

tataḥ yāvallokapālā sarvvalokadhātu || 
samudreṣu sarvvasatvānāṃmabhāvasamāḥ ||
sarvvabuddhabodhisatvanirmmāṇi meghā sarvvārambanebhyonviścāryya ||
sarvvasatvānāṃ sarvvaduḥkhāni praṇayantu || sarvvalokadhātuṣu lokottarasapado 
yāvata || samantabhadrakāyādi śuddhiṃ

<p. 48b> prāpayasthimi cintayitvā ||

imāṃ sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrānāmāparājītā ||
māhāpratyaṅgirāvidyā rājamaṣṭauvārāccārayat || 
namo sarvvabuddho bodhisatvā namostute mahāvajra sarvvasatvahitaṃ karo tiṣṭha 
sarvveṣāṃ sarvvadharmmāmadhiṣṭhāya svāhā || 

sarvvañca tatpūjādikaṃ maṃntrādibalenāvitartha saṃmbhavatin prasiddhaṃ || 
yakuśalaṃ caitadanuttarasaṃmyaksaṃbodhāvevaṃ pariṇāmayata || yathā 
buddhā bhagavanto'tyanujānanti || yaśāmyamāmematakuśalamūlaṃ || 
tathāhaṃ pariṇāmayāmityanena ca || puṇyānāhaṃ samantabhadracaryyāyā 
boddhimabhisaṃbuddhā || 

oṃ vajrasatvo samayamanupālaya || vajrasatvena pratiṣṭhita ||

<p. 49a> dṛḍho me bhava || sutoṣo me bhava || supoṣo me bhava || anurakto me bhava || 
sarvvasiddhi me pracche || sarvvakarmmasu karmmacitta || śrīyaṃ kuru hūṁ ha ha ha 
ha || ho bhagavana sarvatathāgata || vajramāme muñcavajri || bhavamahā || 
samayasatva āḥ || 

pañcarakṣā vā || hastadvayaṃ anyonyapṛṣṭasaṃsakta || mudhamukhāgurīkaṃ 
sadyojya tarjjanyo kaniṣṭake ca || sakalākālākārana madhyamānāmikā || 
sṛcyotmadhya aguṣṭayaṃ samanudṛkhaṃ dhārayat || 
satākṣaramudrā tu saṃpuṭāñjali kṛtvā tarjjanīdvayaṃ nāguṣṭagaṃ pīḍayat || 
śyeṣāntu tathaiva suvyākāra || mantra || oṃ namo sarvvabuddha bodhisatvānāṃḥ 
āḥ vīravajraśṛṃkhāre hūṁ phaṭ ||

tataḥ sarvvamudrā

<p. 49b> saṃgrahabhūtaṃ samantāvabhāsoṣṇiṣa dharmmacakra vā vaṃdhīyāt ||
supratamanobhayapāṇinā || anāśikera madhyanakhaṃ paridhāyā || 
guṣṭāgrenāpaṭaukaṃ nyasau sucyākāreṇa || saṃhatā agro tathaiva 
madhyamāsana || khanikhāsamantāvabhāsoṣṇīṣaṃ || 

te e tarjjanyāsaṃñcoryya nakhena nakhamārabhyet || 
maṇḍalākārena dharmmacakramudrā || anayoṣathākramaṃ mantraḥ āsahaṃ ||
oṃ dhuneyātaya chhinda ca cakreṇa vajriṇī hūṁ phaṭ || 

imāṃ sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrānāmāparājītā || mahāpratyaṃgirā 
mahāvidyārājñā || anayoranyatarā vadhyāmantra || saha dūccāryya sthito 
niṣarṇṇā vājayatarādibhinnābhi || bhūyate siddhicāsyābhimukhi bhavanti 

<p. 50a> tataḥ śrīghraṃ siddhārtha dharmodayā muddhāvaddhā 
tanmantramanusmarat || dvāmahastena nuṣṭi vaddhā tarjjanī || kaniṣṭhīkāguṣṭhau 
ca prasārayadurddha || namaḥ sarvvabuddha bodhisatvānā āsarvvatrāseke svāhā || 

svamudrāyāvamantra sakaducāryyasamayaṃ darśayet || 
svamudrā tu yathā yogaryyatitavyā || 
tataḥ sarvvabuddhabodhisatvapranāmā || 
lambanajāya matyamana yathābhireṣitamantra || 
ugrakiraṇānnagnā pratyālīḍhasthitā || 
dvibhujāpinnonata payodharā raktavarṇā ||
catuṃ pracaṇḍavantula trinayanā drutaṃvavicaraṃcitaṃ ||
asatsaṃkalpavarjitaṃ || mantrākṣaramekacittato varjayedyo ca khedo bhavati || 
tataḥ ucchāyāryaragaṇḍavyuhādi sutrāni || tathā aṣṭā

<p. 50b> daśalokadhātu sthitā || sarvvatathāgatahṛdayasakadanatyavācayat ||
pūjayitvā anantapranacātuñjītā || tuñjātārāne 
namaste ṇāhārasambhavārāṇe || namaste ṇāhāramastavārānbhimantritaṃ 
kṛtvā ||
ayapiṇḍa sarvvabuddhabodhisatvebhyo || nivedyamadhyamātrayā 
bhoktavyamātrayā bhoktavya || 

tatrāyaṃmantra || namaḥ sarvvabuddha bodhisatvānāṃḥ oṃ vaṃ laṃ dade 
tejomālini svāhā || 

bhuktaśyeṣācārāya ro'moghacandrahṛdaya 
namasakṛdabhimantrotsaṣṭapiṇḍātavyaṃ || satatrānubuddhaḥ sukhasiddhitī dadāti 
|| bhuktaviśrāntaśvapāpadeśanādikaṃ || kṛtvā sadharmmārāmantavatiṣṭe tata || 
yadi śakto bhavatī || aparākṣapi

<p. 51a> sarvvamantrarakṣādi parikalaṃ || 
pūjādikaṃ vidhāya pūrvvavajrapaṃ kuryyāt ||
vikācaprākārapañcasucikalādikaṃ ||
visarjjarasmimālānyā kavacaṃ kuryyāt ||
anyonyāguliśriṣṭāmasabhūbhaṃga bhṛkuṭi ||
nityantaramuṣṭiṃ kṛtvā madhyame ||
sucyākārea praśāraya tarjjanī || yugaratasyāstṛtīya parvvanyasyat ||
aṃguṣṭau ca pārśvetarasmimāriṇīmudrāḥ mantra ||
namaste yadvikāṇāṃ sarvvatathāgatānāṃḥ mahāsamantenaḥ sarvvatathāgatoḥ 
tānakadharmmadhātvebhyaḥ trāsaṃgate svāhā || 

pūrvvarātrā pararātrā tāsarīkāya sadharmmasvādhyāyadinā karttavyā || 
madhyamayā me mañcakarahitāyā saryyāyā saṃbudha

<p. 51b> bodhisatvānāṃ savāgata || pranamyannayet || vijñāptañca kuryyāt || 
adhitiṣṭhantu mā sarvva buddha bodhisatvā || nuttarasiddhivaradāyakāśca bhavantu 
|| sarvvopadravāśca praśamayantīti || 

imāṃ sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā || nāmāparājitā mahāpratyaṃgirā 
mahāvidyā subhāṣitā || rakṣā kurvvantu guptiṃ paritrānaṃ || parigrahaṃ 
paripāraṇaṃ || śānti svasti yenaṃ || daṇḍaparihāraṇaṃ || sastraparihāraṇaṃ || 
viṣadūḥpanaṃ || viṣanāsanaṃ || śīmābandhanaṃ || dharaṇībandhaṇaṃñca || 
rakṣāṃ kurvvantu jīvantu || varṣasataṃ pasyantu saradāsataṃ || 

ityatā mahāpratyaṃgirāyā ayameva ca viddhinā ca || mahāpratyaṃgirā 
mahāvirājñā subhāṣitā || rakṣā kurvvantu 

<p. 52a> guptiṃ paritrānaṃ || parigrahaṃ paripālanaṃ || śāntiṃ svastyayanaṃ || 
daṇḍaparihāraṇaṃ || sastraparihāraṇaṃ || viṣaduḥkhaṇaṃ || vikhanāsanaṃ || 
śīmābandhanaṃ || dharaṇībandhanaṃñca || rakṣā kurvvantu || mama 
saparivārasya sarvvasatvānāñca svāhā || 

imāṃ sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrāyā || mahāvajraśṛkharāyā 
mahāpratyaṃgirāyā || ayameva ca vidhinā pratyahaṃ yāvat pūrṇamāsi rakṣa 
jāpo bhavati || yovāyā vaddhā siddhinīmittāni prādurbhavanti || 

tata pūrṇamāsyādi tithiṣu kṛta bhakta || chedoyavāsayokhadhaṃsambalī 
pallavopaciṣṭa || kuśapiṇḍikopaviṣṭau vā || caitya bhaṭṭa puṣṭaka 
pratimādināmanya tasyāgrata || kṛtaḥ mukta samāvakīrṇamaṇḍalakaṃkarakṣā

<p. 52b> pūjādiparikara || tato pūrvvabuddhadharmmodayā vaddhyā tatmantra mama 
smaret || tata svadevatāmudrā vaddhyā mantrasakāṣṭa || vārān ccāryya samayaṃ 
darśayet || tata sarvvabuddha bodhisatvān pranamya || cakravajrādikaṃ gṛhitvā || 
samantabhadra tathāgatakāyā || mabhirambanasvasamāṃhita siddhau 
hṛdayamādhyāya || sarvvabuddhabodhisatvapramālaṃvana jāyamasyasyana || 

vajraśṛkharāyā mahāpratyaṃgirāyā || tatrāyaṃ sarvvabuddha 
bodhisatvapuṃṇya jñānasaṃbhārān || anumodanāsvāsacetanayā || 
saṃdhyagārān prabhṛti tāvajayet || yāvaccarātre sūryodaya || vātacakrādika 
sevasyaṃ prajvalati || jvalilite cākāśāt || buddhotpāda iva mahānimirttāni || 
puṣpavṛṣṭī dundubhi dhvani || divya

<p. 53a> ghoṣa tathāgatasādhakārādinī || buddhakṣatrakaṃdinīcātyadbhūtāni 
bhavanti || sarvvavidyākarakulāni santi patitāni || tairabhiṣiṃcate 
sarvalokadhātuṣuḥ || 

namaḥ sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā || nāmāparājitā mahāpratyaṃgirā 
|| mahāvidyā sarvvabuddha bodhisatvāmārādhakā || pañcabhijñaḥ || 
sarvvabuddha bodhisatvābhinandito bodhisatvo || caryyācārividyādhararājo bhavati 
|| anantavidhadharastriparipāna || sukhānupā ina vṛtasmātkāryyādviyate || vaiva ca 
kāyanānupūrvvasaṃbhāropacayate || sarvvabuddho 
bodhisatvobhūmirākātiyāvabhisaṃbuddhete vanti || anyāśca buddha bodhisatvo 
darśana cintāmanibhadraghaṭādi || yāvat sarvvalokadhātuṣu || laukika lokotta

<p. 53b> siddhiyā || ramanaika vidhāna sāmānyaviśeṣa || paṭalā dṛṣṭata vā vidhai 
nāmantrai || tantrai navalokya nirvicikicchai || sādhanīyātaṃ siddhyaṃti || 
tyejamupāyavatāsādhanī || anupādayastvaṃ yathāśaktisādhanī || anupāyastvaṃ 
yathāśaktisādhāna karttayaṃ yathā || tenāhaṃ śakti itināvasāṃditavyaṃ || 
anta ekāmapyātmarakṣāṃ kṛtvā || sīmābandhañca cintayitvā || tata 
mantrānaccāryya yāvadicchagapeta sādhayadvā || vidyānurupaṃ 
karmmānurūpaṃ paścātmeva siddhyati || ekopi tailokelacchitaṃ hyameti 
taṃtraivarāt || 

amoghasiddhāśca yaṃ pratyaṃgirā mahāvinubhāṣitā || 

amoghasiddhāścāyaṃ trisamayarāja || mahāpratyaṃgirā mahāvidyā 
nivighnasiddhiśca || maniṣitaviddhi

<p. 54a> siddhānāṃ || sarvvabuddhabodhisatvāṇaṃ vananātraṃ kṛtvā || 
jagadarthacittena saṃganuṣṭhānaṃ || 

oṃ hūṁ bhrūṁ hraṁ hrīṁ kṣrīṁ rakṣa (2) māṃ mama sarvvasatvānāṃ ca svāhā || oṃ 
namo bhagavati rakṣāṃ kuru svāhā || 

oṃ namo sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā || nāmāparājītā 
mahāpratyaṃgirā mahāvidyārājñā || mama saparivārasya sarvvasatvānāṃ ca 
|| rakṣa (2) māṃ guptiṃ paritrāṇaṃ || parigrahaṃḥ paripālanaṃ || śānti 
svastiyanaṃ || daṇḍaparihāraṃ || sastraparihāraṃ || viṣaduḥkhanaṃ || 
viṣanāsanaṃ || śīmābandha || dharaṇībandhaṃñca || rakṣā kuru hūṁ hūṁ vajro 
uṣṇīṣa hūṁ svāhā || 

