nakhatonāpi parato naḥ dvābhyājāyate kathaśataḥ ||
sthitisaktiyuktasyaḥ vināśa upapadyate ||
nāsvato'dhaviṣāṇyaḥ na samasyamatā kathaḥ ||
bhāvanāthāṃtara nāsoḥ nārppanathāṃntara mataḥ ||

<p. 78a> athāntare bhavyanityoḥ nārppanarthāthataret ||

