kuśalaetu bhavati || yatra yatropapapsyante || tatra tatro viharatiśca bhaviṣyati || 
śīlasamādhīprajñāpuṃnyasaṃbhāragandhena || saugandhikamaiva karoti || 

yaḥ kaścidbhagavan kulaputro vā || kuladuhitā vā || bhikṣu

<p. 94a> vā bhikṣuṇī vā || upāsakā vā || upāśikā vā || tāsayo vāḥ kaścinsatva 
|| sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣaśītāntapatre || mahāvajroṣṇīṣadbhadaya mūdṛsya || 
śuklāṣṭamyāṃ mupavāsaṃ kuryyāt || saptavārān mahāvajroṣṇīṣa 
hṛdayamanāriyata || pariyataḥ parivṛtaḥ puraskṛta || bhagavan dṛṣṭa eva 
dharmmabindutirana sāmānyapratikāṃkṣitavyā || katamervāśati yadukta || 
rogāścākāyatotyasyanto || utpannāśyāsya rogā || karmmavasya na śighraṃ 
varggayāsyanti || snigdhamanojñaślekṣagātrāśca bhaviṣyanti || guptendrīyo'rtha 
pratilaṃbhaścāsya bhaviṣyanti || utpanāścārthana caurā pratimokṣanti || agninā 
na dahyante || udaka hṛdayante || na rājā śaknoti manetmāpyapantu

<p. 94b> karmmāntāścāsya sphitā bhavīṣyanti || nāsanīroḍakabhayaṃ 
bhaviṣyanti || na rogavṛṣṭiṃ bhaviṣyanti || 
saptavārān mahāvajroṣṇīṣa mahāpratyaṃgirā || 
hṛdayena bhasmāṇḍakaṃ parijapyaṇḍigviṇḍi || 
gandharvva urddhañca kṣatratpavadho dātavyaḥ ||
sarvopadravā upasamina ojorā || ojopaharantu śakravanti || 
sarvvasatvānāṃ ca kṣatrasya dātavyaḥ || 
sarvvopadravā upadravo mīna cāsya śatrubhayaṃ bhaviṣyati ||
na ca kāṣoḍābhayaṃ na ca ḍākinībhayannacālya tivro ||
kleśopakleśo bhaviṣyati || nāgninā na viṣyana na śastrena kāraṃ kariṣyanti ||
devatā cāśyasatataṃ rakṣāṃ varaṇa guptaya sthāsyanti ||
yatra yatroya koyapatsyante

<p. 95a> tatra tatra virahitaśca bhaviṣyanti || maitrī karuṇāmuditopekṣā'nti ||

ime viṃśati ranusamaprati kātikākṣitavyā || aparā naṣṭau dharmmā pariraspyante 
