kāraṃ kariṣyati || sūpratisthita bhaviṣyati || nādhomukhakāra kariṣyati || 
maraṇakāla.ākṣaye pratisārañcāsya bhaviṣyati || yatra cātya buddhakṣatre 
prāṇadhistatropapatti bhaviṣyati || avirahitaśca bhaviṣyanti || kalpāṇamitreṇa

