sparśavihāratāmbā || pratijāniyā || didaṃjānāmīdaṃ paśyāmi || duḥkhaṃ 
jānāmi || samudraya nirodhaṃ mārgaṃ jānāmi || kiṃ paśyāmi || devān 
paśyāmi || nāgān paśyāmi || garuḍān paśyāmi || gandhavān paśyāmi || 
kinnarān paśyāmi || mahoragān paśyāmi || bhūtān paśyāmi || pretān 
paśyāmi || piśāścan paśyāmi || putanān paśyāmi || kaṭapuṭanān paśyāmiḥ ||

<p. 105a> chāyān paśyāmi || apasmārān paśyāmi || ostārakān paśyāmi || 

devānāṃ śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || nāgānāṃ śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || yakṣānāṃ 
śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || garūḍānāṃ śabdaṃ śṛnomi || gandharvvānāṃ śabdaṃ 
śṛṇomi || asurānāṃ śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || marūtānāṃ śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || 
mahoragānāṃ śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || bhūtānāṃ śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || pretānāṃ 
śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || piśāścanāṃ śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || kumbhāṇḍānāṃ 
śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || puṭanānāṃ śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || kaṭapuṭanānāṃ śabdaṃ 
śṛṇomi || chāyānāṃ śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || apasmārānāṃ śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || 
ostārakānāṃ śabdaṃ śṛṇomi || 

devānāṃ darśanāyopa saṃkrāmati || nāgānāṃ darśanāyopa śaṃkrāmati ||

<p. 105b> yakṣān darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati || gandharvvān 
darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati || garūḍān darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati ||
kinnarān darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati || mahoragān darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati ||
manuṣyān darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati || amanuṣyān darśanāyopasaṃkrāmati ||
bhūtān darśanāyopasaṃkrāmati || pretān darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati ||
piśāścān darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati || kumbhāṇḍān 
darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati || puṭanān darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati || kaṭapuṭanān 
darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati ||
chāyān darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati || apasmārān darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati ||
ostārakān darśanāyopaśaṃkrāmati || 

mana āpaścaturaśīti kalpakoṭiniyūta śatasahasrāṇi ||

<p. 106a> jātau jātau jāti smaro bhaviṣyati ||

caturāśīti vajrakulakoṭi || niyutaśatasahasrāni || vidyādevatā nityaṃḥ 
satatasamitaṃ || rakṣāvarṇṇaguptiṃ paritrānaṃ || parigrahaṃḥ paripālaṇaṃ ||
śāntiḥ svastiyanaṃ || daṇḍaparihāraṃḥ sastraparihāraṃ || viṣduḥkhanaṃḥ 
vikhanāsanaṃ || śīmābandhanaṃḥ dharaṇībandhanaṃñca rakṣā kurvvantu ||
jīvantu varṣasataṃ paśyantu || saradāsataṃ sānti svasti svāhā ||

parimīmāṃ sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā ||
nāmāparājītā mahāpratyaṃgirā || mahāvidyānubhāvena 
pañcaśatajojanaṣṭita || sarvvaduṣṭapraduṣṭān sarvamārān || nāśaya (2) chinda (2) 
bhinda (2) hūṁ

<p. 106b> hūṁ phaṭ phaṭ svāhā || 

oṃ mahāvajroṣṇīṣa mahābhūtapretapiśāśca pasmāragaṇā saparivārān ḥ 
nāsaya (2) khaṇḍa (2) hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ phaṭ dahananāsāya svāhā || 

sarvvagrahānāṃ saparipurakānāṃ || 

tadyathā ||
oṃ namo siṃhavikrānta vikramena kṛtāni caḥ buddhe (2) śuddhe (2) vajre (2) padme (2) 
sara (2) prasara (2) smara (2) krīḍa (2) krīḍaya (2) maraya (2) māraya (2) jambhaya (2) stambhaya 
(2) ghaṭa (2) ghāṭaya (2) mama saparivārasya sarvvasatvānāñca sarvvavighnān ḥ 
nivāraya (2) sarvvavighnān ḥ chinda (2) bhinda (2) kṣapaya (2) śānte (2) dānte (2) dāpaya (2) 
dāmaya (2) durdāpaya (2) duḥkhaṃ bhagavatī śrīyaṃ kuru svāhā ||

oṃ vajroṣṇīṣa śītāntapatre

<p. 107a> mahāmāyā praśāddhaye mama sarvvaduṣṭān ḥ nāśaya (2) mocaya (2) 
vimocaya (2) sarvvapāpāṇiḥ rakṣa (2) vajre (2) cande (2) candinī (2) turu (2) kuru (2) muru (2) 
hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ phaṭ svāhā ||

oṃ vajraśṛṃkhāre ātmarakṣa (2) sumu (2) mucu (2) jaya (2) muṃjaya (2) svapna (2) mukhu (2) 
muvu (2) hūṁ (2) vajra (2) hiya (2) havāhave puraya puraya bhagavatī ||
mama saparivārasya sarvvasatvānāñca || sarvvatathāgatānāṃdhiṣṭānāṃ 
dhiṣṭite svāhā || 

oṃ hūṁ hrīṁ dhūṁ dhīṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || iti māravighnaśānti ||

atha khalu bhagavanta pañcāmṛtasādhanaṃ || yena samyagvīdhānenaḥ 
sarvvasiddhiphalodayaṃ || brāhmaṇe garbhasaṃjāteḥ gṛhnaya siddhigopitaṃ ||

<p. 107b> tasyālocananāmaśvaḥ prakhyāntasiddhisammatāḥ ||
śyāmavarṇasubhadrāgiḥ kṛṣṇatālaka locana ||
tasyā ratnakulīprāptoḥ sādhaye sutragopitaṃ ||
saṃpūrṇakṛtagātratuḥ saubhāgya karūṇapadmanī ||
khādyapānena saṃpujeḥ margha dadyādvicakṣaṇā ||
tatkṣaṇe kunduruṃ kāryyaḥ manyonye śukrantu grāhayat ||
tasmānnata kulannāma khyāpitā ca tathāgatā ||
pūrvvokta vidhānenaḥ saṃpūrṇasiddhijāyate ||
ādipuṣpaprasastasyāḥ drajakīrtti prakīrttitāḥ ||
samayī yadiśaṃ prāpyaḥ mātaṃgī sevayet sadā ||
māsamadya tathā raktaṃḥ grāhayedvicakṣaṇaṃ ||
pañcāmṛta yathāprāptaṃḥ hastasaśoṣṭa mahācyate ||
yadiśagrāhye sāddhakaḥ ṛddhisiddhiṃ kākṣiṇaḥ ||

<p. 108a> jñānapradī yakṣakoṇe pratibhānavati || sarvvabuddhāvalokite 
yogapariniṣpanna ||
gambhīradravagrāhya tryadhvapariniṣpanna || gambhīradravagrāhya 
dhvapariniṣpanta || bodicittasajana sarvāvimikte || sarvvatathāgatabhāṣita 
dharmmasāgara || saṃbhūta dharmmarājabhāṣite || amoghaśravaṇa 
mahāsamantabhadraṃ bhūniryyāte || vyākaraṇaparipāpaṇi sarvvasiddhi 
namaskṛte || sarvvabuddha bodhisatva || saṃjanani bhagavatī buddhamātre || 
āryyasaṃgha samantabhadrāya || bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya || dīpaṅkara 
tathāgatāya || vajradhātunāma bodhisatvāya mahāsatvāya mahākāruṇīkāya ||

oṃ araḍe karaḍe arade 

<p. 108b> karamahāpratyaṃgire hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ phaṭ svāhā ||

aparimite tānuśasaya || imāṃ paṭhati sakalpa sahasrāpacitaṃ ||
karmmāvaraṇamavalamanummāryya || sarvvanayati saṃkṣayaṃ || anekabuddha 
sahasraṃ paśyati || pariśuddha buddhakṣatreṣupapadyate || ekaviṃśati divasāni ||
triskṛtvādivā samupaśyeyaṃ || ekaviṃśati buddhaṃ bhagavantaṃ || 
padmosama niṣarṇa paśyati || śuddhakṣatropaparttiṃva pratilabhate || 
bodhisatvasaṅgīsubhūpavya || erimīmāṃ sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣaḥ mudre mudre 
mahāmudre || vajrakāyasaṃhatena pariśuddhe sarvvakarmmāvaraṇaśuddhe 
svāhā || oṃ vajroṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā || nāmāparājitā mahāpratyaṃgirā || 
mahāvidyārājñā sarvva

<p. 109a> tathāgatoṣṇīṣaḥ mudre (2) mahāmudre || vajrakāyasaṃhatena pariśuddhe ||
sarvvakarmmāvaraṇaśuddhe svāhā ||
oṃ vajroṣṇīṣa śītāntapatre sarvvatathāgatadhātuḥ dhara dhara oṁ svāhā ||
oṃ vajraśṛṃkharāyā mahāpratyaṃgirāya sarvvatathāgatahṛdaya svāhā ||
oṃ namo bhagavate samantaśriya tathāgatāya || oṃ bhadre (2) mahābhadre 
samantabhadre || sarvvatathāgatadhātudhare || deśabhūmīpratiṣṭhite || 
sarvvatathāgatahṛdayānāṃ || dhiṣṭhānādhiṣṭhite svāhā ||

atha kṣaṇe garbhavāraḥ pratisarāṃ hṛdā smaran || saṃjapanadhāraṇīṃ vidyā 
kṛtāñjalirnya vedayat || 
oṃ namo bhagavatye āryyaśrī mahāpratisarayai || 
rakṣapratisarādevīḥ

<p. 109b> mīkārāgāramāśrita || saṃsāraṃ jaganmātaḥ jagatmātā śaraṇyake || 
kṛtvā vijñāpanāmitthaṃḥ tuṣṭāvasahasrā punaḥ || garbhāśrito vālako hiḥ 
smṛta pūrvanivāśikaṃ || 

pratiṃgira amarādyaiḥ pūjitāṃ tvānnatosmi || pratipadaḥ janarakṣāḥ kārīṇī 
sarvvakālāḥ || bhṛgudahaṇatyamudrāḥ yāta duḥkhe surakṣāṃ || 
ripuviṣabhayaharttiḥ rājye bhogyādikarttīṃḥ || parivṛta nijavarggāḥ 
bhaktadattāpavarggā || karitaduritadharmmāḥ mokṣalābhaikamārgā || kṛtaśura 
asurānāṃ dharmmakāryyārthakāmī || stuti kṛtajinagaṇānāṃḥ 
sarvvarakṣaikasaṃgā || pratisara amarādyaiḥ pūjitā tvāṃnnatosmi || pratipada

<p. 110a> janarakṣāḥkāriṇī sarvvakāmāḥ || bhṛguvahanatpamudrāḥ 
pādaduṣenarāṇāḥ || ripuvikhabhayaharttīḥ rājyabhogyādikarttā ||
prahṛtanijasarāṇāṃḥ jñānadattāyavargā || karitadhanamārggaḥ jñānadatta 
sthitānāṃ || śṛnu baliviśeṣāḥ bodhisatvānna seṣmanaḥ || kuśalaśatasahasraḥ 
saṃciyā kalpakoṭyā || buddhaśatasahasrāṇāḥ pūjayitvā anantān || 
sarvvajagatahitāyaḥ jāyate dharmmacittā || vratata parapitānāṃḥ kṣānti 
pāragatānāṃ || hariśiricaritānāṃḥ puṃṇyajñānodgatānāṃ || 
vipulagatimatīnīḥ puṃṇyajñānāsayānāṃ || daśabalasamatulyaḥ jāyate 
bodhicittaṃ || yāvajina triyadhānāṃḥ pūjanāthāyayuktāthā

<p. 110b> khagapathapariṇāmaṃḥ śodhayaṃ sarvvakṣatraṃ ||
saṃmyakāgatanugatartheḥ yāvatā sarvvadharmmān || 
mokṣajagatahitārthe nityamovodyatānāṃ || jinagunaniratānāṃḥ 
bodhicaryyāśayānāṃ || tribhūvanahitakāryyaḥ jāyate bodhicittaṃ || saṃyagata 
manasādyaḥ dharmmajñānasamāddhe || pramudita sumatīnāṃḥ 
dānadharmmaratānāṃ || sakalajagatahitārtheḥ nityamevādyatānāṃ || 
jinasaranagatānāṃḥ satvarakṣāvratānāṃ || anugatakuśalānāṃḥ 
kṣāntisārasya bhāṃjāṃ || viditagunaraśānāṃḥ tyaktamāmotsavānāḥ ||
nihitaśubhamatīnāḥ dāntasaumyā śayānāṃ || sakalahitavidhāneḥ jāyate 
bodhicittaṃ || nihitaśubhayadulita 

<p. 111a> vargāḥ mokṣalābhaikamārgā || kṛta narasurasargāḥ kāritāṃ 
naṃgabhaṃgā || stutikṛtasuragargāḥ sarvvarakṣaikasaṃgā ||
prahṛta sakalavighneḥ sarvvalokaikamānya || dasavalakṛtadhānyeḥ 
pañcadevīvaranyo || viṣamapada daśaraṇyaḥ sarvvadātvānnamaste ||
vasitaḥ iva araṇyaḥ dāyadagdhaviramya || sakalajanamuvāñcāḥ 
puraṇyakāmadhyenu || abhilaṣitaphalāptoḥ kalpavṛkṣāgavallī || 
asurasurananaughaiḥ vaṃditāghprabjayugmaṃ mā || urasi lalitahārīḥ 
ratnamālādirukyāṃ || uḍapatiśaradīptīḥ śaṃkhakundābhigātrāṃ || 
grahanabhaya suhantāṃḥ vajrasatvāsmikāntāṃ || śravanalalitaloleḥ kuṇḍale 
saṃvahanti || kumuṭamaṇiśikhābhiḥ kāśitāṃgānnamāmi ||

<p. 111b> janani sakaladukhoḥrttāriṇītvaṃ praśīda ||
śayadivigatarakṣāṃḥ rakṣa me mātarambā ||
sakarūṇaruditaṃ māḥ tvaṃ dayā svasthabhūtān ||
kṛtaśaraśinipātāṃḥdgatistvaṃ gatinau ||
paṭhati pratisarāyāḥ stotra metatmadāya ||
jvalana jalaviṣāṇāṃḥ cauraśarddūlakānāṃ ||
samadanidhanakānāṃḥ bhītayā nāśayanti ||
pratipada malabhaṃgaḥ kāmunādhaikyalobhaṃ ||
nijaparigaṇayuktāḥ dharmmakāmārthavṛdhā ||
ripugaṇaparimuktāḥ maukhyameva prabhuktā ||
dadati vipulabhogyaṃḥ kāmadā sarvvadāsau ||
vihita sakalapāraṃḥ mokṣamāyānti cānte ||
vigaritanayanāṃbuḥ sāñjaliṃ saṃvilāpī ||
stutimiti pracakāraḥ traibhavānāṃ jananyā || 
dadati vipulabhogyaṃḥ kāmadā sarvvadāsau ||

<p. 112a> vihitasakalapāraṃḥ mokṣamāyānti cānte ||
bhavatu mamatu pātuḥ saṃpataṃtyāḥ kṛsānau ||
tanukuśalasurakṣāḥ itthamevaṃ sucittaṃ ||
vipacatusapi sarvvaṃḥ mādṛsa karmmabhogya ||
sasuranaracayānāṃḥ mātṛ bhrātṛ druhānāṃ ||
karuta kuruta dharmmaḥ yena mokṣa suratyaṃ ||
jatharanirayavāsaḥ mātu pāpaṃ kadācit ||
prabhavati na kariṣyeḥ karmma etādṛśaṃn ||
udaranarakavāsaḥ yena dāsāvatāraṃ ||
satata śubhasuvetāḥ sādhayiṣyāmi bodhiṃ ||
kṛta jagati surakṣāḥ yena kaivalyaprāptiḥ ||
iti samudita cetāḥ karmmanā digdhacitta ||
pratisarā avatātmāḥ sānvikāṃ mārabimbā ||
amiśamiti vadatsoḥ rindayatta svakarmma || 
pratibhaya viṣadigdhaḥ stasthivānnarbhakaḥ sannā ||

<p. 112b> atha tasyā prabhāvyanaḥ tatsatyadharmmayostathā ||
svabhāvāttāpakaḥ sogniḥ śītatvamagamattata ||

aho sudhanyāḥ jagadekamātā || prakāntadaivāḥ ripuvarggabhīmā ||
yasyāḥ prabhāvoḥ ddhihatānyapāpāḥnprayāti vahnijala śītalatvaṃ ||

vajreṇa nimitta vāḥ kṛtimādadhānā || paryyekamāsanakṛtāḥ drutahaimavarṇā ||
dvātriṃsalakṣaṇamalīḥ masamocanārthaṃ || rajje ye jvalanamaḥdhyagate 
vahārāḥ || imāṃ pañcamāttṛbhiḥ || sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā || 
nāmāparājitā || mahāpratyaṃgīrāyā duḥ || sarvvadevāsuragarūḍamanuṣyāṃ 
|| grahagaṇabhiraṣṭā viśati nakṣatrādi

<p. 113a> sarvveṣāṃ mahāvajroṣṇīṣa mahāpratyagirādevatā ||
pādukābhāva kṛtā vanditā || mānitāḥ pūjā kṛtvā abhinanditā ||
stuti kṛtā || namastu abhāvasvabhāva sarvvadharmmāṇāṃḥ 
bhūtadharmmaprakāśitāṃ || dharmmādharmmavinimuktaṃḥ satye dharmma 
namastute || iti pūjāgāthāmabhāṣitā ||

atha homādidhumāgnikuṇḍāni kārayet || 

ita homamityādi || puṣṭacetameti || bhuktaguḍañcareṇa utkaṇṭhārāgaḥ ||
udvirgjanasatkāyena || maṇḍalākāraṃ vatulaṃ kuṇḍaṃ || 
vāpyakāraṃñcaturasraṃ || khadhāturiti trikonaṃ || vistārākhyānāyāha || 
hastāyāmamityādi || yathā paśya iti || atrāpi dvihastamevā

<p. 113b> viṃśadaṃ gunaviṃśatyaṃśulamānandānākhyatamāhuḥ 
hastāyāmamityādi || yathā paśya iti || atrāpi dvihastamevāviṃśadaṃ 
gunaviśatyaṃ || śulamānandānākhetamāha || hastārddhamityādi || 
dvipañcetyādi || pañcapañcāya || ṣodaśamasya || prathamapuṣṭasya || aśya 
paścimapuṣṭaṣṭyāmyaktau yaujyā || pūrvvāhna śāntikaṃ kuryyādaparāhna tu 
pauṣṭikaṃ || 

madhyāhne krurakarmmāniḥ arddharātre tu vaśyayoḥ || akhaṇḍaśikharāgāstraḥ 
parṇṇadvayavahā śubhāḥ ||
śasṣāyādbhayavṛkṣāṇāṃḥ karmmabhedena saṃharet ||
caturddaśāṅgulāḥ puṣṭauḥ śāntaye dvādaśāṃgulā ||
vaśyadaśyaṃgulādveṣāḥ ccānaiguṣṭāgulā punaḥ ||
tathā śāntau śarkarāmitāḥ 'khaṇḍataṇḍulā tathā ||

<p. 114a> vaśyākṛṣṭā ghṛtamadhuśakkarā || miśraṃ raktakuśumamutpalaṃ vā ||
tathā pauṣṭikatambhanāyā || pītakuśrati ghṛtāktāni || tathāmāraṇe 
kaṇḍekadhuntura viṣarājiko || lavaṇaśuṣkarukṣavajānikaṃ || 
tatailāktānihotavyāni || tathāvoṭane vṛkṣakākapakṣā hotavyā || 
evamaparāparamanvaṣanīyaṃ || 

vrīhīn vā samipaścaiva prokṣa dakṣiṇa pārśveta || 
sthāpayitvādyathāmantraṃḥ tatsarvvamapibhimantrayet ||
hastausaṃpūtapuṣṭānāṃḥ madhyamādau praśarayet ||
sarvvaśodhanamudrāmantra || oṃ śri svāhā || ghṛtaśodhanamantra || oṃ svāhā || 
dravyakṣālanamantra || oṃ juṁ svāhā ||

<p. 114b> vrīhīśodhanamantra || oṃ rakṣa (2) svāhā || itara dravyaśodhanamantra || oṃ 
aḥ svāhā || 

samidhaśodhanamantra || kuṇḍādūnaṃ piyet || kuṇḍe kāṣṭaṃ 
homāṃgasaṃmbhavaṃ || nātidīrghān khaṇḍaśrānapūrvvādi || digmukhāna 
kuśānā prakīryapunarekāgrāṃ || vedikāyāṃ niveśayet || 
candranāgaruvṛkṣaṇaḥ amauvāghandhapādapaiḥ ||
agniprajvālya homāgeḥ paścādāvāhayet punaḥ |
tapvayedagnimadhātuḥ padmamātuṇḍamaṇḍale ||
agnidevaṃ trinetraṃ caḥ caturvvaktaṃ caturbhujaṃ ||
dahine varadā vāmeḥ daṇḍakamaṇḍaludharaṃ ||
karmmānurupabhedenaḥ reyone vibhaya svabhāvai || mahādharmma bhāvayet ||

oṃ ehyehi mahābhūta deva ṛṣidvijasattama ||

<p. 115a> gṛhitvāhuti mahārasamīna mahārakṣmī sannihito bhava svāhā ||

āvāhanagāthā || arghapādyavidhāyāsoḥ dhūpaśāṣāparigraha ||

tatoyāpamarghamantra || oṃ jaṁḥ hūṁḥ vaṁ hoḥ khaṁḥ raṁ || pādyamastra || oṃ nirī hūṁ 
khaṁ || nivedyamantra || oṃ ḹṁ dhaṁ || iṣṭārthasiddhi buddhyaiva sayasi mudrāharet ||
oṃ vajrānara mahābhūta jvālaya sarvvabhasmī kuru sarvvaduṣṭān hūṁ phaṭ 
dṛśye || ja hūṁ vaṁ hoḥ samayastvaṃ samayo'haṃ ||
samayadānagāthā || yāvatmantravinyastaḥ savyapāṇi gṛhītayā ||
satpātri śruvayo dhyātaḥ cihnāturvvajavījayā || adhiṣṭita trikāyāyaḥ 
ratnasambhavamauriye || triśūlavajrajihvāyaḥ divyaṃ

<p. 115b> dadāti vaṃhnaye || oṃ agnaye svāhā || sarppirtha || oṃ 
sarvvapāpadahanavajrāya amukasya sarvvapāpan daha (2) svāhā || kṛṣṇatilānāṃ 
|| oṃ vajrapuṣṭaye svāhā ||
akhaṇḍasālitaṇḍulānāṃ || oṃ sarvvasampadaya svāhā || daṃdhyannaparamānaye 
|| oṃ vajravījāye svāhā || aśokadhānyaśye || oṃ mahāvegāya svāhā || yavānāṃ 
|| oṃ mahābalāya svāhā || māṣānāṃ || oṃ vajraghasmarāya svāhā || 
gvadhumasya || sarvvatrakarmmaśeṣaviddhiḥ samāna || karmmānurupeṇa 
viśyaṣaśamidho || viśyaṣamantrena hotavyāḥ || varṇagandhaśikhāvarttarūpe 
śabdodibhiḥ śubhaiḥ || śubhaṃ dānapateragnirbodhaye tadghṛtāhutiḥ ||

<p. 116a> śāntike sītavarṇābhaḥ pauṣṭike pītasannibha ||
vaśyarakto'bhicāre tuḥ kṛṣṇo vahniḥ praśasyate ||
makracāpanibho samyaḥ dakṣiṇāvarttaśannibha ||
mṛdaṅgadhvani gaṃbhiraḥ snigdha ekasikhāsikhī ||
prabhūtadhūmañca savisphuliṅga kramāsma ||
mūrttiṣṭati mandaṃ vicchidyamānārcipeta tejākṣma ||
sakṛṣṇo bhramalā savarṇā || śula śūryyanibhaścaivaḥ tathāgoṣārṣa 
sannibhaḥ || samūcayeda kalyāṇamevadyuparaṇaṃ ||
homāte saṃhṛtajvālagāthāpānayā || viśṛṣṭavyapūyādiḥ pūjāvyūhaṃ 
visarjjayet || svārthaṃ caiva parārthacaḥ sotaṃ gacchahavyatuka || āgaṣyasi 
yathākālaṃḥ sarvvasiddhi kuruṣṭa me || vaṃhnaṃnnivāpanadugdhāḥ śāntau

<p. 116b> pauṣṭikaśādhane || pītāmbutistuvaśyādā || vujyantistuvaśyādā ||
vujyeṃ raktāsitaṃ payaḥ || oṃ ghili (2) hūṁ jaḥ svāhetyenena nadyāṃsa puṣpa 
dhūpa vādya bhasma pravāhaṇaṃ || 

imāṃ mahāvajroṣṇīṣa mahāpratyaṃgirā ||
mahāvidyārājñāhomasya dhūmalakṣaṇavidhi || 
oṃ vajrānaradahane hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || varṣaṇavidhānāyāha || samanvāharantu 
mā buddhāya || aśyaṣādikṣuśasthitā || 

oṃ namo vairocanaspharanāyaḥ navanāgarājā || jarendravarūnatvā sarvvanāga || 
mahādhyānāvāhana samādhisakāsā || kṛtaphaṇābhāśapravarāya 
marūpakarmma || sarvvasatve jananī dharmmāya varūṇātmakohaṃ || 
śvabhāvaśudhā sarvvadharmmānāṃḥ

<p. 117a> śvabhāvaśuddho' hūṁ || śvabhāvasuddhadevatātmako'haṃ || 
kāyasuddhā sarvvadharmmānāṃ kāyabhāvasuddho' hūṁ || 
kāyabhāvasuddhadevatātmako'haṃ ||
vākasuddhā sarvvadharmmānāṃḥ vākbhāvasuddho' hūṁ || 
vākbhāvasuddhadevatātmako'haṃ || cittasuddhā sarvvadharmmānāṃḥ 
cittabhāvasudddho' hūṁ || cittabhāvasuddhadevatātmako'haṃ || jantrasuddhā 
sarvvadharmmānāṃḥ jantrabhāvasuddho'hūṁ || jantrabhāva 
suddhadevatātmako'haṃ || tantraśuddhā sarvvadharmmānāṃḥ 
tantrabhāvasuddho'haṃ || tantrabhāvasuddhadevatātmako'haṃ || mantrasuddhā 
sarvvadharmmānāṃḥ mantrabhāvasuddho' hūṁ || 
mantrabhāvasuddhadevatātmako'haṃ || jogasuddhā sarvvadharmmānāṃḥ 
jogabhāvasuddho'hūṁ ||

<p. 117b> jogabhāvasuddhadevatātmako'haṃ ||
dahina pāṇau akārena sūryyamaṇḍalaṃ || vāmapāṇau ākāreṇa 
candramaṇḍalaṃ || oṃ vajrapadmahasto hū(-)īṁ || oṃ vrūṁ āṁ jīṁ khaṁ hūṁ || oṃ rāṁ māṁ 
pāṁ trāṁ aṁ aḥ || oṃ nāgāṣṭaka rakṣa (2) me jīvaṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || oṃ phaṁḥ śīla ||
oṃ phāṁḥ muṣṇiṣa || oṃ phiṁḥ karṇadvayaṃ || oṃ phaṁḥ cakṣudvayaṃ || oṃ phaḥ 
nāsikā || oṃ phoṁḥ vakte || oṃ phaṁḥ hṛdaya || oṃ phaṁḥ nābhi || oṃ phaṁḥ liṃga || oṃ 
phaṁḥ pādadvaya || oṃ phaṁḥ śiṣāya || aṃganyāsa || oṃ ā hūṁ || trikāyādiṣṭhāna || 
oṃ vaṁḥ svāhā || kuliśa || oṃ rūṁḥ svāhā || ghaṇṭha || oṃ

<p. 118a> naṁḥ svāhā || puṣpa || oṃ nāṁḥ svāhā || gandha || oṃ gaṁḥ svāhā || dhūpa 
|| oṃ rāṁḥ svāhā || dīpa || oṃ jāṁḥ svāhā || kalyāṇa(?) || oṃ vajrabhūme svāhā || 
māṇḍālā || oṃ hrīṁḥ hūṁ svāhā || dīpāgandha || oṃ sumbhanī (2) hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ 
svāhā || oṃ āvikṛtānama hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || oṃ hrīṁ kṣrīṁḥ vikṛtānara hūṁ 
hūṁ daśadigaṣṭitamāra marddanīye hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || oṃ vaṁ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ 
svāhā || oṃ jaṁḥ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || oṃ preṁḥ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || oṃ paṁḥ 
hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
oṃ viṁḥ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || oṃ maṁḥ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || oṃ aṁḥ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ 
svāhā || oṃ caṁḥ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || oṃ taṁḥ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || oṃ nīṁḥ 
hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

<p. 118b> oṃ raṁḥ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || oṃ suṁḥ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || 
oṃ vajraśṛṃṣarāyā mahāpratyaṃgire || daśadigapālamāra kṛtā vidyāṃḥ 
tādaya (2) khaṇḍa (2) chinda (2) bhinda (2) hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ phaṭ svāhā || 

ṛṭitī svasvaṣṭadevatā kāmarūpena || svahṛdvijaprakāśita kamalotparasaṃ ||
sūryya kūrvva hūṃkāraniṣpannaṃ || daśadigabandha || kāranānte || 
indrakṛtā vidyābandha || jamakṛtā vidyābandha || varūnakṛtā vidyābandha ||
kuvyarakṛtā vidyābandha || virūḍhakakṛtā vidyābandha || virūpākṣakṛtā 
vidyābandha || dhṛtarāṣṭakṛtā vidyābandha || arddhadiganāgapāśakṛtā 
vidyābandha || urddhadiśa udarakṛtā vidyābandha || oṃ medanīvajrībhava hūṁ ||

<p. 119a> sarvvapāpa uccātana || sarvvapāpavighna uccātana || sarvvamāropadrava 
caturmmārādi || sarvvamanuṣyādi asurapraparāyatānyasyata || tadaha sarvva 
upadravaśāntikaṃ bhāvayitvā || 

maitrībhāva virāgasitaṃḥ vivekaśitaṃḥ veśargapariṇataṃḥ maitrī diśaṃ 
bhāveti || karūṇābhāva vivekasitaṃḥ virāgaśitaṃḥ veśargaparinataṃḥ 
karūṇābhāvabhāvyati ||

muditābhāva vivekasitaṃḥ virāgasitaṃḥ vesargapariṇataṃḥ 
muditābhāvabhāveti || 

upekṣābhāva vivekasitaṃḥ virāgasitaṃḥ vesarggaparinataṃḥ 
mupekṣābhāvabhāveti || 

sarvvasatvasamasā || bhūtvā svahṛttiśvetavaṃkāravīja parināmṛtoḥ ||

<p. 119b> dvārasuranaṇaradaśadiganarūlokadhātu sthita || sarvvadevagaṇeṣṭhā 
tatparasmi || ākarṣana || oṃ āḥ nāgabhava nāgagaṇa devagaṇe śrīvarūna 
nāgarājā saparivārān muhūrmūhūṃ || jalakuṇḍalamaṇḍalākālaḥ āgaccha (2) 
vrūṁ svāhā || ayutajāpa kṛtvā || ākarṣaṇamantra || oṃ vajrāṃkuśaḥ ja svāhā 
|| oṃ vajrapāśaḥ hrīṁ svāhā || oṃ vajrasphotaḥ vaṁ svāhā || oṃ vajrāṃmbe śahoḥ 
svāhā || oṃ vajravarūṇapravarasatkārāyaḥ pātārgha ācamana arghaṃ praticcha 
svāhā || oṃ jaṁ || oṃ hūṁ || oṃ vaṁ || oṃ ho || oṃ āḥ vairocanodbhava vajravarūṃ 
nāgarājāya hūṁ || oṃ vajra vaṁ bījodbhavāya

