sarvvasatva paritrāṇāyātmānanniryyāntayāmiḥ ||
oṃ vāṁ vāsukīnāgarājāḥ pūjopasthānāyaḥ ātmānanniryyāntayāmiḥ ||
sarvvasatva paritrāṇāyātmānanniryyāntayāmiḥ ||
oṃ taṁ takṣaka 

<p. 121b> nāgarājāḥ pūjopasthānāyaḥ ātmānanniryyāntayāmiḥ ||
