oṃ kaṁ karkkoṭakanāgarājāḥ pūjopasthānāyaḥ ātmānanniryyātayāmiḥ ||
sarvvasatva paritrānāyātmānanniryyāntayāmiḥ ||
oṃ paṁ padmanāgarājāḥ pūjopasthānāyaḥ ātmānanniryyātayāmiḥ ||
sarvvasatva paritrāṇāyātmānanniryyāntayāmiḥ ||
oṃ maṁ mahāpadmanāgarājāḥ pūjopasthānāyaḥ ātmānanniryyātayāmiḥ ||
sarvvasatva paritrāṇāyātmānanniryyāntayāmiḥ ||
oṃ kuṁ kulikanāgarājāḥ pūjopasthānāyaḥ ātmānanniryyātayāmiḥ ||
sarvvasatva paritrāṇāyātmānanniryyāntayāmiḥ ||
oṃ śaṁ śatavāhunāgarājāḥ pūjopasthānāyaḥ 

<p. 122a> ātmānanniryyātayāmiḥ ||
