oṃ aṁ asuranāgarājāḥ pūjopasthānāyaḥ ātmānanniryyātayāmiḥ ||
sarvvasatva paritrāṇāyātmānanniryyāntayāmiḥ ||
oṃ caṁ cakṣuṇāgarājāḥ pūjopasthānāyaḥ ātmānanniryyātayāmiḥ ||
sarvvasatva paritrāṇāyātmānanniryyāntayāmiḥ ||

<p. 123a> oṃ aṁ anīlanāgarājāḥ pūjopasthānāyaḥ ātmānanniryyātayāmiḥ ||
