oṃ baṁ bandhananāgarājāḥ pūjopasthānāyaḥ ātmānanniryyātayāmiḥ ||
sarvvasatva paritrānāyātmānanniryyāntayāmiḥ ||
oṃ oṃ oṃ naṁ naṁ naṁ ste ste ste hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ yasoratiṣṭa mohayaṣṭa pāpañca sarvet ||
satanavāmanābhitadeśayāmi || 
bhitaṃ kāruṇyāṃ nimbamanasāpuratojinānāṃ ||
saṃbuddha kuru prajuktaṃ || rate svajaddhimaṃgala kālipūrṇā ||
tatsarvvabhāva amoghastadātaharṣo || buddho mahājananidhe pariṇāmayāmi ||
arddhatadaśacaraṇaṃ prajāmi || pradhvastejyekhanikaṃlaṃ karūṇādṛcittaṃ ||
dharmmavisuddhiṃ sthanujānamṛdaṃ samugraṃ || saṃgha jinātmaje

<p. 124a> na tu nigaṇāya kṛpātmakāyaṃ || sarvvāsanābhimama(?)mvastu 
niyojanārthayet || tyakatu sarvvaparigrahāyaḥ || ahovatā atyantara catvāraśca 
bodhijagadartha siddhiyo || manuttarabodhipadaṃ mahārthadaṃ ||
śāmāśrayāmyeṣa saguhye yānakā || tataḥ saṃboddhi samarapuraṇāt ||

yaṃkārena vāyuddharmmadhvajā kṛtaṃ || tadupari laṃkāre nāgnitrikoṇaṃ 
raktarephālaṃ || tadupari vaṃkārena pavanaśvetaṃ ghaṇṭhalaṃkṛtaṃ || tadupari 
raṃkārena pṛthvi caturaśra || pītakoṇa triśracikavajālaṃkṛtaṃ || tadupari 
śuṃkārena sumerūṃ || caturatnamayaṃ kalasaṃmaṣṭaśṛgopaśobhitaṃ ||
tadupari bhruṃkārena kuṭāñjāra || caturaśraṃ catudvāraṃ catustoranaśobhitaṃ 
|| hārārddhahāra kiṃkinījālaṃ ||

<p. 124b> vakulikrarmmaśīrṣaparyyantaṃ || tatmadhya paṃkārena parināmṛtaṃ || 
padmamaitrīṃ vibhāvya ||

keśarakamātraka || karṇikākopariśotvaṃ koparimṛtaṃ || 
vaṃkārabīja varūṇaṃ vairocanaparināmṛtaṃ || varūnanāgarājā śvetavarṇa ||
manuṣyamukha saptaphanācchāditaṃ || śubhasavyaṃdivaladhara || vāmapāṇau 
nāgapāśavaradhara dravyāliṅgitaṃ || nābheradharmma sarvvālaṃkāraviti 
savyābharaṇaṃ maṇiśobhitaṃ || 

tataḥ pūrvvadale paṃkāraniṣpannamudaṣṭadalakarṇikāmadhya || pūrvvadala 
anantanīlotpara || 
śyāmavarṇaḥ manuṣyamukha || pañcaphanācchāditaṃ śubha savyaṃ ||
dahinapāṇau varadharā || vāmapāṇau pāśavaradhara dravyāliṅgitaṃ ||

<p. 125a> nābheradha sarvvālaṃkāraviti || saryyābharaṇaṃ maniśobhitaṃ || 

tataḥ dakṣiṇadare vāśukināgarājā || śvetavarṇā navaphanācchāditaṃ || 
dakṣiṇapāṇau varadadhara || vāmapāṇau dravyāliṃgīta || vaṃkārabījaṃ 
