oṃ acala nāgarājāya svāhā || 167 ||
oṃ mahātapta nāgarājāya svāhā || 168 ||
oṃ śrīkāntimāna nāgarājāya svāhā || 169 ||
oṃ mahākānti nāgarājāya svāhā || 170 ||
oṃ surupa nāgarājāya svāhā || 171 ||
oṃ mahāsvayambhu nāgarājāya svāhā || 172 ||
oṃ bhadrādi nāgarājāya svāhā || 173 ||
oṃ astiśirṣa nāgarājāya svāhā || 174 ||
oṃ gayāsirṣa nāgarājāya svāhā || 175 ||

<p. 136b> oṃ mṛgaśīrṣa nāgarājāya svāhā || 176 ||
oṃ siṃhamukha nāgarājāya svāhā || 177 ||
oṃ amoghapāśa nāgarājāya svāhā || 178 ||
oṃ amṛtaprabha nāgarājāya svāhā || 179 ||
oṃ mañjuvajra nāgarājāya svāhā || 180 ||
oṃ vairocanādināma nāgarājāya svāhā || 181 ||

ete sata ekāṣṭanāgarājā || muhurmuhurjalakuṇḍalaṃ paśyat ||
kālena kālaṃ varṣayanti || kālena kālaṃ garjjayanti || kālena kālaṃ 
mautsukyamāpatsyante || 

iti nāgaśodhana ||

bhagavānāha || atha khalu vajradhara vajrapāṇi || imāṃ mahāpratyaṃgirā 
mahāvidyārājñā'nubhāvena varṣana vidhānāyāha ||

<p. 137a> samudramṛttikāmityādi || akṣopalakṣaṇatvāt || 
abhāvapakṣeṇadanadīhrada || puṣkiriṇī khātakupānāmubhaya || 
tata mṛttikā grāhyā || 

nāgamekaṃ varūṇa saptaphanāṃ || manuṣyamukhāṃ dvibhujā || 
dakṣiṇapāṇau khaḍgadharaṃ || vāmapāṇau mahāpāśayuktaṃ || 
ṣaḍkāraniṣpanna mṛdaṣṭadalakarṇikāmadhya ||
pūrvvadala anantanīlotparaśyamavarṇā ||
dakṣiṇe vāsukī śītavarṇā || paścime takṣaka raktavarṇā || 
uttare karkkoṭaka kṛṣṇavarṇā || āgneya padma śītavarṇā ||
nai(-)ṛtya mahāpadma dhūmravarṇṇā || vāyavyaṃ saṃkhapāla pītavarṇṇā ||
aiśānyāṃ kulika viśvavarṇṇā || ete cavanakārena

<p. 137b> saptavārān mṛttikā || kāyavākcittaṣṭhitena jāpa kṛtvā || 
oṃ hriṁ kṣrīṁ vikṛtānara naradevadatta hrīṁ hūṁ hūṁ sarvvapātālagatānnāgānāṃ 
|| karṣaya tarjjaya phūṁḥ kāroṣṭāvartta hū || etadbhūjapatre likhitvā sarvveṣāṃ 
nāgānāṃ || hṛdayagopanīyāḥ || oṃ hrīṁḥ kṣrodikarmmā jayet || iti || 
hṛdinyaṣṭamantramāvarttayet || 

oṃ vajraśṛṃkharāyā mahāpratyaṃgirāyā vajroṣṇīṣa oṃ svāhā || 
krurādhyātacittaḥ sakala nīlābharaṇaḥ || aṣṭadiksasthitā nāgapucchāṣṭakaṃ || 
madhya varūṇe mahākanyā silasi ca sarvveṣu || vajroṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā 
kramyasphitaṃ paśyet || jvala hradapañca sakalanāgabhuvanaṃ muhurmuhuḥ 
paśyet ||

<p. 138a> sthaladyamālisaṃghaiśva mānāyudhai || pīḍamādanameva daśasahasra 
mājayet || avaśyamevarṣati || anyato dṛṣṭatvena tu dṛśañca kāryye pratyaṃgire 
maṇḍalañca varttanīyaṃ || tato vāyavye puṣkariṇī ca kāryyāladghī(?)(?) ||
tanmadhā sacāvasampūtanāgāna || prakṣipya hastimadena dena sirolapayet || 
nāgamanakaramena nāgān prakṣayet || kṛṣnagā vīkṣīreṇa 
sarāvasaṃpūtātyaṃntarapūrayet || kṛṣṇaśutreṇa veṣṭaye || pūjā balyādi 
samaya bhakṣaṇe || krurakarmmaviṣaye mevat || samudro nirmmastaṃbhanāyāha || 
kṛṣṇasarpasyānagarddhasya || nimbapatreṇa samābhāḍhānetiśyeṣaḥ || 
gutikāmiti || vanakapramānāṃ ayutamātrajāpena ||

<p. 138b> vidhinya daśasahasrapāpena || ūrmmistambhanavidhi || padermmirāyāti 
tadaikā prakṣaptatavyā || caṇḍabījamiti || dhuttaraphalāntargātabījānāṃ 
viṃsataye || pañcamāṣṭaphalāni vabhāvanti || taṇḍūleti || 
akhaṇḍitaśālitaṇḍulā api tāvanta || evaṃ militvā śatatra ai bhavati || aṣṭalati || 
akṛṣṭavidhināṣṭadalakṣābhimantitena || śatatrayeṇetigeṣai || homāvatī || 
ākṛṣṭakramena || caṇḍabījamāṣaśālīnā || mekaikaṃ gṛhītvā militvā || 
bījatrayā homena sarvvahomāt || deva iti bhagavānyamāri || upalakṣaṇatvādasya || 
asyaiva nāmavidatyaṃ hṛdayete tasyaiva || darśanyena cābhīṣṭasiddhi gañjananeti 
|| mṛtasya

<p. 139a> dahane lādakārddhadagdhakāṣṭāgāreṇa || 
unmattarasapiṣṭeneti sabandhaḥ || ayutaneti || 
neti vaśyavidhānena daśasahasrajaptena || evamekadā sādhitena ||
yadopayogastadādaṣṭaka || dṛṣṭāyamyaśyati bimba karoti ||

catvāri lakṣajāpeneti moha || vajraśṛṃkharāyā śāntikavidhāneneti ||
aniddiṣṭanāmadhyapadaṣ.ṭakaṃ dṛṣṭā japtavyaṃ ||
evaṃ kṛtya yatraktacitsuptakaṃ saptābhimantritaṃ || saṣapana nirviṣaṃ karoti ||
kandarasya mudahyanti || kvacit kandarodanesitabhūbhāga || maṇḍalakaṃ 
svahastenāvastastata || ārasātalā dṛṣṭiparyyanta || śāntividhānena mitiśira ||
śūlaṃ vidartyalakṣamantreṇābhimantrayet ||

<p. 139b> āgmamikālaṃ yāvadakāśaṃ || buddhisthī kṛtyatatoye || kvaścītśiraḥ 
śūlī || tayāmṛtakayā śilo lepayet || aśya sūlaṃ naśyati || saptābhimantri 
śāntikavidhānena || hasteneti || hastabhāvita candramaṇḍalena || varśama 
śiśiradhāreṇa bhavatī || tyāgāmīnotpadyate || nasyata itpannaṃ sāmyati || 
vigrahaviśyaṣārthamāha || brāhmaṇasyatyādi || bhasmanabhaṅgāreṇa || tamudeti 
mṛttikāyā || pratimāmabhītiṣṭha pramānāmiti śeṣaḥ || 

mahāvajra pañcasucikavajra || avasavya vāme || nuśūyo mānuṣamaṇḍalaṃ 
matāṃbhāne || bhayānakaṃ vikṛtvāta mukhatvādinā || pañcasā sāmṛteneti || 
pañcamāsa pañcāmṛtātpārtha

<p. 140a> yediti tadyogamānaṃvyaḥ || śatrunāmavidartya || oṃ 
hrīṁḥ ṣṭādimantrenamāra vidhānenāvattayet || iti uhlā iti || 

bhagavānāha || atha khalu vajradhara vajrapāṇi || punaraparaṃ miya mahāsutra || 
mahāvajroṣṇīṣa mahāpratyaṃgirāyā || kāranādya vārthamidaṃ || katipaya 
vivārthamidaṃ || katipaya vivasametyartha || aparaṇīgrahārthamāha || śarvorityādi 
vairocanogurtha || mānuṣāsthīti || udvadvajraghānalaṃkaśīlaṃ || lakṣajāpaṇeti || 
nanāmavidarbhaṇapūrvvaka muccāṭana || bhāvanayāntravinaiva 
lakṣamekaṃñjaptvā || vṛkṣagra iti sākhoṭakavṛkṣāgre || vitītaka vṛkṣāgre vā || 
tuṣṭa iti yadāpannīya

<p. 140b> śrīvairocana sphotayitvā || kevalaṃ kṣāreṇāpūjye || śāntikavidhinā 
satro || kṛte daśasahasra japaṃ karoti || tadā tasya sukhaṃ bhavati || yamāri bhīma iti 
|| 

yamāri bhīmo yasminukta'sātathā || iti 
śrīmahāpratyaṃgirāyāyamanusaṃsādhane iti ||


bhagavānāha || iyamasau vajradhara vajrapāṇi || bhagavanto 
jñānamūrttimañjuśrīsarvvatathāgatajñānakāyasya || 
mañjuśrījñānasatvāsyāvanīka || buddhadharmma saṃghapariśuddhā || 
mahāpratyaṃgīrā'nuttara || prītiprasāda mahauṣadhilyasañjananārthaṃ || kāya 
vāgmano guhyapariśuddho'paripūrṇā pariśuddha || bhūmīpāramitā 
puṃṇyajñāna saṃbhāra ||

<p. 141a> paripūri pariśuddhya || anavyagatā || anuttarārthasyādhigamāya || 
aprāptasya prāptya yāvat || sarvvatathāgata sadharmmanetrī || 
saṃdhāranārthañca || mayā deśitā samprakāśitā || vivṛtā vibhrajito || 
tānikatā adhiṣṭhitā caiyaṃ || mayā vajradhara vajrapāṇi vasantāna || 
sarvvamantradharmmatā || pramuditā bhuvaṇe || 

oṃ namo bhagavate mañju padma guruvya namaḥ mahākāruṇikāya || 
tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya || 
oṃ namo bhagavate śākyamunaye tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃyaksaṃbuddhāya ||
oṃ namo bhagavatya ādibuddhāya tathāgatāyā'hante saṃyaksaṃbuddhāya ||
oṃ namo bhagavatya ratnāciya

<p. 141b>  tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃyaksaṃbuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatya varapramarddine tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāyaḥ 
||
oṃ namo bhagavatya nāgeśvararājāya tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃyaksaṃbuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatya vīrasenāya tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāyaḥ ||
evaṃ pramukhai tathāgata satasahasrāni || vivyavāsitaṃ || virāgasitaṃ || 
vyasargaparinataṃ || manuttarammṛtidi saṃbhāvayati || 1 ||

punaraparaṃ vajradhara vajrapāṇi || iyaṃ mahāvajroṣṇīṣa || mahāpratyaṃgirā || 
mahāvidyārājñā || śupariśuddha paryyavadāta || sarvvajñajñānakāya 
vāṅmano || guhyabhūtānā sarvvatathāgatānāṃ || buddha boddhi

<p. 142a> saṃmyaksaṃbuddhānāmabhisamaya || sarvvatathāgatānā ||
anuttaradharmmadhātu || gatisugatānāṃ || sarvvamāra balaparājayojinānāṃ ||
daśabalabalitā || sarvvadaśabalānāṃ || sarvvajñajñānāṃ || āgama || 
sarvvadharmmāṇāṃ || samudāgama || sarvvabuddhānāṃ || vimalasupariśuddhī || 
sarvvamahāboddhisatvānāṃ || prasuti || sarvvaśrāvaka pratyeka buddhānāṃ ||
kṣatraṃ sarvvadevatā manuṣya saṃpatte || pratiṣṭhā || pratiṣṭhā mahāyānasya || 
saṃtaboddhisatvacaryyāyā || niṣṭā samyagāryyamārgasya || nikaśvavimuktināṃ 
|| utpatti niryyānamārgasya || nikaśo vimuktināṃ || utpartti niryyāṇamārgasya || 
anupaccheda || tathāgatavaṃsasya || pravṛttirmahāboddhisatvakula

<p. 142b> gotrasya || nigrahaḥ sarvvaparapravādīnāṃ || vidhvaṃsana 
sarvvatirthikānāṃ || parājayaḥ caturamāravalañca mūṇenāryyā || saṃyahaḥ 
sarvvasatvānāṃ māryya || mārgaparipāka || sarvvaniryyānayāyināṃ || 
samāddhiśca tu brahmavihāriṇāṃ || vyānamekācittānāṃ || yogaḥ 
kāyavāṅmanobhiyuktānāṃ || viṃśayoga || sarvvayojanānāṃ || prahānaṃḥ 
sarvvakleśānāvyupasama || sarvvāvaraṇānāṃ || vimuktiḥ 
sarvvasamanvāgatānāṃ || mokṣaḥ sarvvoṣadhināṃ || śāntiḥ sarvvacitto 
plavānāṃ || ākaḥ sarvvasaṃpattīnāṃ || parihāṇī || sarvvavipattināṃ || 
vidhvaṃsana || sarvvopāya dvārānāṃ || satyathau viktipurasya || agravṛtti || 
saṃsāracakrasya || pravarttanaṃ || dharmma cakrasya ||

<p. 143a> ucchritachatra dhvaja patākā || tathāgatasāsanasya || adhiṣṭhāna || 
sarvvadharmmadesanāyāṃ || kṣiprasiddhi || mantramukhacaryyācāriṇāṃ || 
bodhisatvānāṃ || bhāvanādhigamaḥ || 

prajñāpāramitābhibhaktānāṃ || bodhisatvānāṃ || śūnyatā pratibodhau 
advaya || prativyadhabhāvanābhiyuktānāṃ || bhaviṣyati || 
sarvvapāramitāsaṃbhārasya || parisuddhi || sarvvabhūmipāramitā paripuryya || 
prativedha || saṃmyakcaturāryyasatyānāṃ || sarvvadharmekacitta || prativyadha || 
catusmṛtyupasthānānāṃ || yāvata parisamāpti || sarvvabuddhagunānāmiyaṃ ||
vimalānāmabhuvane || 

oṃ namo bhagavatya viranandine tathā

<p. 143b> gatāyā'rhaṃnte saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya ||
oṃ namo bhagavatya ratnottamāyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya ||
oṃ namo bhagavatya amoghadarśineḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante samyaksaṃbuddhāyaḥ 
|| oṃ namo bhagavatya ratnacandrāyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāyaḥ || oṃ namo bhagavatya anantauśrīyaḥ 
tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya ||oṃ namo bhagavatya 
jaladharagarjjitanirghoṣāyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāyaḥ ||
evaṃ pramukhai tathāgata satasahasrāṇi || sannipatitāni || civyakasitaṃ || 
virāgasitaṃ || vyasargaparinataṃ || anuttarasmṛtidi saṃbhāvayati || 2 ||

<p. 144a> punaraparaṃ vajradhara vajrapāni || iyaṃ mahāvajroṣṇīṣa 
mahāpratyaṃgirā || mahāvidyā || śuparisuddha || paryyavadātaḥ || 
sarvvajñajñāna || kāyavāṅmano guhyabhūtā || sarvvatathāgatānāṃ || 
buddhabodhisaṃmyaksambunāṃ || mabhisamaya || sarvvatathāgatānāṃ || 
anuttaradharmmadhātu || gatisugatānāṃ || sarvvamāra varaparājayojinānāṃ || 
daśabalabalitā || sarvvadaśabalānāṃ || sarvvajñajñānāṃ || āgamaḥ  
sarvvadharmmānāṃ || samudāgama || sarvvabuddhānāṃ || vimalasupariśuddha || 
puṇyajñānasaṃbhāraparipūri || sarvvamahāboddhisatvānāṃ || prasutiḥ  
sarvvaśrāvaka pratyakabuddhānāṃ || kṣatraṃ sarvvadevatā || manuṣya saṃpatte || 
pratiṣṭhā mahāyānasya || 

<p. 144b> santaboddhisatvacaryyāyā || niṣṭā samyagāyyamārgasya || nikaśo 
vimuktināṃ || utpatti niryyānamārgasya || nikaśo vimuktināṃ || utpatti 
niryyānamārgasya || anupaccheda || tathāgatavaṃsasya || pravarddhi 
mahāboddhisatvakulagotrasya || nigrahaḥ sarvvapravādīnāṃ || vidhvaṃsana || 
sarvvatīrthikānāṃ || parājaya || catumāravarañca musyanāryya || 
sarvvasatvānāṃ mārgaparipāka || sarvvaniryyānayānināṃ || 
samāddhiścaturbrahmavihārināṃ || vyānamekācittānāṃ || yogaḥ 
kāyavāṅmanobhiyuktānāṃ || viṃśayoga || sarvvasaṃyojanānāṃ || prahānaḥ 
sarvvakleśopakleśānāṃ || vyupasama || sarvvāvararṇānāṃ || vimuktiḥ 
sarvvabandhanānāṃ || mokṣaḥ sarvvoṣadhīnāṃ || śāntiḥ sarvvacittoplavānāṃ 
ākaḥ ||

<p. 145a> sarvvasampattīparihānī || sarvvavipattināṃ vidhvaṃsana || 
sarvvāpāyadvārāṇāṃ || satyathau viktipurasya || apravṛtti || saṃmāracakrasya || 
pravarttanaṃ dharmmacakrasya || ucchritachatra dhvaja patākā || tathāgatasāsanasya 
|| adhiṣṭhānaṃ || sarvvadharmmadesanāyā || kṣiprasiddhi mantramukhacaryyā || 
cārināṃḥ bodhisatvādhigama ||

prajñāpāramitābhiyuktānāṃ || bodhisatvānāṃ || sunyatā pratibodho || advayo 
prativedha || bhāvanābhiyuktānā bhaviṣyati || sarvapāramitāsaṃbhārasya || 
parisuddhi || sarvabhūmipāramitāparipūri || prativādha || 
saṃmyakcaturāryyasatyānāṃ || sarvvadharmekacitta || prativedhā || 
catusmṛtyupasthānānāṃ || yāvata parisamāpti ||

<p. 145b> sarvvabuddhaguṇānāmiyaṃ ||
aciṣmatināmabhuvane || 

oṃ namo bhagavate nirmmalaśrīyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya ||
oṃ namo bhagavatya vimalaprabhāyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya 
||
oṃ namo bhagavatya tataśrīyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksaṃbuddhāya || 
evaṃ pramukhai || tathāgatakoṭinīyuta || satasahasrāni || sannipatitāni || 
vivyekasitaṃ || virāgasitaṃ || vyasargaparinataṃ || anuttarasmṛti (*)(?) śabhāvayati || 3 
||

punaraparaṃ vajradhara vajrapāṇī iyaṃ vajradhara vajrapāṇi || iyaṃ 
mahāvajroṣṇīṣa mahāpratyaṃgirā || mahāvidyārājñi || suparisuddha ||

<p. 146a> paryyavadāt || sarvvajñajñāna || kāyavāṅmano guhyabhūtā || 
sarvvatathāgatānāṃ || buddhabodhi || saṃmyaksaṃbuddhānāṃ || mabhisamaya || 
sarvvatathāgatānāṃ || anuttara || dharmmadhātusugatānāṃ || sarvvamāravara || 
parājayojinānāṃ || daśabalabalitā || sarvvadaśabalānāṃ || sarvvajñajñānāṃ 
|| āgama || sarvvadharmmānā samudāgama || sarvvabuddhānāṃ vimala || 
supariśuddha || puṇyajñānasaṃbhāra paripuri || sarvvamahāboddhisatvānāṃ || 
prasuti || sarvvaśrāvaka || pratyekabuddhānāṃ ||
kṣatraṃ sarvvadevatā || manuṣya saṃpatte || pratiṣṭhā mahāyanasya || 
santaboddhisatvacaryyāyā || niṣṭā saṃmyagāryyamārgasya || anupakṣada || 
tathāgatavaṃsasya || pravṛttirmahāboddhisatva kulagotrasya 

<p. 146b> nigrahaḥ sarvvapravādīnāṃ || vidhvaṃsana || sarvvatirthikānāṃ || 
parājaya || caturmāravaraṃ ca muśenāryye || saṃgraha sarvvasatvānāṃ || 
āryyamārgaparipāka || sarvvaniryyānayāyināṃ || 
samāddhi caturbrahmavihārīnāṃ || vyānamekācittānāṃ || yogaḥ 
kāyavāṅmanobhiyuktānāṃ saṃyoga || sarvvasaṃjojanānāṃ prahāna || 
sarvvakleśopakleśānāvyupasama || sarvvāvaranānāṃ || vimuktiḥ 
sarvasatvānāṃ || mokṣaḥ sarvoṣadhināṃ śānti || sarvvacittoplavānā ākaḥ || 
sarvvasaṃpattīnā parihānī || sarvvavipattināṃ || vidhvaṃsana || 
sarvvopāyadvārānāṃ || satyathau viktipurasya || agravṛtti || saṃsāracakrasya || 
pravarttanaṃ || dharmmacakrasya || ucchrita || chatra dhvaja patākā || 
tathāgataśāśanasya || adhiṣṭhānaṃ ||

<p. 147a> sarvvadharmmadeśanāyāṃ || kṣiprasiddhimantramukhacaryyā || 
cāriṇāṃ bodhisatvānāṃdhigama ||

prajñāpāramitābhiyuktānāṃ || bodhisatvānāṃ || śuṃnyatā pratibodho advaya 
