dhyānamekācittānāṃ 

<p. 158a> kāyavāṅmanoguhyabhūtānāṃ parājaya caturmāra || varaṃ 
camūsyanāryya || saṃgrahaḥ sarvvasatvānāṃ || māryyamārgaparipāka || 
sarvvaniryyānayāyināṃ || samāddhiścaturbrahmavihāriṇāṃ || dhyānamyakā 
cittānāṃ || yoga kāyavāṅmanobhiyuktānāṃ || visaṃyojanānāṃ || prahānaṃ 
sarvvakleśopakleśānāṃ || vyupasama || sarvvadaśabalānāṃ || vimuktiḥ || 
sarvvabandhanānāṃ || mokṣaḥ sarvvopadhināṃ śānti || sarvvacittoplavānāṃ 
ākara || sarvvasaṃpattīparihāṇī || sarvvavipattinā vidhvaṃsana || 
sarvvopāyadvārānāṃ || sapathau viktipurasya || apravṛtti || saṃsāracakrasya || 
pravattanaṃ dharmmacakrasya || ucchritaḥ chatraḥ dhvajaḥ patākāṃ || 
tathāgataśāsanasya ||

<p. 158b> addhiṣṭhānaṃ || sarvvadharmmadeśanāyāṃ || kṣiprasiddhi || 
mantramukhacaryyā || cārināṃ || boddhisatvānāṃ || bhāvanāddhigama || 

prajñāpāramitābhiyuktānāṃ || boddhisatvānāṃ  śūnyatā || pratibodho 
advaya || prativyadhabhāvanā || bhiyuktānā bhaviṣyati || sarvvapāramitā 
saṃbhārasya || pariśuddhi || sarvvabhūmipāramitā paripuryya || prativedha || 
saṃmyakcaturāryyasatyānāṃ || sarvvadharmmekacitta || prativedha catu || 
smṛtyupasthānānāṃ || yāvata parisamāpti || sarvvabuddhagunānāmīyaṃ || 

amṛtānāmabhuvane ||
 
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ mahāhā amoghasiddhi yaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||

<p. 159a> oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ mahā amṛtābhāya amoghapāsāyaḥ 
tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ ratnasabhavāya mahāratnasāgarāyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ mahā akṣobhyāyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ mañjuśrīyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ 
||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ vipaśvīne tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ sikhineḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ visvabhūvaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ || 
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ

<p. 159b> krakūtchandāyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ || 
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ kanakamuniyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ 
||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ kāśyapāyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ 
|| 
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ śākyamuniyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ māhāvairocanāyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||

evaṃ pramukhai || tathāgatakoṭi || niyūta śatasahasrāṇi || sannipatitāni || 
vivekasitaṃ || virāgasitaṃ || vesargaparinataṃ || manuttarasmṛti || disaṃ bhāvayati || 
9 ||

punaraparaṃ || vajradhara vajrapāṇi ||

<p. 160a> iyaṃ mahāvajroṣṇīṣa || mahāpratyaṃgirāyā || mahāvidyārājñī || 
śupariśuddha || paryyavadāta || sarvvajñajñāna || kāyavāṅmano guhyabhūtā || 
sarvvatathāgatānāṃ || buddhaboddhi || saṃmyaksambuddhānā || mabhisamaya || 
sarvvatathāgatānā || manuttara dharmmadhātu || gatisugatānāṃ || sarvvamārabala 
|| parājayojanijinānāṃ || daśabalabalitā || sarvvadaśabalānāṃ || 
sarvvajñajñānāṃ || āgama || sarvvabuddhānāṃ samudāgama || 
burbbubuddhānāṃ vimala || supariśuddha puṇya || jñānasaṃbhāra paripūri || 
sarvvamahāboddhi || satvānāṃ prasuti || sarvvaśrāvaka || pratyekabuddhānāṃ || 
kṣatraṃ sarvvadeva || manuṣya sapatte || pratiṣṭhā mahāyānasya ||

<p. 160b> sambhaboddhisatvacaryyāyā || niṣṭā saṃmyagāryyasya || 
māryyamārgasya || nikaśo vimuktināṃ || utpatti niryyānamārgasya || anupaccheda 
|| tathāgatavaṃsasya || pravṛddhi mahāboddhisatvanigraha || 
sarvvaparapravāddhinīnāṃ || vidhvaṃsanaṃ || sarvvatirthikānāṃ || parājaya || 
caturmārabalaṃ || camūśyanāryya || saṃgraha || sarvvasatvānāmāryya || 
mārgaparipācaka || sarvvaniryyānayāyināṃ || samāddhiścatubrahma || 
vihāravihārināṃ || dhyānamekācittānāṃ || yogaḥ kāyamanobhi || yuktānāṃ ||  
viṃsayojanānāṃ || prahānaṃ sarvva || kleśopakleśānāṃ || vyūpaḥsama || 
sarvvāvaraṇānāṃ || vimukti || sarvvabandhanānāṃ || mokṣa || sarvva 
upāvīṇāṃ ||

<p. 161a> śānti || sarvvacittoplavānāṃ || mākara || sarvvasaṃpattiparihāni || 
sarvvavipattināṃ || vidhvaṃsana || sarvvāpāyadvārānāṃ || satyathau || 
viviktipurasya || apravṛtti || saṃsāracakrasya || pravarttanaṃ dharmmacakrasya || 
ucchritaḥ chatraḥ dhvajaḥ patākāḥ || tathāgatasāsanasya || adhiṣṭhānaṃ || 
sarvvadharmmadeśanāyā || kṣiprasiddhi || mantramukhacaryyā || cārināṃ  
bodhisatvānāṃ || bhāvanādhigama || prajñāpāramitābhiyuktānāṃ || 
boddhisatvānāṃ || śūṇyatā pratibodho || advaya || prativedhabhāvanā || 
bhiyuktānāṃ bhaviṣyati || sarvvapāramitā || saṃbhārasya || pariśuddhi || 
sarvvabhūmipāramitā || paripuryya || prativyadha || 

<p. 161b> saṃmyakcaturāryya || satyānāṃ || sarvvadharmmekacittā || prativyadha || 
catuḥsmṛtyupasthānānāṃ || yāvata parisamāpti || sarvvabuddha || 
guṇānāmīyaṃ || sādhumatināmabhuvane || 

oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ vajrapramarddineḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavateḥ suvarṇaratnāciyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ ratnākarachatrakuṭa tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ nāgeśvararājāyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ vīrasyena śubhakīrttikiraṇe kapilamunayaḥ 
tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||

<p. 162a> evaṃ pramukhai || tathāgatakoṭi || nīyuta śatasahasrāṇi || sannipatitāni || 
vivekasitaṃ || virāgasitaṃ || vesargaparinataṃ || anuttarasmṛtidisaṃ || mbhāvayatī || 
10 ||

punaraparaṃ || vajradhara vajrapāṇī || iyaṃ mahāvajroṣṇīṣa || mahāpratyaṃgirā 
|| mahāvidyārājñī || supariśuddha || paryyavadāta || sarvvajñajñāna || 
kāyavāṅmano guhyabhūtā || sarvvatathāgatānāṃ || buddhabodhi || 
saṃmyaksambuddhānāmabhissamaya || sarvvatathāgatānāṃ || manuttara 
dharmmadhātu || gatiśugatānāṃ || sarvvamāravara || parājayojinānāṃ || 
daśabalabalitā || sarvvadaśabalānāṃ || sarvvajñajñānāṃ || āgama ||  
samudāgama || sarvva

<p. 162b> dharmmānāṃ samudāgama || sarvvabuddhānāṃ vimala || supariśuddha 
puṇya || jñānasaṃbhāra paripuri || sarvvamahāboddhisatvānāṃ || prasuti || 
sarvvaśrāvaka || pratyekabuddhānāṃ || kṣatraṃ sarvvadeva || manuṣya saṃpatte || 
pratiṣṭhā mahāyānasya || sambhabodhisatva || caryyāyā || niṣṭā 
saṃmyagāryyamārgasya || nikaśo vimukti || utpatti niryyānamārgasya || anupacheda 
|| tathāgatavaṃsasya || pravṛti mahāboddhisatvasya || nigraha || 
sarvvaparapravādināṃ || vidhvaṃsanaṃ || sarvvatīrthikānāṃ || parājaya || 
caturamāravaraṃ ca || muśyenāryyaḥ || saṃgraha || sarvvasatvānāṃ || 
māryyamārgaparipāka || sarvvaniryyānayāyīnāṃ || samāddhiścaturbrahma || 
vihāravīhārīnāṃ || dhyānamekā cittānāṃ ||

<p. 163a> yogaḥ kāyavāṅmanobhi || yuktānāṃ visaṃyojananānāṃ || prahāna || 
sarvvakleśopakleśānāṃ || vyūpasama || sarvvāvaranānāṃ || vimukti || 
sarvvabanddhanānāṃ mokṣa || sarvva upavināṃ śānti || sarvvacittoplavānāṃ 
mākara || sarvvasaṃpattīparihāṇi || sarvvavipattinā || vidhvaṃsana || 
sarvvāpāyadvārānāṃ || satyethau || viktipurasya || apravṛtti || saṃsāracakrasya || 
pravattanaṃ dharmmacakrasya || ucchritaḥ chatraḥ dhvajaḥ patākā || 
tathāgatasāsanasya || adhiṣṭhānaṃ || sarvvadharmmadeśanāyā || kṣiprasiddhi || 
mantramukhacaryyā || cārināṃ || bodhisatvānāṃ || bhāvanādhigama || 

prajñāpāramitābhiyuktānāṃ || boddhisatvānāṃ || śūnyatā pratibādhye  
advayaṃḥ || 

<p. 163b> prativyaddha || bhāvanābhiyuktānāṃ || viṣyati || sarvvapāramitā || 
saṃbhārasya || pariśuddhi || sarvvabhūmipāramitā || paripuryya || prativedha || 
saṃmyakcaturāryya satyānāṃ || sarvvadharmmekacitta || prativedha || 
catusmṛtyupasthānānāṃ || yāvata parisamāpti || sarvvabuddhaguṇānāmitaṃ || 
acalānāmabhuvane || 

oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ viranandineḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ ratnavyūhaśriyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ amoghadarśineḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ ratnacandraprabhāsarasmi

<p. 164a> śriyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ buddhakośamatirasmiśrīyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ dharmmakośamatirasmiśrīyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ saṃghakośamatirasmiśrīyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||
oṃ namo bhagavatyaḥ satyakosamati śrīrasmiśrīyaḥ tathāgatāyā'rhante 
saṃmyaksambuddhāyaḥ ||

evaṃ pramukhai || tathāgatakoṭī || nīyūta śatasahasrāṇi || sannipatitāṇi || 
vivekasitaṃ || virāgasitaṃ || vesargaparinataṃ || anuttarasmṛti || disaṃ bhāvayati || 

<p. 164b> bhagavānāha || punaraparaṃ || asti kulaputra || pūrvvasyāṃ diśi || ito 
buddhakṣatra || koṭinīyuta satasahasra || gaṃgānadi bāluko samāna || 
buddhakṣatrāṇi || nyatikramya || padmānāmalokadhātu || 
nānāgunaratnavibhūṣitā || nānāratnakutāṃgārādi || 
vṛkṣapuṣkaraṇyupaśvabhitā || yatraikajāti || pratibuddhā bodhisatvā || aparimita || 
pratibhānavyūha tathāgata || sakāsārddha dharmmaśṛṇvanti || tatra lokadhātau || 
indrīnāmamahāvṛkṣa || ratnamayānyasti || tasya mūlya || koṭiśatasahasra || 
patraratnamayapadmosti || tatrādyarātro || aparimitaguṇa || pratibhānavyūha 
tathāgata || arhata saṃmyaksaṃbuddhe || nānuttarāyā || 
samyaksaṃbodhirabhisaṃbuddha ||

<p. 165a> tatra padmāsana || niṣarṇā boddhisatvā || tasya prāntihāryyāni paśyanti || 
te sarvvalokadhātubhya || agato boddhisatvāstaṃ || nānāpuṣpai || nānādhūpai || 
nānāchatrai || nānādhvajai || nānāpatākai || nānādīpādibhi || pūjāṃ kṛtvā || 
tatra sthitā || 

punaraparaṃ || aṣṭikulaputra || dakṣiṇasyāṃdiśi || rito buddhakṣatrakoṭi || nīyūta 
śatasahasraṃ vā || gaṃgānadī bālukāsamān || buddhakṣatrā || natikramya || 
padmānāma lokadhātu || nānāguṇaratna || vibhūṣitā || 
nānāratnakutāṃgārādi || vṛkṣapuṣkarinyupaśobhitā || yatraikajātipari || 
buddhā bodhisatvā || guṇavyūha tathāgata || sakāśārddha dharmmaśṛṇoti 

<p. 165b> tatra lokadhātau || ratnavṛkṣa || nānāratnamayānyasti || tasya mūle koṭī || 
nīyūtaśatasahasravarṇa || patraratnamayapadmostrī || tatrādyarātrau || 
guṇaratnavyuhare || ṇārhatā saṃmyaksaṃbuddhe || nānuttarāyā || 
saṃmyaksaṃboddhi || rabhisaṃbuddha || tatra padmāsane niṣarṇā || boddhisatvā || 
tasya prātihāryyāni pasyati || te sarvvalokadhātubhya || āgatā boddhisatvā || staṃ  
nānāpuṣpai || nānādhūpai || nānāchatrai || nānādhvajai || nānāpatākai || 
nānādīpādībhī || pūjayitvā || tatra sthitā || punaraparaṃ || astikulaputra || 
paścimasyāṃdiśi || rito buddhakṣatrakoṭi || nīyūta śatasahasraṃ vā || 
gaṃgānadī bālukāsamān || buddhakṣatrā || natikramya || padmā

<p. 166a> nāma lokadhātu || nānāgunaratna || vibhūṣitā || 
nānāratnakuṭāṃgārādi || vṛkṣapuṣkaraṇyū || paśobhitā || yatraika jātipari || 
buddhā || bodhisatvā || gunavyūha tathāgata || sakāśārddha dharmmaśṛṇonti || 
tatra lokadhātu || ratnavṛkṣa || nānāratnamayāṇyasti || tasya mūle koṭi || nīyūta 
śatasahasravarṇa || patraratnamayapadmosti || tatrādyarātrau || guṇaratnavyūhare || 
nārhatā saṃmyaksaṃbuddhe || nānuttarāyā || saṃmyaksaṃmboddhi || 
rabhisaṃbuddha || tatra padmāsane nīṣarṇā || boddhisatvā || tasya prātihāryyāni 
paśyeti || te sarvvalokadhātubhya || āgatā boddhisatvā || staṃ nānāpuṣpai || 
nānādhūpai || nānāchatrai || nānādhvajai || nānāpatākai ||

<p. 166b> nānādīpādībhī || pūjayitvā || tatra sthitā || 

punaraparaṃ || asti kulaputra || uttarasyāṃdiśi || ito buddhakṣatrakoṭi || nīyūta 
śatasahasra || gaṃgānadi bālukāsamā || natikramya || padmānāma lokadhātu || 
nānāguṇaratna || vibhūṣitā || nānāratnakuṭāṃgārādi || vṛkṣapuṣkiriṇyu || 
paśobhitā || yatraika jāti || pratibuddhā bodhisatvā || padmottama tathāgatasyāgre || 
aparimita || prabhāśavyūha || śukīrṇabuddhāya || tathāgatāyā'rhante || 
saṃmyaksaṃbuddho śṛṇvanti || tatra lokadhātau || indronāma lokadhātusya || indro 
nāma mahābodhivṛkṣa || ratnamayānyasti || tasya mūle koṭī || nīyūta 
śatasahasrasuvarṇapatra ||

<p. 167a> ratnamayapadmosti || tatrādyarātrau || padmotare nārhatā ||  
saṃmyaksaṃbuddhe || nānuttarāyā || saṃmyaksaṃbuddha || 
boddhirabhisaṃbuddha || tatra padmāsane niṣarṇā || boddhisatvā || tasya 
prātihāryyāni paśyanti || te sarvvalokadhātubhya || āgatā boddhisatvā || staṃ  
nānāpuṣpai || nānādhūpai || nānāchatrai || nānādhvajai || nānānaivadyai || 
nānāpatākai || nānādīpādībhī || pūjayitvā || tatra sthitāḥ || 

punaraparaṃ || asti kulaputra || agniyādiśi || ito buddhakṣatrakoṭi || nīyūta 
śatasahasra || gaṃgānadī bālukāsamānu || buddhakṣatrā natikramya || 
padmānāma lokadhātu || nānāguṇaratna vibhūṣitā || nānāratnakuṭāṃgārādi 
||

<p. 167b> vṛkṣapuṣkariṇyupaśobhitā || yatraika jāti || buddho boddhisatvā || 
dharmmaprativyūha || śrītathāgata || sakāśārddhaṃ dharmmaśṛnonti || 
tatrādyalokadhātau || indrīnāma mahāboddhivṛkṣa || ratnamayānyasti || tasya 
mūne koṭī || nīyūta śatasahasra || suvarṇapatraratnamayapadmosti || tatrādyarātrau 
|| sahasraśvara || meghagarjjita || pratibhānavyūha || śrīnāmatathāgatāyā'rhante 
|| saṃmyaksaṃbuddha || nānuttarāyā || saṃmyaksaṃbuddhe || nānuttarāyā || 
saṃmyaksaṃmboddhi || rabhisaṃbuddhā || tatra padmāsana niṣarṇā || boddhisatvā 
|| tasya prātihāryyāni || te sarvvalokadhātubhya || agatā boddhisatvā || staṃ 
nānāpuṣpai || nānādhūpai || nānāgandhai || nānāchatrai ||

<p. 168a> nānādhvajai || nānānaivadyai || nānāpatākai || nānādīpādībhī || 
pūjayitvā || tatra sthītāḥ ||

punaraparaṃ || asti kulaputra || nai(-)ṛtyāṃdiśi || ito buddhakṣatrakoṭi || nīyūta 
śatasahasraṃ || gaṃgānadī bālukāsamāna || buddhakṣatrānatikramya || 
padmānāma lokadhātu || nānāgunaratna vibhūṣitā || nānārūpyasuvarṇaratna || 
kuṭāgārādivṛkṣa || puṣkiriṇyupaśobhitā || yatraika jāti || pratibuddho bodhisatvā 
|| padmotama tathāgata || syāgre'parimita || prabhāśavyūha || śukīrṇabuddhāya || 
tathāgatāyā'rhante || saṃmyaksaṃbuddha śṛṇvanti || tatra lokadhātu || 
indronāma || mahāboddhivṛkṣa || ratnamayānyasti || tasya mūle koṭi || nīyūta 

<p. 168b> śatasahasrarupya || suvarṇapatra || ratnamayapadmosti || tatrādyarātrau || 
padmotalenārhatā || saṃmyaksaṃbuddhe || nānuttarāyā || saṃmyaksaṃboddhi || 
rabhisaṃbuddhā || tatra padmāsana niṣarṇā || boddhisatvā || tasya prātihāryyāni 
pasyaṃti || te sarvvalokadhātya || āgatā boddhisatvā || staṃ nānāpuṣpai || 
nānādhūpai || nānāgandhai || nānāchatrai || nānādhvajai || nānānaivadyai || 
nānāpatākai || nānādīpamālābhī || pūjayitvā || tatra sthitāḥ || 

punaraparaṃ || asti kulaputra || vāyuvyāṃdiśi || ito buddhakṣatrakoṭi || nīyūta 
śatasahasra || gaṃgānadī bālukāsamāna || buddhakṣatrānatikramya || 
padmānāma lokadhātu || nānāgunaratnavibhūṣitā || nānāratna

