kulaputra || mama sakāsādi ||

<p. 180b> yandrāvidamantrapadā || sarvvajñato dhāraṇī || dhāraye vācaye || 
vistareṇa parebhyaśca || saṃprakāsayata || asyāprabhāvena maitrīyāśīti || 
varṣasahasrāyuṣi || prajāyāṃ || maitrayo nāma tathāgato'rhaṃ || 
saṃmyaksaṃbuddho bhaviṣyanti || tena te matrīyāśrītī || varṣasahasrāyu 
pramānena || mamāntikāyauvarājyaṃ parigṛhitaṃ || yathātītānāṃ 
tathāgatānāṃ || mantikādatītai boddhisatvai || yauvarājye parigṛhītā || 

tatra khalu bhagavān || sarvvāvati parṣadamavalokya || tasyāmvelāyāṃ nimāni || 
mantrapadānya vabhāṣat || 

tadyathā || 
dāntabhūmī || damathabhūmī || smṛtibhūmī || prajñabhūmī || 
prajñānabhūmī || vaiśāradyabhūmī ||

<p. 181a> pratisaṃvidbhūmī || samantāparikṣāyopekṣabhūmīḥ || 
jātikṣayabhūmīḥ || manujabhūmīḥ || maratmajabhūmīḥ || visāgrabhūmī || 
maratmajaḥ || visāgraḥ || daśāvataveśata || teraṇa || veśaragra || śamusavata || 
vimati || vimati || yopahirare || gatavasi || sakrama iti || coravate || makhemudradahara || 
vataprajñākṣā || budvadahakramita || sadoṣavanta || elaya || ahūmūḍhā || 
amundhamaṃ || arthavati || suruvati || te hina dvicā || akanati || vakanate || samake || 
visābhate || iṭe || iṭavale || atra tatra || kuraṣalaruṣaṃ || latathake || sarvvanta sarvvatava 
|| anirūḍhe || dihatamvi || phala bahuphala || sataphala || siṣṭavate || api devānāṃ || 
bhagavān ||

<p. 181b> pratite samutapāda || pratiyuktānyadhimuktipadāni prakāśayati || 

eṣu prakāsyamānyaṣu || ṣaṣṭirbhidevanayutai || satyadarśaṇaṃ kṛtamabhūta || 
tatphala || magraphalaṃ || lalaha || alaha || nilaha || levacatakhyā || idaṃ phalaṃ || 
niyāmaphalaṃ || mamudayavibhūṣa || prajñācakra || sunivṛtticakra || jñānacakra || 
jñānīcakra || mañjuśrīcakra || 

ebhiradhimuktipadai || daśāṇāṃ devakoṭināṃ || manuttarāyā 
saṃmyaksaṃbodhau || cittanyūtpāditāni || tatraivarā || caivarttikā || saṃvṛtā || 
aprabhāśamadanā || ahadyo || bhagavatyo || karaṇāja || saddhamati || maddhamati || 
samantajau || alacale || pitakalā || mahābale ||

<p. 182a> ojadaro || dharaṇomigaraja || udāca || kukākṣaviroyā || virūpamukha || 
akṣihastaṃ || saktivara || asurodina || asurapramarddine || 

ebhiradhimuktipadai || dvādaśāṇāṃ || yakṣakoṭinī || manuttarāyā || 
samyaksaṃbodhau || cittamutpāditāni || tatraiva cā || vaivarttikā || nisaṃvṛttāḥ || 
aprabhāśamadaṇā || adadyo || bhagavatyo || karaṇākṣaḥ || madhamati || 
samantākṣau || aṃravaro || pitakaro || mahāvīre || mahābale || arthapililetinithe || 
saṃtīthe || kaṭine || nakane || nakare || nanamaste || mudame || matime || sanihasure || 
dhāraṇī || yasendra || sadevā || sanāgā || sayakṣā || sura devya ||

<p. 182b> nāgāni || ruktiparivāra || niruktarāni || smṛti prajñāparivāra || 
mabhipratirābhi || gatidhṛti parivāra || gatidhṛti rābhiḥ pūrvvakeṣu || caritavanta || 
abhiskāmavanta || śūra onta || cīravanta || cīravīryya onta || dhīravīryya onta || 
bhīmavanta || śitabhāge || mārgamudripa || karṣanikṣaparakṣa || ohāraṇo || devara 
catusamurdrā || yakṣasamudra || rākṣasamudra || vedi vedi metape || tatapai 
udbhāname || prakhādyanana baṃdharaṇīya || āviśa || diśāśodhano || 
vākyaśuddhe || jihvāśuddhe || dāviparikarmma || prajñābuddhi || smṛtimati || 
gatidhṛti gagaṇa || pratisarabuddhiḥ || jayacakre || śunyacakra || śūvyaya ||

<p. 183a> ebhiradhimuktipadai || ṣatpañcāśānāṃ || masurasahasrānā || 
manuttarāyā || saṃmyaksaṃbodhau || cittamutpāditāni || avaivattikāśca || 
vyavasthitāḥ || tatra bhagavānvaiśāradya || samavasaraṇaṃ || 
bodhisatvamāhāmantrayetesma || 

dūrllabhaṃ kulaputra || tathāgatānāṃ lokye || prādurbhāvo durllabhā ||
tepyevaṃ sarvvatathāgato || uṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā || nāmāparājitā || 
mahāpratyaṃgirā || mahāvidyānubhāvena || ime śīlasamāddhi || 
prajñānadarśana || paribhāvitā'mīdrā mantrapadā || satvānāṃ hitāya || 
boddhisatva || gunaniṣpādanārthaṃ || kulaputra || tathāgatena || 
pūrvavamboddhicaryyāñcuratā ||

<p. 183b> dānadamasaṃ || yamakṣāntiviryya || samāddhi prāptā || parigṛhītā || 
bahavo buddhakoṭi || nīyuta śatasahasrā || paryyūpāśitā || kvaciddānaṃ dattaṃ || 
śīlaṃ rakṣīta || brahmacaryya kvacirṇa || kvacidāhā ca nāniṣyavitā || 
kṣāntirbhāvitā || vīryyamālabddhā || samāddhi niṣpāditā || prajñāsyavitā || 
bahūprameyaṃ || vividha nānāprakārai || śubhakarmmakṛtaṃ || ryyenaṃ tarhi || 
mayānuttaraṃ || jñānapratilabddhaṃ || anekāṃ kalpakoṭi || nīyūta śatasahasrā || 
tathāgatena || pūrvaboddhicaryyā caratā || smṛṣāvādai || paiśūnyapāruṣā || 
smambhinna || plalāpāyāvarjitā || aneka vidhaṃ kuśalaṃ vā || karmmansye 
vinambā || vahulīkṛtaṃ ||

<p. 184a> enai tarhi prabhūtajihva || pratilabddhānabhi || kulaputra || 
tathāgatā'rhatānyathā kathayanti || atha bhagavāṃ mahāyānantaṃ 
tradhyaviskārena || sarvvapuṇya samavaraṇaṃ || samādhisamāpannaḥ || mukhārca 
jihvendriyaṃ || nināmayitvā || svaṃ mukhaṃ prabhyādya || 
tasmājihvendriyātyeṣṭi || rasmikodyāpramukāstai || cāryyastri sāhasra || 
mahāsāhasralokadhātu || rudāreṇāvabhāsena nirayati sma || tiryagyo niyamaloko || 
devamanuṣyā || sphatamavabhūva || te ca rasmaya || ye nairayikāsatvā || 
agnināprajvalitā || gātrādahyante || teṣāṃ śītacāvārivocānti || yeṣāṃ 
śītacāvāpavocānti || yeṣāṃ smṛṣṭānāṃ tatmuhutra || sukhāvyedanā

<p. 184b> prādurvabhūvaḥ || ekaikasyapūrata || buddhanimitta tiṣṭhati || 
dvātriṃsatabhirakṣaṇai || samaraṃkṛta aśitībhiśca || yaṃ dṛṣṭo tenaivayikā || 
sukhasamarpitā || buddhadarśanāṣyā pitaśarīrā || buddhadṛṣṭaiva cintayanta'sya 
satvasyānubhāvyanā'smābhi || sukhavedanā pratilabddhāste bhagavata śakāśya 
|| premāprakāsāda || gauravaṃ sañjanayanti || buddhanirmmita āha || bhosatvā 
evaṃ bhāṣadhvaṃ || 

oṃ namo buddhāya || oṃ namo dharmmāya || oṃ namo saṃghāya || oṃ namo 
mañjuśrīya || nityamevaṃ sukha || samarpitā bhāviṣyatha || tatahmairayikāsatvā || 
añjalimpragṛhyavāca || mudīrayanti || 

oṃ namo buddhāya || oṃ namo dharmmāya ||

<p. 185a> oṃ namo saṃghā || atha te satvāstena || cittaprasāda kuśalamūlena || 
tataścāvitvā || ekatyā devyaṣupapannā || ekamanuṣyeṣu tathaiva || pūrvavadhvā 
cavat || yeṇīta nārakā satvā || pretā piśāścā vā || sukhasamarpitā || 
devamanuṣyeṣu papannā || evaṃ devamanuṣyā || tiryyajñokṣu lokeṣu || lasmayaṃ 
codayanti || 

iti śrīmahāpratyaṃgirāyā mahāvidyārājñāyā || sadharmma'smita iti ||

atha khalu bhagavana || prajñapta evāsane niṣadya || uṣṇīṣa vyavalokiḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || ratnasamudroḥ nāma samāddhiḥ || sucandroḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || candradhvajaṃḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || dhvaja

<p. 185b> ketuḥrnāmasamāddhiḥ || sarvvadharmmasamudroḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
avalokitamurddhāḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || dharmmadhātre niyatoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
niyamadhvajaketuḥrnāmasamāddhiḥ || vajropamo nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
sarvvadharmapraveśanoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || samāhitavasthā pratiṣṭhāḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || rājamudrā nāmaḥ samāddhiḥ || balaviryyā nāmaḥ 
samāddhiḥ || sarvvadharmma samudgatoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || nirukti 
niyatapravesanoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || aśecana pravesanoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
digavalokanaṃḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || dhāraṇī buddhā nāmaḥ samāddhiḥ || 
ddhāraṇī mudrāḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || asaṃpramukhitāḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
sama

<p. 186a> varūṇāḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || ākāśasamavaruṇoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
ākāśasthāraṇoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || vajramaṇḍaloḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
dhvajāgraketuḥrnāmasamāddhiḥ || indraketurājoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
śrotānugato nāmaḥ samāddhiḥ || siṃha vijṛbhitoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
vityastasamāpattiḥrnāmasamāddhiḥ || ranaṃjahoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ vairocanoḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || animikhoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || niketasthitoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
nicitoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || vipulapratipannoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || anantaprabho 
nāmaḥ samāddhiḥ || prabhakaroḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || varadharmmamudroḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || samantāvabhāśoḥ

<p. 186b> nāmasamāddhiḥ || śuddhāvāśoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
vimalaprabho nāmaḥ samāddhiḥ || ratikaro nāmaḥ samāddhiḥ || ajapyoḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || tejovatiḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || kṣayapagatoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
anijitoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || vivṛtoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || sūryyaprabhoḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || candravimaloḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || śuddhapratibhāsoḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || alokakaroḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || ārākāroḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
jñānaketuḥrnāmasamāddhiḥ || cittasthitiḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || samantāvalokoḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || supratisthitoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || ratnakotīḥrnāmasamāddhiḥ 
|| varadharmmamudrāḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || sarvvadharmma

<p. 187a> samantāḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || ratijaho nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
dharmmagaroḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || vikiriṇoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
sarvvadharmmapadaprabhediḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || samākṣaravatāroḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || akṣarāvatāroḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || āvarṇakṣaroḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || anirogoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || prabhākaroḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
nāmaniyatapraveśoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || niketacāriḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
vitimirāpagatoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || cāritravatīḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
avalo nāmaḥ samāddhiḥ || viṣamaśāntirnāmaḥ samāddhiḥ || 
sarvvagunasaṃcayoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || niścitoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
śubhapuṣpitaśuddhoḥ

<p. 187b> nāmasamāddhiḥ || bodhyaṃgavatī nāmaḥ samāddhiḥ ||
anantaprabho nāmaḥ samāddhiḥ || āgamasamoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
sarvvavikramoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || pratichedoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
vimatikiranoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || nīradhiṣṭhānoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
ekavyūhoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || ākārāttiniveśoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
kārānavantāroḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || nīratisayaḥ nāmasamāddhi ||
saṃketarūtapravāsoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
niravimuktoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || tejovatiḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
kṣālanākoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || rakṣānupariśoṣanoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
anāvirakṣāṃti nāmasamāddhiḥ ||

<p. 188a> sarvākārāvatāroḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
sarvvasukhaduḥkhanirabhinanditoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
akṣayakaroḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || dhāraṇīyatiḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
samyakpīthyātvasaṃgrahaḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
stiloṣaviroṣaḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || pratiroṣoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
sāravatīḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || vāripurṇaḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
vimalacandraprabhoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || vidyuprabhoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
mahāvyūhoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || sarvvalokaprabhoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
samatāḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || anayavinayaḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || 
avimukto nāmaḥ samāddhiḥ || anusaraṇasarvvanoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
samavasaraṇoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || aniyaniyatoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||

<p. 188b> tathāsthitiniścitoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
kāyakari saṃpramathanoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || vākali vidhvaṃsanoḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || cittaparisuddhoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || gaganakalpoḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || ākāśasaṃgamavimuktoḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || vimuktinirūpoḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || amoghapāśaḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || he vajraḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ 
|| jogāmbaraḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || kālacakraḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || mañjuvajraḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || herūkaḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || alapañcanaḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ ||
mañjuśrīsvanāmasamāddhiḥ || saraśvatiḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || trisamāddhiḥ 
nāmasamāddhiḥ || asphānakaḥ nāmasamāddhiḥ || mahāvairocanaḥ

<p. 189a> nāmasamāddhiḥ || samāpadyate sma ||

iti śrīmahāpratyaṃgirāyā samāddhisaṃgraha murddhā 
dharmmāsyālaṃvanākāra viśyaṣaḥ ||

oṃ pratyaṃgire svāhā || oṃ mahāpratyaṃgirāyai svāhā || oṃ aparājitāyai svāhā 
|| oṃ mahāghorāyai svāhā || oṃ mahābalāyai svāhā || oṃ mahātejāyai svāhā || oṃ 
mahācaṇḍāyai svāhā || oṃ mahāśvetāyai svāhā || oṃ mahādīptāyai svāhā 
|| oṃ mahājvālāyai svāhā || oṃ mahāmālāyai svāhā || oṃ 
mahāpāṇḍalavāsiṇyai svāhā || oṃ āryyatārāyai svāhā || oṃ bhṛkuṭitārāyai 
svāhā || oṃ jayatārāyai svāhā || oṃ vijayatārāyai svāhā || oṃ sarvvamāriyai 
svāhā || oṃ vajramāriyai svāhā || oṃ padmābhāyai svāhā || oṃ vajra

<p. 189b> cintāyai svāhā || oṃ mālācaivāyai svāhā || oṃ vajratuḍikāyai svāhā || oṃ 
visālākṣāyai svāhā || oṃ tāyai svāhā || oṃ dehapūjitāyai svāhā || oṃ 
saumyarūpāyai svāhā || oṃ mahāśvetāyai svāhā || oṃ jvālāyai svāhā || oṃ 
pāṇḍalavāsinyai svāhā || oṃ aparājitāyai svāhā || oṃ vajaśṛṃkharāyai svāhā 
|| oṃ vajakaumāryai svāhā || oṃ vajakulaṃdharyai svāhā || oṃ vajraśṛṃkharāyai 
svāhā || oṃ vajrakaumāryai svāhā || oṃ vajrakulaṃ dharyye svāhā || oṃ 
vajrahastāyai svāhā || oṃ kāñcanamālikāyai svāhā || oṃ kusumbharatnocikāyai 
svāhā || oṃ tathāgatakuloṣṇīṣāyai svāhā || oṃ vijraṃbhamānikāyai svāhā || oṃ 
kanakaprabhāyai svāhā || oṃ locanāyai svāhā || oṃ vajratuḍikāyai svāhā || oṃ 
kamalākṣiṇyai svāhā || oṃ buddhalocanāyai svāhā || oṃ vajra caṇḍiyai svāhā ||

<p. 190a> oṃ vajradharāyai svāhā || oṃ vajramālāyai svāhā || oṃ devī ca 
kanakaprabhāyai svāhā || oṃ kamalākṣiṇyai svāhā || oṃ śāntacittāyai svāhā || oṃ 
jñānaprabhāyai svāhā || oṃ śaśiprabhāyai svāhā || oṃ locanai svāhā || oṃ 
sulocanai svāhā || oṃ tārai svāhā || oṃ torādbhavai svāhā || oṃ 
sarvvasatvānukaṃpinīyai svāhā || oṃ sarvvasatvotāraṇīyai svāhā || oṃ 
śahasrabhujai svāhā || oṃ sahasranetrai svāhā || oṃ avalokayai svāhā || oṃ tārai 
svāhā || oṃ tutārai svāhā || oṃ turai svāhā || oṃ siddhai svāhā || oṃ susiddhai svāhā 
|| oṃ śuddhai svāhā || oṃ viśuddhai svāhā || oṃ sugatātmajai svāhā || oṃ 
maitrīhṛdayai svāhā || oṃ śyāmai svāhā || oṃ śyāmarūpai svāhā || oṃ pravarai 
svāhā ||

<p. 190b> pravarabhūṣitai svāhā || oṃ aparājitāyai svāhā || oṃ mahāraudrīyai 
svāhā || oṃ viśvarūpīyai svāhā || oṃ mahābalāyai svāhā || oṃ mahātejāyai 
svāhā || oṃ lokadhātrīyai svāhā || oṃ sarasvatīyai svāhā || oṃ viśālākṣiyai 
svāhā || oṃ śrīprajñāyai svāhā || oṃ buddhivarddhanīyai svāhā || oṃ dhṛtidāyai 
svāhā || oṃ puṣṭidāyai svāhā || oṃ kālāyai svāhā || oṃ kāmarūpiṇīyai svāhā || 
oṃ satvahitāyai svāhā || oṃ saṃgrāmottāraṇīyai svāhā || oṃ prajñāpāramitāyai 
svāhā || oṃ āryyatārāyai svāhā || oṃ dudubhiśvarāyai svāhā || oṃ saṃkhiṇīyai 
svāhā || oṃ vidyārājñai svāhā || oṃ priyaṃvadāyai svāhā || oṃ caṃdrānanāyai 
svāhā || oṃ mahāgaurīyai svāhā ||

<p. 191a> oṃ ajitāyai svāhā || oṃ pītavāsasāyai svāhā || oṃ mahāmāyai svāhā || oṃ 
duṣṭasatvāyai svāhā || oṃ sunandinīyai svāhā || oṃ nīsundanīyai svāhā || oṃ 
praśāntāyai svāhā || oṃ śāntarūpāyai svāhā || oṃ vijayāyai svāhā || oṃ 
jvalanaprabhāyai svāhā || oṃ vidyunmāraṇīyai svāhā || oṃ dhvajīkhaḍgīyai 
svāhā || oṃ cakrīcāpīyai svāhā || oṃ jaṭāyudhāyai svāhā || oṃ jambhanīyai 
svāhā || oṃ stambhanīyai svāhā || oṃ kālarātrīyai svāhā || oṃ niśācarīyai svāhā 
|| oṃ rakṣaṇīyai svāhā || oṃ mohaṇīyai svāhā || oṃ śāntāyai svāhā || oṃ 
krāntāyai svāhā || oṃ raudrīyai svāhā || oṃ viniśubhāyai svāhā || oṃ 
brāhmaṇīyai svāhā || oṃ vedamātāyai svāhā ||

<p. 191b> oṃ guhyamātāyai svāhā || oṃ guhyavāśinīyai svāhā || oṃ māṃgalyāyai 
svāhā || oṃ śākarīyai svāhā || oṃ saumyāyai svāhā || oṃ jātavedāyai svāhā || oṃ 
manojavāyai svāhā || oṃ kāpāliṇīyai svāhā || oṃ mahāvegāyai svāhā || oṃ 
saṃdhyāparājitāyai svāhā || oṃ satyāparājitāyai svāhā || oṃ sārthavāhāyai 
svāhā || oṃ kṛpāviṣṭāyai svāhā || oṃ naṣṭamārgapradarśaṇīyai svāhā || oṃ 
varadāyai svāhā || oṃ śāśaṇīyai svāhā || oṃ śāntiyai svāhā || oṃ trirūpāyai 
svāhā || oṃ mṛtavikramāyai svāhā || oṃ śavarīyai svāhā || oṃ yoginīyai svāhā 
|| oṃ caṃḍāliyai svāhā || oṃ mṛtabāndhavāyai svāhā || oṃ dhaṃnyāyai svāhā 
|| oṃ puṇyāyai svāhā || oṃ mahābhāgāyai svāhā ||

<p. 192a> oṃ śubhagāyai svāhā || oṃ priyadarśanāyai svāhā || oṃ kṛtāntatāyai 
svāhā || oṃ śaśinibhāyai svāhā || oṃ ugrāyai svāhā || oṃ ugramahātapāyai 
svāhā || oṃ jagadekāyai svāhā || oṃ ekajaṭāyai svāhā || oṃ śaraṇyāyai svāhā 
|| oṃ bhaktivatsarāyai svāhā || oṃ vāgīśvarīyai svāhā || oṃ śivāśukṣmāyai 
svāhā || oṃ sarvvatramānuṣāyai svāhā || oṃ sarvvatrasādhaṇīyai svāhā || oṃ 
groptrīyai svāhā || oṃ dhātrīyai svāhā || oṃ dhanandāyai svāhā || oṃ gautamīyai 
svāhā || oṃ śrīlokyeśvarātmajāyai svāhā || oṃ gunānaṃtāyai svāhā || oṃ 
sarvvāsāparipuraṇīyai svāhā || oṃ tārekṛpālaṃvanīyai svāhā || oṃ 
maitryātmakaśravaṇāyai svāhā || oṃ ṛkhigana

<p. 192b> prasaste sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā nāmāparājitā 
mahāpratyaṃgirā mahāvidyārājñi namostute namo svāhā || tadyathā ||

kathaṃ bhagavan ḥ rupasyānabhinihārāya mahāpratyaṃgirābhinirhattavyā || 
vedanā || saṃjñā || saskārā || vijñāna || cakṣuṣā || śrota || ghrāna || jihvā || 
kāya || mana || rūpa || śabda || gandha || rasa || sparśa || dharmmā || cakṣu || śrota || 
ghrāna || jihvā || kāya || manasaṃsyarsapāvedanābhinihārāyaḥ 
mahāpratyaṃgirābhirnirharttavyā || pṛthivī || āpa || teja || vāyu || akāsadhātu || 
vijñāna || avidyā || saskārā || vijñānā || nāmarupa || ṣaḍāya || sparsa || vedanā 
|| tṛṣṇā || upādā || bhavāna || jātyakṣa ||

<p. 193a> jarāmaraṇa || dāna || śila || kṣānti || viryya || dhyāna || prajñāpāramitā || 
adhyātmaśunyatā || śunyatā śunyatā || mahāśunyatā || paramārthaśunyatā || 
saskṛtaśunyatā || asaskṛtaśunyatā || atyaṃtaśunyatā || anavarāgraśunyatā || 
prakṛtiśunyatā || sarvvadharmmaśunyatā || svalakṣaṇaśunyatā || 
anupalaṃbhaśunyatā || abhāvaśunyatā || svabhāvaśunyatā || 
abhāvasvabhāvaśunyatā || smṛtyupasthānā || saṃmyakprahāna || ṛddhipādā || 
indriyāṇya || balāṇya || bodhyagānya || āryyāṣṭāgamārga || āryyasatyā || 
dhyānānya || apramānānya || ārupya || vimokṣā || anupūrvva || śunyatānimitā || 
anabhi || abhijñā ||

<p. 193b> samādhya || dhāraṇīmukhā || daśatathāgatavalā || catvārivaiśāradyā || 
cataśrapratisaṃvidma || mahākarūnā || aṣṭādaśā || venīkā 
buddhadharmmasaṃghā || śrotāpattiphalā || sakṛdāgāmiphalā || anāgāmiphalā 
|| pratyakaboddhi || mārgākārajñatā || sarvvākārajñatā || evaṃ 
sarvvadharmāṇānabhirnirhārāya mahāpratyaṃgirābhirnirharttavyāḥ ||

atha bhagavatyāha || kathaṃ bhagavan sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa || śītāntapatrā 
nāmāparājitā || mahāpratyaṃgirā mahāvidyārājñā || mantrapadāniḥ 
niścaranti sma || 

oṃ namo bhagavate uṣṇīṣāya || 
candravajraprayogeṇa bhāvayadyamaghātakaṃ || 
nārāṇāṃ samanārthāya viṣopanuvasarvvata || 

rarkṣārthaṃ bhāvayadvajrapañjarasmi samākule ||

<p. 194a> vajrena bhūmi vāṭaṃ ca prākāraṃ paṃcaraṃ tathā ||
yamadhyakṣa samedeyā ca nirājā mudāruṇā ||
rephasyādi yamaghnasvā takṣakāre moha ucete ||
makārapiśuna me vākṣamekāre rāgameva ca ||
nikāre padmapāṇiśca rākāre khaḍgavānapi ||
jāṃkāre carcikā proktā vārāhī ca sakārake ||
sarasvatī ca hokāre rukāre gaurikā smṛtā ||
 ca yoni racarkoṇe catvara kanakāmatā || 
madhyavajragataṃ cinte viśvavajra bhayānakaṃ ||
yamāntakasya madhyasthaṃḥ bhāvayatkāra dāruṇāṃ ||
pūrvvāre mohavajraṃ tuḥ dakṣiṇe piśunameva ca ||
padmamadhyantu vajrantuḥ irṣyāsyanuttare tathā ||
koṇe vajracaturśūle carcikāyā dvibhāvayet ||
dvāravajra caturśūleḥ muḍgarādyā vibhāvayet ||

<p. 194b> viśvavajrantu koṇeṣuḥ catvāro nṛkamastathā ||
trimukhaṃ ṣaḍbhujaṃ krodhaḥ indranīla samaprabhā || 
pāṇau vajravibhāvitvāḥ yamārrī bhāvayedbuddhaḥ ||
trimukhaṃ ṣaḍbhujaṃ jñānaṃḥ svacchabiṃba vibhāvayet ||
pāṇau cakraprabhāvitvāḥ mohavajra vibhāvayet ||
trimukhaṃ ṣaḍbhujaṃ puṣṭiḥ saptamiṃ karacātrabhāṃ ||
pāṇau ratnavibhāvitvāḥ puśunavajraṃ vibhāvayet ||
trimukhaṃ ṣaḍbhujaṃ viśvaṃḥ padmarāga samaprabhaṃ ||
pāṇau padmaṃ vibhāvitvāḥ rāgavajraṃ vibhāvayet || 
trimukhaṃ ṣaḍbhujaṃ kharvaḥ makaṭo padmasaṃnibhaṃ ||
pāṇau koṣa vibhāvitvāḥ irṣyā vajravibhāvayet || 

imāṃ sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā || nāmāparājitā || mahā

<p. 195a> pratyaṃgirāyāṃ abhisamayādhikāraḥ ||

atha mohasvabhāvatvaṃḥ yamārīratibhīṣaṇā ||
sarvvabuddhamayaṃ śāntaḥ kāyavajra namostute ||
piśuna vajraśvabhāvatvaṃḥ yamārīratibhīṣanāḥ 
vākvajranapratīkāśaṃ ratnavajra namostute ||
rāgavajrasvabhāvastvaṃḥ rāgadharmmakara prabhūḥ ||
sarvvaghoṣavarāgrāgraḥ cittavajra namostute ||
irṣyā vajrasvabhāvastvaṃḥ yamārī sarvvakarmmaka ||
kāyavajrapratīkāśaṃḥ khaḍgavajra namostute ||
sarvvabuddhasvabhāvastvaṃḥ sarvvabuddhakasaṃgrahaṃ ||
sarvvabuddhavarāgrāgraḥ maṇḍalesaṃ namostute ||

cakṣuvajra || vajraghrānaḥ || vajrajihvā || vajrakāyaḥ || vajravākaḥ || vajracittaḥ || iti 
sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā

<p. 195b> nāmāparājitā || mahāpratyaṃgirā mahāvidyārājñāyā ||
cakṣurādyadhiṣṭāna samayādhikāraḥ ||

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣāmiḥ yamāridyāramaṇḍalaṃ ||
śrīyamāri pratikāśaṃḥ sarvvakāmārthasādhakaṃ ||
navena sunidyuktenaḥ sumānena vadāruṇā ||
sūtrena sūtrayetprājñoḥ yamaghnasya hitamaṇḍalaṃ || 
salakṣaṇāni saṃpūrṇaṃḥ sarvvavighnavināśanaṃ ||
śāntikā hi pramāṇenaḥ maṇḍalaṃ maṇḍalākṛti ||
karmmavajraṃ likhet tatraḥ paṃcaśūra samaṃtataḥ ||
tasya madhye likhedvajraṃḥ vajrajvālā samākulaṃ ||
pūrvvadvāre likheccakraḥ dakṣiṇe kuliśaṃ likhet ||
paścime padmapuṣpantuḥ sakahaṃ vikacānanaṃ ||
uttarenyotpalaṃ pītaṃḥ paṃca rasmi samaprabhaṃ ||

<p. 196a> muḍgaraṃ pūrvato dvāreḥ daṇḍadakṣiṇayostathā ||
paṃkajaṃ paścimadvāreḥ uttare khaḍgavajrina ||
niṣpannamaṇḍalaṃ jñātvāḥ pūjāṃ kuryyā viśyeṣataḥ ||
paṃcakāmaguṇairbuddhāḥ pūjayedabhisaṃkara ||

iti śrīsarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā || 

nāmāparājitā mahāpratyaṃgirāyāṃ maṇḍalāddhikāraḥ ||

atha bhagavantaḥ sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa || mahāpratyagirā mahāvidyārājñī 
nāmadhyayaṃ māsa || 
maṇḍalaṃ likhito nāmaḥ sarvvapāpavināsakam ||
yamaghnamaṇḍalaṃ ghoraṃḥ sarvvamaṇḍalanāyakaṃ ||

oṃ ā hūṁḥ || jihvā vajraprayogenaḥ toṣanaṃ sarvvavajriṇaṃ ||
praveśya sarvvasaṃbuddhāḥ jñānākārā svabhāvakaṃ ||
karṣanā vaiśane caivaḥ bandhanaṃ ca vaśaṃ tathā ||

<p. 196b> maṇḍalādi catudvipaḥ samāṣṇaṃ ca vibhāvayet ||
mahiṣavajravibhāvatvāḥ maṇḍalesaṃ vibhāvayet || 
sveṣṭāmaṇḍalamadhyasthaṃḥ bhāvyet mohavajrinaṃ ||
saptasaptikamadhyasthaṃḥ piśunāṣyaṃ vicintayat ||
raktamaṇḍalamadhyasthaṃḥ bhāvayat rāgavajrināṃ ||
karmmamaṇḍalamadhyasthaṃḥ bhāvayet karmmamaṃḍalaṃ ||
śāntike mohavajrantuḥ poṣṭike piśunantathā ||
vaśyāvairāgavajrenaḥ karmmavajreṇa sarvataḥ ||
nṛtailaṃ nṛkapālaṃṣṭaḥ nikleśai varttikāstathā ||
śmaśānaika jalaṃ prokṣaḥ karmmavajraprayogataḥ ||
ajane bhāvayet padmaḥ ajanāyāṃ tathaiva ca ||
anenāṃjana siddhiḥ syāḥtkarmmajātaprayogata || 
kakamaṃ gṛhyaraktenaḥ pādale vastusādhakaḥ ||

<p. 197a> karmmavajraprayogenaḥ pādalepana siddhyati ||
paṃcāmṛta samādāyaḥ paṃcamāsasamanvitaḥ || 
tilodbhavasthitaṃ padmaḥ karmmayogena siddhyati ||
kāntalohamayaṃ khaḍgaṃḥ karmmayogena sāddhayet ||
karmmavajraprayāgenaḥ karmmakhaḍga prasiddhyati ||

iti śrīsarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā ||

nāmāparājitā mahāpratyaṃgirā || mahāvidyārājñā karmmayogaddhikāra ||

atha bhagavān sarvvatathāgataḥ bhagavantaṃ mahāvajadharanāmādhyetitavantaḥ 
|| kathaṃsatvā pravarttanteḥ karmmabheda prabhedataḥ || kathayaśva mahāvajaḥ 
śunyantu jñānasāgaraḥ || atha vajradharārājāḥ sarvvakarmmaprasādhakaḥ ||

<p. 197b> sarvvadokhacikitsāmāḥ idaṃ vacanamavravīt || 
yamāyantrāni bhūtāniḥ na bhūto na bhaviṣyati || 
strīṇāṃ vasyāya karttavyaṃḥ rakṣārthāṃ yathaiva ca ||
śāntike locanā gṛhyaḥ tturyyavaṃśatva ce tathā || 
cakradvayamabhilikhyaḥ namo namavidarbhitaṃ ||
kālasutrādibhītenaḥ sarāvadvayasaṃpute ||
ghṛta madhumadhyakṣipyaḥ śuklasutrena veṣṭayet ||
trisaṃdhya śuklapuṣpantuḥ arccayet pūrvvato mukhaṃ || 
karmmāntakaṃ candrakāntāḥ bhaṃ dhyātvātmānaṃ puraṃ nyaset ||
candramaṇḍalamārūddhaṃḥ sādhyadṛṣṭā vicintayet ||
śītakiraṇaistu candrābhaiḥ paṃcāmṛtābhipūritaiḥ ||
siṃcyateneka saṃbuddhaiḥ tadṛṣṭā japamārabhet ||

oṃ jrīṁḥ vikṛtānana hūṁ phaṭ ||

<p. 198a> namo devadattāya śāntiṃ kuru svāhā ||
puruṣāṇāṃ śāntike lekhyaṃ kuṃkumai pauṣṭikaṃ tathā ||
cakradvayaṃ tu kāśmireḥ svāhānāmapi dabhitaṃ ||
sādhyasya nāmamādāyaḥ āryyakṣudreṣu nikṣipet ||
sarāvasaṃpuṭe sthāsyaḥ pītaśutreṇa veṣṭayet ||
trisaṃdhyaṃ pītapuṣpantuḥ accayeduttarāmukhaṃ ||
pītavarṇayamagnaṃ vaiḥ ātmānaṃ balaṃ caret ||
sādhyaṃ sapītacandrasthaṃḥ pītakumbhaistu siñcayet ||
abhiṣeka bhāvayitvā caḥ puṣṭikartu sphala jayet ||
oṃ jrīṁḥ ṣṭīṁḥ vikṛtānana hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
oṃ laṃ devadattasya puṣṭiṃ kuru svāhā ||
oṃ vauṣaṭ devadattasya puṣṭiṃ kuru svāhā ||
śmaśāne cailake vāpiḥ svayaṃbhū liptakarppaṭe ||
cakradvayaṃ samāliṣyaḥ lakṣayā rakṣamiśrayā ||

<p. 198b> jaṃkāre jrīṁḥkārenaḥ nāmaṃ caiva vidarbhitaṃ ||
yoṣitāṃ padmabhāṇḍe vāḥ saṃpuṭe sthāpya pūjayet ||
raktaśutrena cāvṛtyaḥ raktapuṣpena pūjayet ||
saṃdhārkasaṃnnibhaṃ raktaṃḥ ātmānaṃ bhuvi cintayet ||
dakṣiṇābhimukhā yogīḥ mohena maṇḍalāśriyā ||
pītaṃ sādhya viciṃtyāsuḥ ākrāntaṃ parvvate nyeset ||
viśvavajrasamākrāntaḥ mohendramaṇḍalādhataḥ ||
maṇḍalādinage ghoraiḥ pralayānalasaṃnibhaiḥ ||
akrāntaṃ bhāvaye sādhyaḥ yatra yatrai ca kārayet ||

oṃ jrīṁ ṣṭīṁ vijṛtānana hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || 
laṁ devadattasya sthānaṃ stambhaya hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

ityāha bhagavān sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa bhāvanā ||
vidarbhasādhya nāmāniḥ tato mantraṃ sphalaṃ jayet ||

laṃ devadattasya

<p. 199a> yathā procakārppatannivārayato rūpakaṃ vadato yajñadattasya vā 
kustambhanaṃ kuruḥ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
atyantaṃ tatsaguptena idaṃ kāryyā yathoditaṃ ||
dinamekena siddhi syāt ḥ mahāyamāriyogataḥ ||
smasānakappaṭha cakraḥ dvaye cai ca likhedvratī ||
rājikālavaṇe vāpi śeṣa niṃbakena ca ||
trikatu taila śmaśānāṃḥ gārayāmirameva ca ||
dhattarapatraniryāsaiḥ ścandrabījaistathaiva ca ||
tarjaṇī raktamādāyaḥ citrakasya rasya navā ||
uṣaramṛttikāṃ gṛhyaḥ caṇḍarahaṇḍikāṃjanaṃ ||
vubhūjipatraleṣinyāḥ catuddaśyāṃ likhedvratī ||
madhyāhne krodhacittena draṃṣṭrāṇāṃ varddha hetuṇāṃ ||
nāmasatvavidyātasyaḥ hūṃkāreṇa vidarbhayet ||
dakṣiṇābhimukhāyogīḥ ātmānaṃ yamaghāṭakaṃ ||

<p. 199b> krodharūpaṃ mahādaṇḍaṃḥ khaṇḍamaṇḍa vibhūṣitaṃ ||
mahaṣasthaṃ lalajihvāḥ vikhadudara bhayānakā ||
udārorddhayutaṃ kesaṃḥ vabhusma sarvvatastathā ||
dakṣiṇena mahāvajraṃḥ khaḍganaiva dvitīyakaṃ ||
tṛtīye kartikahastaṃḥ idānīṃ vāmato liṣet ||
cakranaiva mahāpadmaṃḥ kapālaṃ vāmakaṃ mataṃ ||
mūlamukhaṃ mahāśṛṅgaḥ dakṣiṇe candra suprabhaṃ ||
vāmaraktaṃ mahāproktaṃḥ vajrobharanabhūṣitaṃ ||
romakupa mahāvivaḥ rāsphorayet svakulādhipaṃ ||
pratyāliḍhapadaṃ sasthaṃḥ sūryyamaṇḍala ūrddhataṃ ||
vikṛdraṣṭrākarālāsyaṃḥ kalpajvālāgni sannibhaṃ ||
evaṃ ātmāna saṃtyajyaḥ sādhyaṃ vai purato nyaset ||
malinaṃ jarjjararogaiḥ duṣṭamātraiśca pāṇina ||

<p. 200a> bimbastraṃ vayamārantuḥ khinnakāya praṇānvitaṃ ||
gaṇḍamālāvṛto saṃ caḥ śastrena jarjjarī kṛtaṃ ||
upadrutaṃ śītavāteḥ na bahumadhya samāśritaṃ ||
mahiṣeṇa vyāghrenaḥ kukkurairdīrgha tuṇḍakaiḥ ||
khādyamānaṃ mahāduṣṭaiḥrbuddhamainya vīnāsanaṃ ||
antako dalamadhyasthaṃḥ kaṇḍakairgātra puritaṃḥ ||
haṇḍinī gaḍaparākāntaḥ khaṇḍa khaṇḍaṃ kṛtaṃ tathā ||
niśramiśūkvataṃ dhyāyāḥ drājikāvaraṇepitaṃ ||
śrīkāramuccaraṃ dhyāyāḥ ttasya dehasya lakṣaṇe ||
kavacaṃ sphotaye tasya bhāvayatvidhi pūjaya ||

śunyadehava || ātmadeho bhave krodhaiḥ yamamāryyātmamūrttibhiḥ ||
ghātyaṃtaṃ bhāvayettatraḥ pīvantī mekamarjakaṃ ||
taśyāgrai tu yamadhyāyāḥddaṇḍahastaṃ mahābalaṃ ||
evaṃ viciṃtya sādhyavoḥ karūṇāghṛṣṭa cetasā ||

<p. 200b> vyaropayati saṃsārāḥ buddhakṣatreṣu jāyate ||
aho hi māraṇaṃ nāmaḥ māraṇaṃ na ca māraṇaṃ ||
pāpetva mucyate yasmāt ḥ mārito na ca māritaḥ ||
kṛtvāpasahasrāṇiḥ avīcyādiṣu saṃcaret ||
aho buddhasya māritoḥ bodhisatvamāpnuyāt ||
bhūyasī karūṇā kṛtvāḥ satvaghātintu cintayet ||
aho kṛpābalaṃ divyaṃḥ kṛpāhīno na siddhyati ||

iti śrīsarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā || 

nāmāparājitā mahāpratyaṃgirā mahāvidyārājñiyāṃ ||
kāyavākcitta stambhanādhikāraḥ ||

atha cakradvayaṃ likhyaḥ phaṭkāre vidarbhitaṃ ||
sādhyasya nāmamādyayaḥ kapālasaṃkuṭe nyaset || 

nīlasūtreṇa veṣṭitvāḥ śmaśāneṣu likhānayet ||

<p. 201a> yamāntaka samālambyaḥ sādhyaṃ vai purato nyaset ||
aśvamahiṣamārūḍhaḥ dvau sādhya śastrapāninau ||
nimittakrodhasaṃghātaiḥrdvayoryakṣaṃ viciṃtayet ||

oṃ hrīṁḥ ṣṭrīṁḥ vikṛtānana hūṁ phaṭ devadatta yajñadattakena saha vidveṣaye hūṁ 
phaṭ svāhā ||

ālekhya dvaya cakrākhyaḥ viddhinā tenaiva pūrvvavat ||
hūṁ phaṭkāra vidarbhenaḥ kapālaṃ saṃpūtaṃ nyaset ||
kṛṣṇasūtrena veṣṭitvāḥ sabhavene nikhānayat ||
yamāntakayogamādāyaḥ etaiḥ sādhya vibhāvayat ||
mama satvānāṃ ca rakṣāṃ kurvantu || 
guptiṃ paritrānaṃ parigrahaṃ paripālanaṃ ||
śāntiṃ svastyayanaṃ || daṇḍaparihāraṃ sastraparihāraṃ || 
viṣadūṣanaṃ viṣanāsanaṃ || śīmābandhanaṃ

<p. 201b> dharaṇībandhanañca kurvantu jīvantu ||
varṣasataṃ paśyantu śaradāśataṃ ||

mama cāpanayantu || bhūtapretabetāḍa ḍākinī jvalo daṇḍakā ca kuṇḍakiti 
makuṣṭakapittaka plīhapāmā ||
bhagadaralutā vai sarvvalohaliṃgaśvaṣambā ||
śakāmucchāgalaviṣayoga agnyudakamārakaraha ||
vairikāntāra akālamṛtyutpramvaka ||
tailāḍhuka vicikitsakasarpanakula || siṃha vyāghra mṛkṣata rakṣu ||
bhramaramarkaṭa viṭarka skandhamārakādinā || mapanayantu || anyeṣāṃ 
sarvveṣāṃ || sitāntapatrā nāmāparājitā || mahāpratyaṃjñīrā 
mahāvidyārājñānubhāvena || dvādaśajojanātyantareṇa vā || 
pañcaśatajojanātyaṃtareṇa vā || vidyābandhanaṃ karomi

<p. 202a> tejo baṃdhaṃ karomi || sarvvavidyābaṃdhaṃ karomī || 
paravidyābaṃdhaṃ karomī || śīmābaṃdhaṃ karomī || 
dharaṇībaṃdhaṃ karomī || daśadigbaṃdhaṃ karomī || 
ākāsabadhaṃ karomī || parasainya stambhanaṃ karomī || tadyathā ||

oṃ anale (2) acale (2) khakhame (2) vikhade (2) viṣame (2) bale (2) vaire (2) saumya (2) śānte (2) 
dānte (2) vajradharabandha (2) vajrapāṇi hūṁ phaṭ ||
oṃ vajrapāṇibandha (2) vajrapāṇena sarvvaduṣṭavighnavināyakān hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ 
phaṭ svāhā || hūṁ bandha (2) hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

iti śrīsarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā nāmāparājitā || mahāpratyaṃgirā 
mahāvijñārājñīyāṃ || sarvvamāra sainyatāḍana bandhanādi 
sādhanādhikāraḥ || 

athāto locanā caivaḥ kāśmiraṃ ca visyaṣataḥ ||

<p. 202b> bhūrja vā karppate vāpiḥ arakukarasena vāḥ ||
raktacandana kenāpiḥ anāmā rūdhireva tu ||
cakradvayaṃ samāliṣyaḥ hākārena vidarbhitaṃ ||
kārāddhi rahite yatraḥ sarāva dvaya saṃpute ||
āryyamākṣipta saṃpūrṇaḥ raktasatreṇa pyaṣṭayet ||
caryyayadraktapuṣpenaḥ paścimābhimuṣasasthitaṃ ||
raktavarṇa mahojvālāḥ ātmānaṃ yamaghātakaṃ ||
ratnasūryyasamārūḍhaṃḥ sādhyaṃ caiva vicintayet ||
svakāyanigato raktaḥ mayukhai raṃkuśākṛtī ||
sādhyamākarṣaya dṛṣṭvāḥ yutamātraphalaṃ jayet ||
pūrvvasya vāyutaṃ japtvāḥ idaṃ karmmapraśādhakaṃ ||
taṃ sādhya cihnalībhūtaṃḥ pādayo patitaṃ tathā ||
vipastaṃ urddhakeśaṃ caḥ cintaye japamārabhet ||

<p. 203a> sādhya yatra na gacchantiḥ tanumantraṃ tāpayattata ||
ghṛtādirahitaṃ kṛtvāḥ nirddha śaṃkhādināna ca ||
oṃ hrīṁ ṣṭroṁ vikṛtānana hūṁ phaṭ ho svāhā ||

iti śrīsarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā || nāmāparājitā mahāpratyaṃgirā || 
mahāvidyārājñīyāṃ || cakrānupūrvvadhikāraḥ ||

atha mantraṃ pravakṣāmiḥ sarvvabhūtabali kriyā ||
uccārite mahāmantreḥ sarvvabhūtaprakaṃpanaḥ ||

indrāya hrīṁ || yamāya ṣṭriṁ || varūṇāya vīṁ || kuvyarāya krīṁ || agnaye taṁḥ || 
nai(-)ṛtye naḥ || vāyuve naḥ || iśānāya hūṁ || candrāya hūṁ || arkāya phaṭ || 
brahmaṇe phaṭ || vemacitrine svāhā || sarvvabhūtebhyaḥ hā hā hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ 
phaṭ svāhā ||

devatā prīṇaye yogī hāhākāraṃ pura smaret ||

<p. 203b> kṛtvā ca malikāstistoḥ aṣṭau dvādaśa ṣoḍaśāt ||
sallikhya vidhinā prājñoḥ nyese mantrāṇi sarvvataḥ ||
nyasenmantrāṇi siddhyantiḥ koṣṭake dvādaśedvratī ||
siddhyate śeṣaniḥśeṣaḥ trailokye sa carācaraṃ ||
yamarājā sadā meyeḥ medo varuṇayodayaḥ ||
yadayonirjayo yakṣāḥ yakṣa yacca nirāmayaḥ ||
yamadhyakṣanyaśyatpūrvaḥ dakṣiṇe mañju ghoṣakaṃ ||
mekāre paścime lekhyaḥ uttare dantadhāvanaḥ ||
sādhyasya nāmamādāyaḥ śūnyavidiśi dhārayet ||
hūṁ tyāṃ virgataṃ kṛtvāḥ sarvvakāryyāni sādhayet ||
yacca samādārūṇayoḥ nira ityādi vāhyate ||
vāmamāritya saṃlikhyaḥ sarvvathāya praśādhanaṃ ||
tṛtiyakāṣṭake purataḥ ekānte kaṣṭake liṣet ||

<p. 204a> oṃ hrīṁḥ ṣṭrīṁḥ vikṛtānana hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
sukaṃ kuru māraya || uccāṭaya || vaśī kuru || vidveṣaya || śāntiṃ kuru || 
ityevamādikarmmānurūpataḥ || pramānavādimotā cā || ante voṣaṭ hūṁ phaṭ ||
kārāntayutabījāni śānti puṣṭiṃ vaśākṛti ||

iti śrīsarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā || nāmāparājitā mahāpratyaṃgirā 
mahāvidyārājñīyāṃ || cakrāvalokano nāmādhikāraḥ ||

atha bhagavāna varūṇādināgānāṃ saparivārāya || 
varūṇo nāgarājāmañjuśrīnāgarājā || manicuḍo nāgarājā || 
maṇirnāgarājā || maṇikaṇṭho nāgarājā || mālirnāgarājā || raktamārirnāga

<p. 204b> rājā || śītānāgarājā || vatsonāgarājā || bhadronāgarājā || subhdaro 
nāgarājā || dundubhirnāgarājā || upadundubhirnāgarājā || āmratīrtho 
nāgarājā || maṇisuto nāgarājā || dhṛtarāṣṭro nāgarājā || virūḍhako 
nāgarājā || virupākṣo nāgarājā || vaiśavano nāgarājā || sakatamukho 
nāgarājā || cāṃpeyako nāgarājā || campaka nāgarājā || gautamo nāgarājā || 
pāṃcālo nāgarājā || paṃcacuḍo nāgarājā || pradyumno nāgarājā || 
vidyutsaṃbhavo nāgarājā || avabhāsaśīrṣo nāgarājā || mahāmeghavikurvito 
nāgarājā || mahāmeghavidyotano nāgarājā || mahāmeghasphotano nāgarājā || 
meghagarjito nāgarājā || varṣaśaṃbhavo nāgarājā ||

<p. 205a> ulkāpāto nāgarājā || avakāragarjito nāgarājā ||
garjasvaro nāgarājā || mahāphuru (2) nāgarājā || mahāḥphuru (2) prabho 
nāgarājā || śrītejo nāgarājā || śrīdharo nāgarājā || mahāḥ gurū (2) śabdo 
nāgarājā || kili (2) śabdo nāgarājā || mahāvaravikurvito nāgarājā ||
vātapramocano nāgarājā || meghasphoto nāgarājā || śrīdhano nāgarājā ||
meghanandito nāgarājā || meghasaṃjñā nāgarājā || meghasutro nāgarājā ||
meghamaṇḍalasaṃchādano nāgarājā || aparājito nāgarājā || 
meghāṃvaro nāgarājā || vātasaṃbhavo nāgarājā || vātakṣobhyo nāgarājā ||
manicūḍo nāgarājā || maniliṃgo nāgarājā || ratnacuro

<p. 205b> nāgarājā || saraśvatikuṇḍo nāgarājā || suśīrṣo nāgarājā || anya ca 
sarvvato nāgarājā || mañjuvajranāma nāgarājā || 

kālena kālaṃ varṣayanti || kārena kālaṃ garjayanti || kālena kālaṃ 
mautsukyamāpatsyanti || sarvvarogopadravāśca praśamayikhyanti || 
mama sarvvasatvānāñca śāntiṃ kṛtvā bhaviṣyanti ||
ete sarvvanāgarājā pūrvvaṃ gamai || caturaśītināgagaṇa koṭiniyūta 
śatasahasrai || sannipatitātai || sanniṣannaḥ || tena ṣalu puna samayana || 
sarvvanāgarājā saparivārā || utthāyā sanyatya || ekāṃśamuttarāṃ saṃgaṃ 
kṛtvā || dakṣiṇaṃ jānumaṇḍalaṃ nipṛthivyāṃ || pratiṣṭhāpya yena bhagavān 
tenāṃjaliṃ kṛtvā pranamyā pramyayāsaṃkhyayai ||

<p. 206a> paramavividharūcirai || puṣpa dhūpa dīpa gaṃdha raśasparśa mālya 
vilepana || cūrṇacīvara chatra dhvaja vajraghaṇṭhā patākā || paṭṭadāmavādya 
tūryyatāḍāvacarasaṃgīti || ratnakusuma ratnapadmamuktāhāra || 
nāgapuṣpamuktājārai jagato || guḍaguḍāyamāno || mahāvātapravādyante || 
mahānādavadanto ramaṇīyāśca || dhammanāde nadanto || mahatā gurūgaurava 
vicitrākārena || bhagavantamabhichādayanta || pradakṣiṇī kurvanti sma || 
pradakṣiṇyai kṛtyai kānte tasthuḥ || ekānte sthitāḥ praṇidhānāni kurvvanti sma || 
sarvvalokadhātu samudreṣu pṛthivyāptaijo vāyuparamāṇuraja || 
sarvvarūpāvabhāsasamaparamānurajasa ||

<p. 206b> ekaika kasmin parimāṇurajasi ||
sarvvagana samudrasamatikrāntau || asaṃkhyeyā pramyayā cintyānabhilāpya || 
samatikrāntau kāyasaṃghasamudraiḥ || ekasminkāle apramyayāsaṃkhyayā phaṇi 
samudrameghānadhiṣṭhāya || samantadikṣatābhimukhā || dekaikasmāt 
paramānurajobhāgā || samantādikulapharaṇai || rasaṃbhinnai sarvvapujā 
meghasamudrai || sarvvabuddha boddhisatvasamudrā || nsatkuryyāmo || mānayema 
pūjayama || yadutā prameyā saṃkhyeyā || citnyāturyyā māryyā parimānāna || 
bhilāpyairasaṃbhinnai || samantacaryyāprabhāva samudrameghaiḥ || saṃchanna 
gaganantaramadhiṣṭhāya yathā bodhisatvātmabhāva samudrameghaiḥ || evaṃ 
sarvvaratnavarṇa

<p. 207a> rasmighana sarvvasūryyacandrātmabhāvamaṇḍala samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvaratnāhārakusuma samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvaratnāvabhāsa kuṭāgāra 
samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvacūrṇa vṛkṣākāsa śamudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvagandhadhūpa sarvvarūpadarśana samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvaratnāhārakusuma 
samudrameghaiḥ sarvvaratnāvabhāsakutāgāra samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvacūrṇavṛkṣākāśa samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvagaṃdhadhūpa 
sarvvarūpadarśana samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvarūtanigarjjitavādya samudrameghaiḥ ||
sarvvagaṃdhavṛkṣe samudrameghaiḥ || saṃchannagaganantaramadhiṣthāya 
samudrameghaiḥ || 

yevaṃ pramukhairaprameyā saṃkhyeyā tulyā parimānāriyānabhilāpyai 
rasaṃbhinnai || sarvvapujāmeghai || samudrameghai ||

<p. 207b> sarvvabuddhaboddhisatvasamudrān satkuryyāmo gurūkuryyā || 
mānayāma pūjayāma || sarvvavyūhaviṣayavidyotita garbhamaṇirāja 
samudrameghaiḥ || saṃchannagaganantaramadhiṣṭhāya 
sarvvabuddhaboddhisamudrān satkuryyāmo gurukuryyāmo || mānayāma 
pūjayāma || sarvvasamantāvabhāsa ratnavarṣavyūhamaṇirāja samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvaratnāni jvālena niryyāmaṇi ghoṣamaṇirāja samudrameghaiḥ || 
samantāsphārana sarvvabuddha dharmmasaṃghanirghoṣamaṇirāja 
samudrameghaiḥ || samantamukharaśmi buddhanirmāna vabhāsa samudrameghaiḥ || 
acintyabubuddhakṣatra tathāgata vimānapratihāsa saṃdarśanamaṇirāja 
samudrameghaiḥ || ratnavicitra ratnareṇutyadhya buddhakāya pratibhāsa

<p. 208a> vairocanamaṇirāja samudrameghaiḥ || saṃchannagaganantaramadhiṣṭhāya 
sarvvabuddha boddhisatvasamudrān satkuryyāmo gurukuryyāmo || mānayāma || 
pūjayāma || asaṃbhinnai || sarvvaratnagaṃdha vicitrapuṣpakuṭāgāra 
samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvamukhāhāra vicitrakūṭāgāra samudrameghaiḥ ||
sarvvapuṣpakesara samudrameghaiḥ || anaratnahāra samalaṃkṛta kuṭāgāra 
samudrameghaiḥ || sachannagagaṇantaramadhiṣṭhāya samudrameghaiḥ || 
daśadigspharana samudrameghaiḥ || samanantararaśmijyoti garbhavyūha 
samasatvaratnakuṭāgāra samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvaratnarenupratimaṇivitānakavyūha sabdāmana kuṭāgāra samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvavyūhapratimaṇḍita samanantararaśmispharana

<p. 208b> kuṭāgāra samudrameghaiḥ || samantamukha 
puṣpatoraṇaghaṇṭājālāvalaṃvita samudrameghaiḥ || 
saṃchannagagaṇantaramadhiṣṭhāya sarvvabuddhaboddhisatvasamudrān 
satkuryyāmo gurukruyyāmo || mānayāma pūjayāma || 
kāṃcanaratnavicitrasutrahāra ratnavarṣagarbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ ||
kusumavabhāsavicitragarbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || 
indranīlajāmbunadapadma vicitragarbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || ratna 
pratimaṇḍita padmavicitragarbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvaratnajvālāni 
śṛtapadmagarbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || buddharūpanirghoṣa 
raśmipadmagarbha siṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || asabhinnasaṃchanna 
gaganantaramaddhiṣṭhāya sarvvabuddha

<p. 209a> bodhisatvasamudrān satkuryyāmo gurukuryyāmo || mānayāma pūjayāma 
|| sarvvagandhamaṇi vicitravṛkṣa samudrameghaiḥ || samantamukhapatrāṃjalimegha 
niśaranagaṃdhavṛkṣa samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvavyūhanisṛtānantakāśavṛkṣa 
samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvavṛkṣarūpāṇaikavyūhasaṃdarśanavṛkṣa 
samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvakusumameghapratilabddhavṛkṣa samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvarupanirgoṣanigarjjita manojñanirghoṣasamaṃtapramuṃcanavṛkṣa 
samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvabodhisatvā maṇḍalavicitravyūhaprabhā vṛkṣa 
devatānanta || sarvvaratnavastrakośa sūryyavighāṭi vṛkṣa samudrameghaiḥ || 
anantavarṇa ratnapadmagarbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || samantāni 
mukhamaṇirājavidyotita garbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ ||

<p. 209b> sarvvālaṃkāravyūhapratimaṇḍita garbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || 
vicitraratnārci pradīpamālā garbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || 
samantanirghoṣaratnāni saranagarbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvagaṃdhakusumapadmahāraratna garbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvabuddhāsanavyūhasaṃdarśanamaṇirājagarbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || 
ratnavyūhahārapralaṃvitoranacaṇḍikāpratimaṇḍitaratna 
garbhameghasiṃghāsana samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvadrumamaṇiratnaśāṣāvarṇakāśa siṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || 
vicitragaṃdharatna kikinījālasamaṃtālaṃkāra sūryyāvidyotita 
garbhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || sachannagaganantaramadhiṣṭhāya 
sarvvabuddha

<p. 210a> bodhisatvasamudrātsatkuryyāmo gurukuryāmo || mānayāma pūjayāma || 
sarvvacintāmaṇi rājavitāna samudrameghaiḥ || indranīlamaniratnakeśara 
sarvvapuṣpavyūha cintāmani samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvagandhamaṇivitāna 
samudrameghaiḥ || ratnārci pradīpavigrahavitāna samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvabuddhavinidarśana prabhāmaṇḍalanirghoṣa maṇirāja samudrameghaiḥ || 
vicitramaṇivastrasarvavyūha prabhāsasaṃdarśana vitāna samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvapuṣpādyajvālāvabhāśaratnavitāna samudrameghaiḥ || 
vicitraghaṇṭhāsamantanirghoṣa spharaṇajvālāvitāna samudrameghaiḥ || 
anantavarṇa padmajālavicitramaṇikaphatikāya padmajālavitāna samudrameghaiḥ || 
śubharṇa keśa rasmijyotita

<p. 210b> dhvajavitāna samudrameghaiḥ || acintyavyūha pratibhāsa 
sarvvavyūhasiṃhāsana samudrameghaiḥ || saṃchannagagaṇantaramadhiṣṭhāya 
sarvvabuddhaboddhisatvā karuṇāmukhānirghoṣa maṇirājachatra samudrameghaiḥ 
|| vicitraratnārcimālāchatra samudrameghaiḥ || samantaratnareṇuprabhā 
samantamaṇḍita ghaṇṭājālapralavita vicitrachatra samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvamanidruma śāṣālaṃkārachatra samudrameghaiḥ || surkavilocanārci 
maṇirāja sarvvagandhapuṣpadhūpachatra samudrameghaiḥ || candranacūrṇakāśa 
samantaspharanachatra samudrameghaiḥ || vicitravipulabuddhaviṣavidyotita 
samantavyūhaspharaṇachatra samudrameghaiḥ || asaṃbhinnaiḥ sarvvabuddha 
boddhisatvasamudrān

<p. 211a> satkuryyā gurūkuryāmo || mānayāma pūjayāma || 
sarvvaratnāvabhāsamaṇḍala samudrameghaiḥ || asaṃbhinnai sarvvaratnārci 
grahaprabhāmaṇḍala samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvakuśumameghavidyotita 
prabhāmaṇḍala samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvaratnaraśmi buddhanirmmāna 
prabhāmaṇḍala samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvabuddhachatra prabhāsāntargata 
prabhāmaṇḍala samudrameghaiḥ || samantamukha buddhaviṣayanigarjanaratnasāṣā 
prabhāmaṇḍala samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvaturyyaratnagotra maṇirājarasmi 
prabhāmaṇḍala samudrameghaiḥ || anantasatvārūpavicitralakṣaṇasaṃdarśana 
prabhāmaṇḍala samudrameghaiḥ || sarvvabuddhapranidhānasambhava 
manojñaninādapramuṃcana prabhāmaṇḍala samudrameghaiḥ || 
sarvvaparṣaṇamaṇḍala

