sādhāraṇaṃ kṛtvā || anuttarāyāṃ saṃmyaksaṃbodhau pariṇāmayati || 
taccānupalambhayoge bhāvayati || tacca sarvvasatvānāṃ || anuḥmodanā sahagata 
puṇyakriyāvastuḥ || śrāvakayānikānāñca || pratyekabuddhayānikānāñca || 
dānamayaṃ puṇyakriyāvantu ||

<p. 227a> śīlamayaṃ bhāvanāmayaṃ puṇyakṛyāvastuḥ || idamavataśa || 
boddhisatvasya mahāsatvasyā || nanumodanā sahagata puṇyakriyāvastuḥ || 
sarvvasatvai sārddhaṃ || sādhāraṇaṃ kṛtvānuttarāyā || saṃmyaksaṃbodhaya 
parināmitaṃ || sahasrammākhyāyate || jyeṣṭamāṣyāyato || pravaramākhyāyate || 
praṇītamākhyāyate || anuttaramāṣyāyate || niruttaramākhyāyate || 
asamamākhyāyate || asamasamamākhyāyate || tatkasya heto || 

imāṃ sarvvagatoṣṇīṣaśītāntapatrā || nāmāparājitā || mahāpratyaṃgirā || 
