teṣāṃ śītāntapatrā nāmāparājitā || mahāpratyaṃgirā mahāvidyārājñī || 
prathamacittotpāda || dharmmo deśanāsaṃbhāṣamupadāya || yāvadanuttarāyā 
saṃmyaksaṃboddhi || mabhisaṃbuddhānāṃ yāvanupaddhiśeṣa || nirvānadhātau 
parinivṛttānāṃ || yāvat sadharmāntarahāri || etasminuttare || 
yatkīcitkuśalamūlaṃ || ṣatpāramitā pratisaṃyuktaṃ || yacca tekhāṃ śrāvaka || 
yāna saṃprasthitāṃ || dānamayaṃ puṇyakriyāvastu śṛṇvanti || śīlamayaṃ 
puṇyakriyāvastu || bhāvanāmayaṃ 

<p. 230a> puṇyakṛyāvastu || yāni ca śaikṣaśaiṣāṇāṃ kuśalamulānyabalāśye || 
yāni yāniyaśca || teṣāṃ tathāgatānāṃ 'rhatā || saṃmyaksaṃbuddhānāṃ || 
śīlaskandha || samādhiskandha || vimuktijñānadarśanaskandha || yā ca hiteṣitā ca 
yā || mahākaruṇā asaṃkhyayā prameyāśca || tai buddhai bhagavadbhi || 
dharmmodeśīto || ye ca tasyā dharmmadeśanāyā || śikṣitvaṃ 
śrotāpattiphalamanuprāptā || arhatvaṃ pratyeka boddhimanuprāptaḥ || 
boddhisatvanyā mama vakrāntā || teṣāṃ ca yāni kuśalamūlāni || yaiśca tatra 
tathāgateṣu || tiṣṭhatsu vā parinirvrateṣu || kuśalamulānyabalopitāni || 
tatsarvvamabhisaṃkṣipyā || prameyānumodanīyā'numodate ||

<p. 230b> jyeṣṭhayā śreṣṭhayā || varayā pravarayā || praṇitayā uttarayā || 
niruttarayā || asvakhyeyā || asamasayā || anamodayā namodate || evamanumode 
tadanumodanā || sahagataṃ puṃṇyakriyāvastu || sarvvasatvai sārddhaṃ || 
sādhāranaṃ kṛtvā || nuttarāyā saṃmyaksaṃbodhau || parināma yatyanuttarāyā 
|| saṃmyaksaṃboddhau rāhārakaṃ bhavatvitī ||

yatpunaraparaṃ boddhisatva || yāna saṃpratisthitarevamāha || tathā 
cittaparināmayati || yairānambaṇivastu || bhistacittanutpannamapinuttarāyā || 
mapinutānivastu || nitānyonambanāṇi yathopalabhyato || yathātai kulaputrai || 
nimittīkṛtāni ||

<p. 231a> imāṃ sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa śītāntapatrā nāmāparājitā ||
mahāpratyaṃgirā || mahāvidyārājñī || natoni vastuni natānyā || rambanāni 
tathā parabhyate yathātai boddhisatvayānikai || kulaputranimittīkṛtyā || nuttarāyā 
saṃmyaksaṃboddhau parināmitāni || punaraparaṃ || sarvvatathāgatoṣṇīṣa 
śītāntapatrā || nāmāparājitā || mahāpratyaṃgirā || mahāvidyārājñī || yadi 
tāvadaśaviyānaivastu || bhinasaṃvidyamānai || āraṃvanaiste buddhā bhagavanto 
nimittikṛtā || 

tadaśadiglokadhātuṣu yāni teṣāṃ || kuśalamūlāni || yānyāśyekṣānāṃ 
kamupādāya || yāvat saddharmma sthiti || yāni ca teṣāṃ śrāvaka pratyeka 
buddhayānikānāṃ ||

<p. 231b> kulaputrāṇāṃ || kuladuhitṛṇāṃ ca || kuśalamūlamūlāni || 
śailāṇiyāṇyāśekṣāṇāṃ || kuśalamūlāni || yāvat sarvvamabhisaṃkṣipya || 
piṃḍīkṛtyānuttarāyā || saṃmyaksaṃboddhi parināmitaṃ || nimitta yogena 
māhaivāsya || saṃjñāviparyāsottata || yathaivānitye'tinityamiti || 
saṃjñāviparyyāsaścītta viparyyā || dṛṣṭi viparyāsa || duḥkhasukhamiti || 
saṃjñāviparyyāsāḥ || dṛṣṭiviparyyāsa || anāsasamiti || saṃjñāviparyyākā || 
ścittaviparyyāsau || dṛṣṭi viparyyāsaḥ || asubha śubhamiti || saṃjñāviparyyāsa || 
ścittaviparyyāso || dṛṣṭiviparyyāsaḥ || athaivā puna || kiṃ yathaivastra yathā 
raṃvaṇaṃ || tathā boddhistathā cittamitiḥ ||

