kalīyugasamayasaṃḥcitta thīramajuyakaṃḥ cokahmayāvoyāgulidonathāsaṃḥ 
kṣemāyā yamālaguṇīkaṃ || 

[yādṛṣṭaṃ puṣṭakaṃ dṛṣṭvāḥ tādṛṣṭaṃ likhitaṃ mayā] || 

yadī suddhamasuddhambāḥ mama dokho na dīyate ||
hraśva dīrgha na jānāniḥ śvodhanīyamatujanai || 
saṃpūrṇasiddhidvayaḥ putrapautrahitāya || 

[śrīśrīśrīmahāvairocanasatgurūmāhāmañjuśrīprītirastu śubhaṃ] || 

bhūyāt || 

śubhaṃ ||




